# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1279
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_49e518c2:

    # you "Interesting... Anything else you can tell me about the Prison?"
    you "很有趣...还有什么你能告诉我一些关于监狱的事情吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1281
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_43dba833:

    # carpenter "Well, sure... Get this: the Xotar Prison was not always a jail. In fact, it's built on top of a much, much older building."
    carpenter "当然有...你听好：索塔尔监狱并不仅仅是一个监狱。事实上，它建在一座更古老的建筑之上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1283
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_17647e76:

    # "Really? What kind of building?"
    "真的吗？什么样的建筑？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1285
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_86dc7068:

    # "She spits."
    "她吐了一口唾沫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1287
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_957aebe9:

    # carpenter "No one knows that, Boss. The place is real {i}ancient{/i}. Summerians built it, or sumethin'."
    carpenter "谁知道呢，老板。那地方真的太{i}古老{/i}了。可能是席米亚人建造的，或者其他什么人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1289
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_bc8a65cc:

    # you "The Cimerians?"
    you "席米亚人？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1291
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a1bb5cc3:

    # carpenter "Yeah, whatever. Fucking elves, or dwarves, or gnolls, hell if I can tell the difference."
    carpenter "对，随便啦。都什么精灵啊，矮人啊，狼人啊，我分不清楚。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1293
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_ccfb3f67:

    # carpenter "That's where that weird name, 'Xotar', comes from. Means 'the Hub' or sumethin', in their Arios-forsaken language."
    carpenter "“Xotar”这个奇怪的名字就是这么来的。在他们那被Arios遗弃的语言中，它的意思是“枢纽”或“某种东西”。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1295
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_7d16f67f:

    # carpenter "But one thing's pretty clear: That building was no prison. Too many ways in and out. In fact there are some paths even the Knights don't know about."
    carpenter "但有一点庸毋置疑：那栋建筑原来不是监狱。里面的通道错综复杂。事实上，甚至连骑士们都不知道里面有些秘密通道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1297
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_ee7c111c:

    # you "And you know about them?"
    you "你知道这些秘密通道吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1299
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_2c98054a:

    # carpenter "Err... Not really. I've seen some old plans, not accurate enough to pinpoint anything."
    carpenter "呃...不是很清楚。我见过一些古老的设计图，但不够准确，无法定位任何位置。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1301
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_506a2dab:

    # carpenter "But I remember there are hidden pathways, to the Sewers especially..."
    carpenter "我记得有条隐藏的通道，直接通往下水道..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1303
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_31c56360:

    # you "Oh, the Sewers. Lovely. I was just itching to go back down there..."
    you "哦，下水道。真巧啊。我正好去那里一趟..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1305
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_7b968fc5:

    # carpenter "Well, whatever floats your junk, Boss."
    carpenter "好吧，你开心就好，老板。"

