translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_108aacb1:

    # you "What did they tell you?"
    you "他们告诉你什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1330
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_dfa6e573:

    # ramias "Well, there are several areas in the Prison. The largest is on the ground floor, easily the size of a village. It holds the common criminals, where they live in incredible squalor."
    ramias "监狱里有几个不同的区域。最大的是地下禁地，那里大概有一个村子那么大。普通囚犯则生活在地表肮脏的牢房里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1332
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_35362adc:

    # ramias "Seasoned murderers cohabit with infortunate plebs who stole a load of bread, and that goes as well as you can expect."
    ramias "经验丰富的杀手并因偷了一块面包而不幸入狱的平民混在一起，结果可想而知。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1334
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_e3ecb26c:

    # ramias "The upper floors are for well-connected prisoners, or simply paying ones. They get access to better cells, sometimes single, and guaranteed food and drinks on most days."
    ramias "上层关押着有特殊关系或有钱的牢房。他们可以使用更好的单人牢房，以及味道不错的监狱伙食。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1336
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b25057b1:

    # ramias "Have their own bathing area too, so they get shanked a lot less."
    ramias "他们还有自己的浴室区，很少出现暴力事件。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1338
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_28b81d56:

    # ramias "Finally, there's the basement floor, or floors. It's the maximum security area. Who knows what goes on in there."
    ramias "最后，地下室层或者几层，那里是最高等级的禁地。里面发生了什么，谁也不知道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1340
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b96d1e99:

    # ramias "Regular guards aren't allowed to pry."
    ramias "普通的监狱警是不允许窥探下层的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1342
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b369afe2:

    # you "And where did you want to work?"
    you "那你不清楚打算在哪里工作？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1344
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_60083f55:

    # ramias "Turns out, nowhere. I'm a fighter, but I'm not one for lording over orphans and widows that fight for scraps of bread."
    ramias "事实上，我哪里都不想去。我是一个战士，但并不想欺压那些为了一块面包而争夺的孤儿和寡妇。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1346
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_528a732f:

    # ramias "The privileged assholes upstairs would really get to me. Never cared for pandering to rich or highborn crybabies, and I've seen more than my share among the brass in the army."
    ramias "我受不了那些高高在上的混蛋们。我从来不缺迎哭合哭啼哭的富贵子弟，军队里也有很多这种烂人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1348
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_95135301:

    # ramias "That leaves the maximum security prison... I thought about it at first, because there was an air of danger about it that appealed to me."
    ramias "所以我就不打算在监狱干了...我感觉到，有一种危机感。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1350
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_bf419561:

    # ramias "Told me they lost a couple of guards just a week before, sounded more exciting than the rest."
    ramias "他们说就在一周前，有几个守卫失踪了，听上去比以前有趣多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1352
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_154ff330:

    # you "That's, uh... One way to see it."
    you "呃，你看待问题的角度确实清奇。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1354
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_514d8b48:

    # you "Still, you turned them down?"
    you "不过，你还是拒绝了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1356
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_7cd62fc2:

    # ramias "Sure did. Before I said yes, I did a bit of research by hitting the taverns. What I learnt, I didn't like one bit."
    ramias "当然，在入职之前，我去酒馆里听了一些。关于监狱的传闻，我一点也不喜欢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1358
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_d825505d_1:

    # you "What was that?"
    you "什么声音?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1360
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_f01182d7:

    # ramias "There were many disturbing rumors about the place, but that's to be expected. The King and his knights are not really famous for their leniency with criminals or political opponents alike."
    ramias "那里确实有很多令人不安的谣言，但却是情理之中。国王骑士团在对待敌人或政治对手时，从来都不会心慈手软。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1362
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_03194319:

    # ramias "But the demon-worshipping stuff? Arios no, I may forget to go to church more often than not, but I ain't going near that with a ten-foot spear."
    ramias "但是崇拜恶魔兄弟，我虽然常忘记去教堂祈祷，但也绝对不会靠近恶魔。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1364
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_dbd0b402:

    # you "Demon-worship?"
    you "崇拜恶魔？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1366
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_115b26be:

    # ramias "Yup. Too much noise on the street about strange noises and lights at night, forbidden rituals... Most of the max security prison guard is corrupted, or so I heard."
    ramias "对了，街头到处都在传这种谣言，说夜里会听到奇怪的声音，看到诡异的光，可能有人在举行不可告人的仪式...我听说大部分的监狱警官都已经堕落了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1368
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_25cc0e31:

    # ramias "I have no doubt when the time was right, they would have tried to enlist me in their unholy schemes."
    ramias "我毫无怀疑，等到时机成熟，他们肯定会试图拉我去参与那些邪恶的计划。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1370
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_da4de039:

    # ramias "Then I might have had to gut them, and all of that was a lot more trouble than I was asking for. I'd rather keep going with the weapon seller gig, thank you very much."
    ramias "那我就得把他们全部斩断，但那样一来，麻烦就严重了，远远超过了我的承受能力。我还是继续做武器改装吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1372
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_86fe9558:

    # you "This talk of demons and conspiracy sounds a little far-fetched, if you ask me."
    you "你说的这些恶魔和阴谋听起来有点牵强。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1374
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_1afc8d9f:

    # ramias "Mayhaps, can't say for sure. But I've found time and again that there's more truth in the divagations of drunkards than in the honey-tongued lies of the powers-that-be."
    ramias "也许吧，我无法确定。但在我看来，醉汉的胡言乱语往往比那些油腔滑调的权贵们更接近真相。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1376
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_66ad042c:

    # you "Thanks for the intel, anyway. I hope it can bring me closer to catching my mark."
    you "无论怎样，谢谢您提供的信息。希望它能有所帮助。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1385
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_47493893:

    # maya "Kunoichi, uh? Woah, you're really doing a great job at keeping yourself in trouble."
    maya "女忍者？哇，看来你一直很擅长把自己卷进麻烦里啊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1387
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_04e3340c:

    # you "I do what I can."
    you "我只是做我该做的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1389
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a097a3db:

    # maya "You know, it's funny you should mention the Prison. I've been putting old Captain Farah's books in order lately, and some things struck me as odd."
    maya "你知道，你提到的监狱的时候让我想起了一些有趣的事情。最近我一直在整理前任上尉法拉你的一些文件，里面有几件事让我觉得很奇怪。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1391
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_0c38da59:

    # you "You mean... Beyond her habit of spending half the city taxes on designer lingerie?"
    you "你是说...她经常把硅谷的一半用来买高级内衣的国外事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1393
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_55af2704:

    # maya "Yup. See, we have a register of all the criminals that were transferred to the Prison. There's a few of those each month."
    maya "没错。军队有一份文件，上面记录了所有被转移到监狱的犯罪分子。每个月都会转移几个。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1395
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_1a1826d1:

    # you "And?"
    you "而且?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1397
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b268b604:

    # maya "Well, there's at least two dozen names in there that I've never heard of. They don't match any other records. And I pride myself on knowing most if not all of our detainees."
    maya "问题是，里面至少有二十个我从未听说过的名字。它们的许多信息与其他任何记录都不匹配。我对了解监狱里的所有罪犯的信息还是有自信的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1399
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_72828661:

    # you "What does it mean?"
    you "这意味着什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1401
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3c49aefe:

    # maya "My best guess is, they were prisoners in transit, coming from outside the city. But such prisoners are usually fully registered when they come in, those were not."
    maya "我猜测，他们是从城外运送过来的牢房。不过这类牢房通常在入狱时都会记录信息，而这些人却没有。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1403
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_cde001fe:

    # maya "And their names are the kind of usual drivel lazy spooks would use to forge records."
    maya "他们的名字听起来像是随意编造的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1405
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_df1a959a:

    # maya "'Dick Puncher'? 'Bobobobo Bobobo'? 'Wolf Blitzer'?"
    maya "‘迪克’？‘波波’？‘沃尔夫·布利茨’？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1407
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_460dbdfb:

    # maya "Obviously made up. They really didn't put in any effort."
    maya "很明显都是编造的。他们甚至懒得去编一个像样的名字。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1409
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_f33ea751:

    # you "So who {i}were{/i} those prisoners?"
    you "那么这些纪念物是谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1411
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3233d568:

    # maya "Beats me, but they were all bound to the maximum security part of the Prison."
    maya "我也不知道，但他们都被关在最高警戒区域了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1413
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_1490264b:

    # maya "I know the old Captain would sometimes send out those secret transfer convoys. But the Palace has yet to ask me to do the same."
    maya "我知道老上尉有时候会派出秘密的押运队伍。但是宫里还没有要求我做同样的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1415
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_336258ce:

    # you "Secret convoys?"
    you "秘密押运？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1417
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_558268a0:

    # maya "Yeah. Always leaving at night, those. Single prisoner, heavily armed escort."
    maya "他们在夜间行动时，只押运一个警卫队士兵。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1419
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_9b72dd52:

    # maya "I was never chosen for escort duty, Farah preferred to send her lapdog, Sergeant Kashiv. I always suspected something was fishy."
    maya "我从来没有被选当押运官，法拉更喜欢派她的爪牙卡希夫中士去。我一直怀疑那里有什么特别的劲。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1421
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_0811a124:

    # you "Anything else you can tell me?"
    you "还有什么其他信息吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1423
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_2061991b:

    # maya "Well, it's not a lot to go on about, but... Kashiv, when she came back from such errands, she always smelled like a sewer. Arios knows where she had been."
    maya "说实话没有太多可以告诉你的，不过...卡希夫中士每次回来，身上都有一股下水道的味道。太阳神才知道她去了哪里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1425
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_92af9f91:

    # you "Like the Sewers, uh? Could it be she accessed the Prison that way?"
    you "下水道，？她顾是从那里嗯进入监狱的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1427
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_340d1583:

    # maya "Who knows? But this kind of experience makes you hate barracks and sharing bunk beds."
    maya "谁知道呢？但这种经历会让人很陌生军营的上下铺生活。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1429
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_aeb3516b:

    # "You thank Maya for the information."
    "你为玛雅提供表达谢意的信息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1438
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3d23e735:

    # lieutenant "Oh, my dear [MC.name]. It's been a while. We had a good time, last time, uh?"
    lieutenant "哦，我亲爱的[MC.name]，好久不见了。上次我们玩得很开心，对吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1440
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_2a6ef928:

    # "You remember the night you spent together."
    "你记得那晚你们度过了淫乱的一夜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1442
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_06340ef7:

    # you "Hmmm... We sure did."
    you "嗯...那确实是很棒的一次经历。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1444
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3eb617f5:

    # lieutenant "But I understand you're here on business. My pride is hurt, but only a little."
    lieutenant "我知道你来是要办正事。我的自尊心受到了一点点打击，不过也仅此而已。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1446
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_685847ec_2:

    # you "Well..."
    you "嗯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1448
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_bf9c2d24:

    # lieutenant "Let's cut to the chase. You mentioned a certain wounded Kunoichi, and how she was sent to Xotar Prison. I think I know something about that."
    lieutenant "让我们直接切入主题。你说有一个负伤的女忍者，她被送进了索塔尔监狱。我可能知道一些相关的情况。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1450
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_40bc22d8_1:

    # you "Really?"
    you "真的吗?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1452
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a5554860:

    # lieutenant "Yes. You see, our old Captain used to take some hefty bribes to organize prisoner convoys of a certain kind, all with the utmost discretion, which was unusual for her."
    lieutenant "你知道，我们的上尉经常会参加可观的贿赂工作，押运一些特殊的记录，全程保密。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1454
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_c95043fd:

    # you "What kind of prisoner convoys?"
    you "什么样的犯人需要秘密押运呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1456
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_9d42a00d:

    # lieutenant "Lone prisoners, two at most, under secret identities. The guards would come in from the road at night, load the prisoner in a box that was almost like a casket, and carry them to the Prison with an escort of guards and knights hidden in civilian clothes."
    lieutenant "他们会在夜间路上，把犯人装进一个像棺材一样的金属容器里，然后派出一队警卫和伪装成平民的骑士把他们押进监狱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1458
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_8dd03a10:

    # lieutenant "Sergeant Kashiv always carried out the Captain's dirty deeds, so she was usually in charge of the escort."
    lieutenant "卡希夫中士是法拉的黑手套，所以通常由她负责押运警卫的工作。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1460
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_6d6ad896:

    # lieutenant "They'd go down into the Sewers, where I hear there are secret passages that lead into old parts of the Prison. You'd never hear from the poor sods again."
    lieutenant "他们会直奔下水道，据说那里有通往监狱的秘密通道。然后你就再也听不到那些可怜的家伙的消息了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1462
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_de1df22d:

    # you "How do you know about that?"
    you "你怎么知道这个秘密的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1464
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_9cec76d1:

    # lieutenant "I did some spying on account of Renza on such convoys, to see if they were hiding anything valuable. One night, I caught a glimpse of the prisoner as they were locking her in the box."
    lieutenant "因为伦萨的命令，我曾经跟踪过他们。 有一天晚上，我瞥见了他们把那名牢房关进金属箱的场景。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1466
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_ea9969cd:

    # lieutenant "Even though the light was low, one thing stood out... The lady only had one arm."
    lieutenant "虽然光线不太好，但有一件事让我印象深刻...那个女人只剩下一只手臂。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1468
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_2f5b2abe:

    # you "I see! So they took her into the Sewers?"
    you "原来如此...他们把她带到了下水道？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1470
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_1ae7488b:

    # lieutenant "Yes. And that's the last anyone will probably hear from the poor lass, Shalia embrace her."
    lieutenant "是的。而且很可能再也没有人会知道这个可怜的女孩的下落了，愿莎莉娅眷顾她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1472
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b49d5499:

    # "You thank the Lieutenant for the information and head back to the city, lost in your thoughts."
    "你感谢了中尉提供的信息，然后返回城里，开始思考。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1479
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_29cea6fd:

    # sergeant "You..."
    sergeant "你..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1481
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_03113623:

    # "Her face whitens with fear. She remembers what you did to her."
    "她的脸部浮现出恐惧。她想起你对她做的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1483
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_547f5ee3:

    # sergeant "Get away from me! One more step and I'll kill you, you bastard!"
    sergeant "离我远点！再靠近我一步我就杀了你，混蛋！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1485
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_ac88dc8e:

    # "You quickly leave before she recovers from her shock and stabs you."
    "在她从惊吓中恢复过来刺向你之前你赶忙离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1490
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_e09a429d:

    # sergeant "I'd be damned... You dare to show your face here? Don't think I forgot the last time we met..."
    sergeant "真是不敢...你竟敢在这里现身？别以为我忘记了上次的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1492
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_7a2916df:

    # you "Call us even then. You tried to get me killed."
    you "我们谈平了。你差点害死我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1494
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a155a702:

    # you "And don't forget our mutual friend the good Captain Farah... I'm sure she would take issue with you fighting me over an old grudge."
    you "别忘了我和法拉上尉的关系...你也不想让她看到我们在这里大打出手吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1496
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_90d6a342:

    # sergeant "Grr..."
    sergeant "呼..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1500
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_84029b27:

    # sergeant "You are correct. *sigh*"
    sergeant "看来我别无选择。*叹气*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1502
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_cef93c31:

    # sergeant "Fine, I'll tell you what I know about the Prison, if it gets you out of my sight faster."
    sergeant "好吧，如果说完你就能滚，那我就告诉你我知道的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1504
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_18283a99:

    # sergeant "While there's nothing special about the Prison on the surface, the special convoys are noteworthy."
    sergeant "表面上看这座监狱没什么特别的，但那些晚上的押运行动作就很震撼了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1506
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_0c32ed80:

    # you "Special convoys?"
    you "特殊的押金？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1508
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3d30c87c:

    # sergeant "Yup. When the Prison gets a 'VIP' prisoner, courtesy of the King, they sometimes arrives in a special convoy. Means no traces are left in the system."
    sergeant "对，当监狱收到国王秘密逮捕的‘VIP’后，他们会用特殊的押运方式。这样就不会在记录里留下任何痕迹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1510
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_154e1fb9:

    # sergeant "When the Guard was involved, which was rare because no one is usually interested in VIP prisoners coming from outside the walls, I was one of those trusted with the package."
    sergeant "有时由军队负责押运，虽然这种情况很少发生，因为外面来的VIP墓可能有一些背景。不过我也曾经参与过货物的押运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1512
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_0ed9d81d:

    # you "The package?"
    you "货物？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1514
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_21991c26:

    # sergeant "More like a sedan chair, really, except it's a chained metal one, and it's damn heavy."
    sergeant "准确的说是一个带锁链的金属箱子，而且相当重。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1516
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_36658633:

    # sergeant "No one involved in the convoy knows who we're escorting. They give him or her a fake name, and the Knights warn you in no uncertain terms than any attempt at peaking inside will end with your head on a pike."
    sergeant "不仅如此，参与押运的人也不知道他在押送的是谁。 为了方便称呼他们给我们留下外号，骑士们也曾经警告过，任何试图窥探内部的行为都会导致脑袋被尖刺扎穿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1518
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_cb8e5939:

    # sergeant "As if all of that wasn't enough, they have us enter through a secret passage in the Sewers. Can't allow anyone to see who's coming in and out of the maximum security prison."
    sergeant "只是这样还不够保密，他们要我们从下水道的秘密通道进入。不能让任何人看到有人在进监狱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1520
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_b825566d:

    # you "And where might I find this secret doorway, exactly?"
    you "那么这条秘密通道的具体位置在哪里？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1522
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_74d77558:

    # sergeant "Hell if I know. It's in the Sewers, but they blindfolded us as soon as we were there and had us follow the Knight's voice to move on."
    sergeant "我也不知道。它就在下水道里，一进下水道那些骑士就会蒙上我们的眼睛，让我们跟着指令前进。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1524
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_5948d89f:

    # sergeant "I hated every minute of it. The blindfold makes you notice the smell a lot more, and I nearly stumbled into the waste stream a dozen times."
    sergeant "我那一分钟也待不下去。蒙眼让我的嗅觉更加灵敏，下水道太臭了，有一次我差一点就掉进了污水沟。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1526
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_31de1084:

    # sergeant "Anyway, that's all I know. Scram now, will you?"
    sergeant "总之，我知道的就这么多。现在赶紧滚开，好吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1528
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_3da20e9d:

    # "You reflect on what she told you. Could this help with your chase?"
    "她告诉你的情报。这个线索对你的追查有帮助吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1538
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_df63536b:

    # goldie "I'm sorry, [MC.name], I'm afraid I can't help you further. I only had the one rune I gave you."
    goldie "抱歉，[MC.name]，恐怕我帮不了你更多了。我只有给你的那一个符文。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1545
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_16a68c3a:

    # goldie "Ninja women with a dark and terrible past? Wow, [MC.name]! What an exciting and glamorous life you're living..."
    goldie "拥有可怕经历的女忍者？哇，[MC.name]！你的生活真是精彩纷呈啊..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1547
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_4df1b57a:

    # you "Yeah, well, I hope this isn't the kind of adventure that ends with me taking a shuriken to the back of the head."
    you "是啊，希望这次冒险不是以我的后脑勺被刺穿收尾。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1549
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a10816db:

    # goldie "Oh, don't say that, [MC.name]! If anything happened to you, I would be unconsolable..."
    goldie "[MC.name]，别这么说！如果出了什么事，我会为你感到伤心..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1551
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_59a9d1b0:

    # "She looks genuinely worried about you."
    "她看起来真的很担心你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1553
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_2f690669:

    # goldie "You know, I think I have just the thing. It's been in my family for generations, my Pa' used to say it would bring us good luck."
    goldie "我正好有一个东西可以派上用场。这东西已经在我们家传了好几代了，我爸爸说这会给我们带来好运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1555
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_a17f302b:

    # goldie "It's a runic stone, the kind that shamans of old used to fashion in the way the Cimerians did. Or so they said."
    goldie "这是一块符石，就是古老的萨满祭司制作的那样。至少他们是这么说的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1557
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_f1b00875:

    # goldie "This one has the Earth symbol, so it's appropriate if you're after an Earth ninja. Maybe. I don't really know anything about ninjas, except from novels."
    goldie "这上面有土系元素的波动，如果你的敌人是土系忍者的话，应该会有帮助。虽然我对忍者不太了解，也只是从小说里了解了一些。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1559
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_4012734b:

    # you "Thank you... This looks expensive, are you sure I can have it?"
    you "谢谢你...这看起来很贵重，你确定我可以拿走吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1561
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_9811751f:

    # goldie "Well... It's true that I don't have a lot to go on these days, but if it's you... *blush*"
    goldie "是啊...虽然手头确实有点紧，但如果是你的话...*脸红*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1563
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_ea8923c9:

    # you "(This would probably fetch hundreds of denars on the market... What should I do?)"
    you "（这个石头要是拿到市场上卖，能卖很多钱...我该怎么办呢？）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1566
translate chinese_simplified c3_hint_aea21fa7:

    # goldie "Oh, [MC.name], you(re back. I assume this is about the Earth stone?"
    goldie "哦，[MC.name]，你回来了。我猜这是关于那块土元素符石的事情吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1573
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_252979e7:

    # you "(This offer is too good to pass.)"
    you "（机不可失，要利用一切可以利用的。）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1575
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_2c9296bb:

    # you "Thank you Goldie, I'll have the stone, then."
    you "谢谢你，戈尔迪，我会好好保存的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1577
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_fd12b0a3:

    # "She gives a last look at the stone, and you can see some anguish in her eyes. But she steels her resolve, and gives it to you."
    "她最后一眼看着那块石头，你能看到她眼中有些挣扎。但她鼓起勇气，把它递给了你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1583
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_b4ac69d5:

    # "You don't have enough money."
    "你的钱还不够。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1586
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_586d9bc5:

    # "You give her the minimum price you think such a stone could be worth."
    "你给了她你认为符合市场价格的金币作为补偿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1588
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_6bd44375:

    # you "Here, please take this gold as compensation. I wouldn't feel right depriving you of such a valuable object when you're struggling."
    you "给你这些金币补偿吧。我不想在你陷入困境的时候还拿走你这么宝贵的东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1590
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_43f44e92:

    # goldie "Oh, thank you... You didn't have to..."
    goldie "哦，太感谢你了...你真的不用这样..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1592
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_fa161d3b:

    # you "You're welcome."
    you "别客气。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1602
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_b4ac69d5_1:

    # "You don't have enough money."
    "你的钱还不够。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1605
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_5d9f8aef:

    # "You give her a good price for what you think the stone is worth."
    "你给了她你认为符合市场价格的金币作为补偿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1607
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_661f8220:

    # you "Here, I don't want to cheat you of such a valuable object in yout time of need."
    you "还有吧，我不想在你困难的时候占你的便宜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1609
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_a7dc1f03:

    # goldie "Oh, thank you! This is too much!"
    goldie "哦，太感谢了！这太多了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1611
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_03c4a21a:

    # you "No, please, have it. It's my pleasure."
    you "不，请收下它吧。能帮到你是我的荣幸。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1613
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_bf6138ea:

    # goldie "Thank you so much!"
    goldie "太感谢你了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1615
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_0537a455:

    # "She gives you a grateful kiss."
    "她感激地吻了你一下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1624
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_b848ca4f:

    # you "Thank you for your offer, but I can't accept just yet. I will be back."
    you "谢谢你的好意，但我现在还不能接受。我会接着的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1631
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_9c5a78d6:

    # goldie "May it protect you from harm, dear [MC.name]."
    goldie "愿它保护你平安，亲爱的[MC.name]。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1633
translate chinese_simplified c2_goldie_buy_rune_13973271:

    # you "Thank you sweetie."
    you "谢谢亲爱的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1652
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_7d8eccdb:

    # suzume "So, I think we've gathered enough intel about the Void ninja! What do you want to do?" nointeract
    suzume "所以，我想我们已经收集到了足够多的关于虚空忍者的情报！你想怎么做？" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1659
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_94012841:

    # you "Yeah, after what happened I don't think I can show my face around there for some time."
    you "是的，发生了那件事之后，我想我有一段时间不能在那里露面了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1666
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_d15b583b:

    # "You can only attempt to catch a ninja once a day."
    "您每天只能尝试捕捉忍者一次。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1680
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_2c04c4d6:

    # suzume normal "I think now we have a pretty good idea of what that little brat is up to!"
    suzume normal "我想我们现在应该很清楚那个小家伙在搞什么鬼了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1682
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_44b959a2:

    # you "Have we? Can you recap?"
    you "我们有吗？你能回顾一下吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1684
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_35c70abb:

    # suzume "Sure. Here's what we've gathered so far."
    suzume "当然。这是我们迄今为止收集到的内容。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1686
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_f7657260:

    # suzume "Narika is organizing a heist of some sorts. She may have a powerful backer."
    suzume "鸣香正在组织某种抢劫活动。她可能有一个强大的靠山。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1689
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_9ccee9b6:

    # suzume "It's clear her mark is in the upper city. That's beyond our current reach, but we can probably get a safe-conduct from the Princess."
    suzume "很明显，她的踪迹就在上城。这超出了我们目前的能力范围，但我们或许可以从公主那里得到安全通行证。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1692
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_6f81da92:

    # suzume "We also know it's a place where they wear uniforms. That's an important clue."
    suzume "我们也知道这是他们穿制服的地方。这是一个重要的线索。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1695
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_72f86fa2:

    # suzume "And the mark is a school. That narrows it down significantly."
    suzume "标记是一所学校。这大大缩小了范围。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1698
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_592d3638:

    # suzume "Finally, she's going after a magical artefact! There are only a few places where such important magical items could be found."
    suzume "终于，她要去寻找一件神奇的文物了！能找到如此重要的魔法物品的地方屈指可数。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1700
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_8e5c1006:

    # suzume "Which means..."
    suzume "这意味着..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1702
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_05917314:

    # you "The Magic University."
    you "魔法学院。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1704
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_e51c7a82:

    # suzume "Of course. See, it wasn't hard."
    suzume "当然。看，这并不难。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1706
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_97ed2f18:

    # suzume "Void ninjas don't rely on magic to be effective, so they are better suited to taking on a target with magical protection. It must have been important to whoever recruited her."
    suzume "虚空忍者不依赖魔法来发挥作用，因此他们更适合对付有魔法保护的目标。对于招募她的人来说，这一定很重要。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1708
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_56a8b790:

    # you "Fine. Now, we know what she's after. But how do we get to her?"
    you "好极了。现在，我们知道她在找什么。但我们怎样才能找到她呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1710
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_e854e284:

    # suzume "Well, I see a couple of ways to go about this."
    suzume "嗯，我看到有几种方法可以解决这个问题。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1712
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_33c6fd3a:

    # you "Tell me."
    you "告诉我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1714
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_4587d929:

    # suzume "First, you could report your findings to the Dean of Magic U."
    suzume "首先，你可以向魔法学院院长报告你的发现。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1716
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_7c5a090e:

    # suzume "They would be able to thwart the heist, and probably have the means to lock the Void ninja up."
    suzume "他们将能够挫败这次抢劫，并且可能有办法将虚空忍者关起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1718
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_0621bce3:

    # suzume "In doing so, we would be gaining a useful ally, as well as fulfilling the Princess's mandate."
    suzume "这样做，我们将获得一个有用的盟友，并完成公主的使命。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1720
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_1633f48c:

    # you "I see. Anything else?"
    you "我懂了。还要别的吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1722
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_dbabaf13:

    # suzume doubt "There's another option. It's a little unorthodox, even for you... But hear me out."
    suzume doubt "还有另一种选择。即使对你来说，这也有点非同寻常……但请听我解释。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1724
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_db922458:

    # suzume normal "What if we {i}helped{/i} her steal that artefact?"
    suzume normal "如果我们帮助她偷走那件文物呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1726
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_ae2e904d:

    # you "Whaaat?" with vpunch
    you "什么？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1728
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_48419fad:

    # suzume "Think about it. We could split the proceeds of the heist, and make her an ally. Then we'd get her to spill the beans about her backer."
    suzume "想一想。我们可以平分抢劫所得，并让她成为盟友。然后我们会让她泄露有关她的支持者的秘密。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1730
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_0e3d58fc:

    # you "Err, I don't know if the Princess would like us to do that."
    you "呃，我不知道公主是否愿意我们这样做。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1732
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_c2b59ef7:

    # suzume "Aha, but think about it this way: there's no love lost between the Royals and the Mages."
    suzume "啊哈，但这样想吧：王室和法师之间并没有失去爱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1734
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_24bfc997:

    # you "There isn't?"
    you "没有吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1736
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_58f3ddaa:

    # suzume "Nope. The Zanic Magic Guild remained neutral during the change of dynasty 25 years ago. They waited until power was well into the hands of the Pharo dynasty to begrudgingly declare allegiance."
    suzume "没有。 25年前的王朝更迭期间，泽恩魔法公会一直保持中立。他们等到权力完全落入法罗王朝手中才不情愿地宣布效忠。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1739
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_35db7927:

    # you "It's nothing personal, wizards are not supposed to meddle in regime change. Too many bad precedents."
    you "这不是个人恩怨，巫师不应该干涉政权更迭。不好的先例太多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1741
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_f8a417c7:

    # you "An abundance of caution, eh? So much for scheming wizards."
    you "非常谨慎，是吗？对于诡计多端的巫师来说就这么多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1743
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_b392c138:

    # suzume "Anyway, King Pharo always keeps the Magic Guild at arm's length, knowing they are unreliable allies."
    suzume "不管怎样，法罗国王总是与魔法公会保持一定的距离，因为他知道他们是不可靠的盟友。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1745
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_5f430f6b:

    # suzume "If you can get Narika to leave Zan's nobility in peace, the Princess might just turn a blind eye to you messing with the Magic University."
    suzume "如果你能让鸣香放弃攻击泽恩的贵族，公主可能会对你在魔法学院捅出的篓子视而不见。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1747
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_a48092dd:

    # you "Hmmm..."
    you "嗯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1754
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_111aa602:

    # suzume "I can think of something else. Remember that Cimerian device you bought?"
    suzume "我还能想到别的事情。还记得您购买的席米亚设备吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1756
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_d2324176:

    # you "The Void Rune? It's supposed to slow down time?"
    you "你是说虚空符文？它应该能让时间变慢吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1758
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_479d6db4:

    # suzume "Yes. I can see how that could mess with her powers. If you can catch her again in the city, maybe we could beat her this time."
    suzume "是的。我明白这会如何扰乱她的力量。如果你能在城里再抓住她，也许这次我们能打败她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1761
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_bfd9ab0b:

    # suzume "And put her in one of the Cimerian-built cells the perverted old man mentioned."
    suzume "然后把她关进变态老头提到的席米亚建造的一间牢房里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1763
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_6da4fbfd:

    # you "So you know about that, uh."
    you "所以你知道这一点，呃。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1765
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_a8551493:

    # suzume "Yup."
    suzume "是的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1768
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_b605f266:

    # suzume "But you lack the means to hold her. We would have to deliver her to the Princess quickly and get it over with."
    suzume "但你却缺乏留住她的手段。我们必须尽快把她送到公主身边，然后结束这一切。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1770
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_ef3bc815:

    # suzume "Unless you can figure out a way to keep her locked up."
    suzume "除非你能想出办法把她关起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:1772
translate chinese_simplified c3_unlock_narika_00c2ccb5:

    # you "Capturing her, hmmm..."
    you "抓住她，嗯..."

