    # receptionist "Some of our magic artifacts can replace limbs, cure ailments and infirmities..."
    receptionist "我们的一些魔法道具可以代替肢体、治愈疾病和虚弱...."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3858
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_796d292f:

    # receptionist "And even prop up the impotent. But if you need help in that department, I'm afraid our most powerful items are under magical lock and key in the University's vault."
    receptionist "甚至治疗阳痿。但如果你需要那个部门的帮助，恐怕我们最强大的道具都在学院金库的神奇大锁和钥匙的保护之下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3860
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_0a1db7e0:

    # you "N-No, I don't..."
    you "不、不，我才不需要..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3862
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_82d249b2:

    # receptionist "Sure, sure. They all say that."
    receptionist "当然，当然。他们都这么说。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3867
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_231ae49e:

    # sill "(Magic glasses, hmm?)"
    sill "（魔法眼镜，嗯？）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3873
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a35fe663:

    # receptionist "Look, I don't care what business you have with the Court, and which faction you're working for."
    receptionist "听着，我不在乎你与王室有什么关系，也不在乎你为哪个大人物工作。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3875
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_68a4d00d:

    # receptionist "The Dean said you'd come, and you came, so this much was right."
    receptionist "院长说你来了，你就来了，所以毋庸置疑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3877
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_155c389e:

    # you "Did the Dean mention us specifically? You could have mistaken us with someone else..."
    you "院长有没有特别提到我们？你可能会把我们误认为是其他人......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3886
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_7d4de78f:

    # receptionist "No, she mentioned you precisely. '[desc]' He is followed by a pink-haired slave girl who smells of cleaning products."
    receptionist "不，她准确地提到了你。 '[desc]' 身后跟着一个粉红色头发的女奴，身上散发着清洁产品的气味。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3888
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_19b2718f:

    # receptionist "That describes you, doesn't it?"
    receptionist "这就是你，不是吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3890
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_09f7ad15:

    # you "It does not!"
    you "事实并非如此！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3892
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_c12f3862:

    # sill "It kind of does..."
    sill "这有点像..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3896
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_627b4efa:

    # sill sad "*OUCH*" with vpunch
    sill sad "*哎哟*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3898
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a2676847:

    # receptionist "Don't be naive. The Dean likes to keep informed of what goes on at Court, just like your people spy on our affairs."
    receptionist "别天真了。院长喜欢监视皇宫里发生的情况，就像你们的人监视我们一样。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3900
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_b3b4b51a:

    # receptionist "The Charter doesn't prohibit that, as long as it remains within reason."
    receptionist "只要在合理的范围内，《宪章》并不禁止这样做。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3902
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_42f08550:

    # receptionist "No doubt the Dean knows more about your mission, but I don't need to know."
    receptionist "毫无疑问，院长对你的任务了解更多，但我不需要知道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3904
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_95b0dd1b:

    # receptionist "Which is a good thing too, because Gods know I wouldn't care."
    receptionist "这也是一件好事，因为谁都知道我不在意。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3910
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_8ff8dfdd:

    # receptionist "*sigh* You don't know that? Maybe it's true that you're not a Court agent after all..."
    receptionist "*叹气*你不知道吗？也许你真的不是什么王室的密探。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3912
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_20050ebf:

    # receptionist "The Charter is the treaty that recognizes the Magic Guild's fealty to the Pharo dynasty, and thus covers MagicU as well."
    receptionist "该宪章是承认魔法公会对法罗王室效忠的条约，因此也涵盖了魔法学院。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3914
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_c130205f:

    # sill happy "I seem to recall there was some friction at the beginning of the King's reign..."
    sill happy "我好像记得国王统治初期有过一些摩擦……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3916
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_aaf249c5:

    # receptionist "Not really. It's just that the Guild has lived through four different dynasties since it settled in Zan, and one Republic."
    receptionist "算不上。只是公会自定居泽恩以来，经历了四个不同的朝代，以及一个共和国。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3918
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_7a2d0567:

    # receptionist "The Pharo dynasty began on shaky ground, twenty-five years ago."
    receptionist "二十五年前，法罗王室的基础并不稳固。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3920
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a03e4382:

    # receptionist "So the mages withheld their approval of the new king until a satisfactory deal was reached."
    receptionist "因此，法师们都不认可新国王，直到他们之间达成令人满意的协议。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3922
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ebb34abc:

    # receptionist "Some at Court are still bitter about this, but if you ask me, they're fools."
    receptionist "王室中的一些人仍然对此感到痛苦，但如果你问我，他们都是傻瓜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3924
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ca7f038e:

    # you "For the record, I didn't ask."
    you "根据记录，我没有问。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3926
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_79203c55:

    # sill "What does the Charter say?"
    sill "宪章怎么说？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3928
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_33467872:

    # receptionist "Well, it gives us perpetual lease on this part of the city, not just the University grounds but the whole Magic Guild's district."
    receptionist "嗯，它给了我们这部分地区的永久使用权，不仅仅是学院场地，还有整个法师公会的地区。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3930
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_0ce0e340:

    # receptionist "We can arrange our own affairs, and the Crown can only intervene if we request it. Their troops and agents like yourselves are barred from entering Guild and University buildings without invitation. We also do not pay royal taxes."
    receptionist "我们可以安排自己的事务，只有在我们要求的情况下，国王才可以伸手干预。他们的军队和特务，比如你们，未经允许不得进入公会和学院建筑。我们也不必向王室纳税。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3932
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d75efc6e:

    # you "I can see why that would rub some folks at the Palace the wrong way."
    you "我明白为什么这会惹怒王室里的一些人了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3934
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_24d07460:

    # receptionist "Some think the King got a raw deal. But he was able to consolidate his power in the end, so all is well that ends well, right?"
    receptionist "有些人认为国王受到了不公平的待遇。但最终他能够巩固自己的势力，那不就皆大欢喜了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3936
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_c8e47c56:

    # receptionist "The problem is more with the personal animosity the King has developed for magic users."
    receptionist "问题更多在于国王对魔法使用者怀有的个人敌意。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3938
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_2439dfe8:

    # you "Personal?"
    you "个人的偏见？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3940
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_c53da090:

    # receptionist "Yup. That the King actively hates mages is famous all over Zan."
    receptionist "是的。国王对法师的憎恨在整个泽恩都是众所周知的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3942
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_90eca234:

    # receptionist "Only a few magic-users are allowed at Court, such as the Astronomer Lord Henso, and they have cut ties with our Guild a long time ago."
    receptionist "只有少数魔法使用者可以进入宫廷，例如天文学家汉索勋爵，但他很早以前就与我们公会断绝了关系。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3944
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_7e8684a5:

    # sill sad "Has somebody in the Guild wronged King Pharo in any way?"
    sill sad "公会里有人以任何方式得罪过法老王吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3946
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_fc33605a:

    # receptionist "I suppose this has to do with one assassination plot or another. Or the Dean's refusal to participate in the war effort. Meaningless politics. *shrug*"
    receptionist "我想这与某个暗杀阴谋有关。或者院长拒绝参与战争。无聊的政治话题。 *耸肩*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3948
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_8ce3aeed:

    # receptionist "If you ask me, a King should have thicker skin than that, and not get upset over some petty squabble."
    receptionist "如果你问我的话，国王的脸皮就应该厚一点，不该因为一些小事而心烦意乱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3950
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_6ed0f4e9:

    # you "Again, I didn't ask..."
    you "再说一遍，我没有问..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3952
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_61070670:

    # receptionist "Anyway, we're quite content with the King avoiding us if it means we stay out of each other's business."
    receptionist "不管怎样，我们对国王和我们划清界限感到很满意，如果这意味着我们彼此互不干涉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3954
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_df6f4349:

    # receptionist "As the Charter would have us."
    receptionist "正如宪章所希望的那样。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3959
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d33bfbe9:

    # you "So you said you handle student registration?"
    you "你说你负责学生注册？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3961
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d14d85d4:

    # receptionist "Unfortunately, I do."
    receptionist "不幸的是，我确实负责。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3963
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_861c74ea:

    # sill "You must have lots of students from the nobility within your ranks."
    sill "你们的成员中一定有很多贵族的学生。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3965
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_516d40d7:

    # receptionist "Of course. Our students only come from the elite layers of society, as they should."
    receptionist "当然。我们的学生只来自社会精英阶层，这是他们应该的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3967
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d0cab63f:

    # you "Even from within the Royal family?"
    you "甚至来自王室内部？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3969
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ec2b678b:

    # "She gives you a strange look."
    "她露出一种奇怪的表情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3971
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_840be1b4:

    # receptionist "Of course not, why do you even ask?"
    receptionist "当然不可能，你怎么能问出这种问题？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3973
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_aca0da5b:

    # you "Uh? Why not?"
    you "呃？为什么不行呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3975
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a872c5bf:

    # receptionist "Because King Pharo forbids it, of course."
    receptionist "当然，因为法罗国王禁止这样做。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3977
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_f2a4d690:

    # sill "He does?"
    sill "他有吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3979
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ade09294:

    # receptionist "Yes. Some grudge he has against mages, in spite of the Charter we signed twenty-five years ago."
    receptionist "是的。尽管我们在二十五年前签署了宪章，但他对法师还是有些怨恨。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3981
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_098a2029:

    # you "Anyway, do you know a girl student that fits this description?"
    you "不管怎样，你认识符合这种描述的女学生吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3983
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d6d73df6:

    # receptionist "I like to think I'm able to forget someone's face as soon as they leave the registration office. It is a skill I have refined over many years."
    receptionist "可以这么说，一旦某人离开登记处，我就能忘记他们的脸。这是我多年来磨炼出来的一项技能。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3985
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a863e4c9:

    # sill sad "(Is this really a skill, though?)"
    sill sad "（但这真的算是一种技能吗？）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3987
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_994d419b:

    # "You proceed to describe Narika in as much detail as possible."
    "你继续尽可能详细地描述鸣香。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3989
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a4f09b06:

    # receptionist "A spolied, whiny kid? That describes {i}all of the students{/i} we get at the University."
    receptionist "一个被宠坏了、爱发牢骚的孩子？学院的{i}所有学生{/i}都是如此。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3991
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_13a2df23:

    # you "But do you remember her?"
    you "但你还记得她吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3993
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_38552759:

    # receptionist "I don't. Just like I hope I'll have forgotten all about you by the time you step out of here."
    receptionist "我不知道。就像我希望当你走出这里时我已经忘记你一样。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3995
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_e2b85950:

    # you "Wow, you really have a way with people. I can see why they made you the P.R. representative..."
    you "哇，你与人相处真有一套。我明白他们为什么让你担任公关代表了..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3997
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_94855c38:

    # receptionist "Thanks."
    receptionist "谢谢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:3999
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_deebee0d:

    # "She doesn't even seem to register your sarcasm."
    "她似乎根本没有注意到你的讽刺。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4004
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_7588876e:

    # you "So your Dean sounds like an interesting character..."
    you "你们的院长听起来是个有趣的人物......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4006
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_06a9fc6b:

    # receptionist "Sure thing. Masou-sama is over a century old, and has lead the Guild and the University for nearly as long."
    receptionist "显而易见。玛苏大人已经活了一百多年了，坐镇公会和学院的时间也几乎一样长。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4008
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_588c4b7d:

    # receptionist "She was a prodigy, a once-in-a-generation phenomenon. Graduated Karkyr at only fifteen."
    receptionist "她是一个神童，一个千载难逢的天才。年仅十五岁就从卡尔基毕业。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4010
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_31519752:

    # you "So the Dean is a 'she'?"
    you "所以院长是位“女性”吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4012
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_96a164ed:

    # receptionist "Sure. But don't get any ideas. She's many planes of existence out of your league, and anyway, she's celibate. Her only interest is devoting herself to magic."
    receptionist "当然。但不要有任何多余的想法。她在许多存在层面上都超出了你认知的范畴，而且无论如何，她是独行者。她唯一的兴趣就是研究魔法。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4014
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_5b560477:

    # you "Haha, you're deluded, I'm not going to fall for some old crone. Not my kink."
    you "哈哈，你想多了，我才不会爱上某个老太婆呢。我可没有这种癖好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4016
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_665829bf:

    # sill "What does Masou-sama do, exactly?"
    sill "玛苏大人到底是做什么的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4018
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_db1426fb:

    # receptionist "Well, on the one hand, she's the Dean here so she keeps the faculty and researchers under control, which is no small thing. I don't think there's a higher concentration of inflated egos anywhere else in Xeros."
    receptionist "嗯，一方面，她是学院的院长，所以她掌管着教职员工和研究人员，这可不是一件小事。我不认为克塞罗斯中的其他地方有比她还强的掌权者。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4020
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_0703154a:

    # receptionist "On the other hand, as she is also the Guild's Grandmaster, she has to handle a whole lot of politics. I understand she loathes that, but someone has to do it."
    receptionist "另一方面，由于她也是法师公会的会长，她要处理很多政治事务。我知道她讨厌这样做，但必须有人做这些事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4022
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_2cce5d1d:

    # receptionist "She has precious little time for anything else, including her magical research. This is in spite of using several alternate timelines to multiply her output."
    receptionist "她几乎没有时间做其他事情，包括她的魔法研究。尽管她使用了多个平行世界时间线来提高工作效率，但还是捉襟见肘。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4024
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_5edc2832:

    # you "Can we meet her?"
    you "我们可以见见她吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4026
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_10488cdc:

    # receptionist "Oh, sure. Did you miss the part where I said her time is precious and shouldn't be wasted?"
    receptionist "哦，当然。你有没有错过我说她的时间很宝贵，不应该浪费的部分？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4028
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_b421e622:

    # you "It is important. We come with an urgent warning."
    you "这很重要。有紧急事态要通知她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4030
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_0f793029:

    # receptionist "What's so urgent that you must disturb..."
    receptionist "有什么事这么紧急，一定要打扰..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4032
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a66832fe:

    # receptionist "Oh, blast, it's not like I'm paid, well, anything to stop you, so go right ahead."
    receptionist "哦，天哪，这又不是我的工作，好吧，没有谁可以阻止你，随你的便吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4034
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_f8e864e1:

    # receptionist "She's better at dealing with your type than I am, anyway."
    receptionist "反正，她比我更擅长应付你这种类型的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4036
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ed14a4c3:

    # you "'My' type?"
    you "“我这种”类型？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4038
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_ac8e0b52:

    # sill "(Come Master, let's not waste this chance to talk to the Dean...)"
    sill "（快走吧主人，别浪费和院长说话的时间了...）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4044
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_a1020dff:

    # "The receptionist fumbles with something inside her pouch and a shimering blue portal fizzles into existence next to you."
    "接待员在她的袋子里摸索着什么东西，一个闪闪发光的蓝色传送门突然出现在你面前。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4046
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_1bdd2a84:

    # receptionist "Here you go. I'll see you on your way out."
    receptionist "这边请。我会在你离开学院的时候送你一程。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4048
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_3107977c:

    # receptionist "(Shouldn't be long...)"
    receptionist "（应该不会太久...）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4057
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_4bedc708:

    # receptionist "So you're back. Yay."
    receptionist "所以你已经回来了。耶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4059
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_2a236eca:

    # receptionist "That was an exceptionally long interview. The Dean must like you."
    receptionist "真是一次异常漫长的采访。院长一定很喜欢你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4061
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_d832a715:

    # you "Yeah, not really."
    you "确实很漫长，也不算喜欢吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4063
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_70323c54:

    # receptionist "Oh? Well, don't worry about it. She doesn't like anybody."
    receptionist "哦？好吧，不用担心。她谁都不喜欢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:4065
translate chinese_simplified MU_questions_menu_e08515a8:

    # receptionist "What did she say?"
    receptionist "她说了些什么？"

