    # "You didn't make any progress on the hunt for Narika today. Better luck tomorrow?"
    "今天你对鸣香的追捕没有取得任何进展。明天会转运吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5103
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_619106e6:

    # you "Okay, today I locked Sill up in her room. No more interruptions, this time I'm going to find that pesky ninja!"
    you "好吧，今天我把希露锁在她的房间里。别再烦我了，这次我要一个人去找到那个讨厌的忍者！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5105
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_def80143:

    # you "Let's check a bunch of different classrooms. She's bound to be {i}somewhere{/i}."
    you "让我们检查一下不同的教室。她一定会在{i}某个地方{/i}。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5109
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_11544c70:

    # "You spend the next hour poking your head into various classrooms."
    "接下来的一个小时里，你把头探进不同的教室。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5111
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_2cdb3da5:

    # you "[MC.swear()], this place is so darn big... Wait, what's this one? 'Arcane items of Xeros: A long history.'"
    you "[MC.swear()]，这地方太大了...等等，这是什么？ “克塞罗斯的神秘物品：悠久的历史。”"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5113
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_8ea42640:

    # "You catch a whiff of sakura flower perfume as you peer into the classroom."
    "当你向教室里望去时，你闻到一股樱花的香味。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5118
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_0ee3e31f:

    # "Professor" "So, did you like the lecture, Miss?"
    "教授" "那么，小姐，您喜欢这场讲座吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5122
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_17a76adb:

    # narika "Oh yes, Professor... You are {i}so{/i} interesting, you know... I come here every day just to hear {i}you{/i}..."
    narika "哦，是的，教授...您{i}如此{/i}有趣，您知道...我每天来这里只是为了听{i}您{/i}的声音..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5124
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_dd0dd19f:

    # "The girl bats her eyes exageratedly while the Professor basks in her adoration."
    "当教授沉浸在她的崇拜之中时，女孩夸张地眨着眼睛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5126
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_8961dabb:

    # "Professor" "It's so nice of you to say so, my child..."
    "教授" "孩子，你这么说真是太好了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5128
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_c2d54874:

    # "The old teacher starts patting the girl on the lower back, inching his hand down to her skirt. She evades at the last moment in a swift elegant move, still managing to look natural."
    "老教师拍了拍女孩的后背，把手慢慢地放到她的裙子上。她在最后一刻以敏捷而优雅的动作躲开了，但看起来仍然很自然。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5130
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ce543f87:

    # you "(This girl...)"
    you "（这个女孩...）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5132
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_b5dd974f:

    # narika "Professor [emo_heart], did you remember my request?"
    narika "[emo_heart]教授，您还记得我的要求吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5134
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_e84aa7d6:

    # "Professor" "Child, it's not easy to sate your curiosity... I can't tell you such things, there are rules and the Dean would be very cross if she..."
    "教授" "孩子，满足你的好奇心可不容易……我不能告诉你这些事，有规矩的，院长要是知道了会很生气的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5136
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_56038f53:

    # narika "Ow, Prof-chan, don't be a meanie... You do remember my promise, don't you?"
    narika "哎呀，教授~，别小气嘛...你还记得人家的承诺，不是吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5138
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_6c8e6cb8:

    # "Professor" "You promised to... *gulp*"
    "教授" "你答应过……*咕咚*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5140
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_d103dc7f:

    # narika "Yes? *teasing*"
    narika "接着说？ *戏弄*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5142
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_59ac5832:

    # "Professor" "To give me your used panties... If I..."
    "教授" "把你穿过的内裤给我……如果我……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5144
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_a6228ae6:

    # narika "That's right! [emo_heart]"
    narika "一百分！ [emo_heart]"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5146
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_d2dd98bc:

    # narika "But in exchange I just want you to share some knowledge... For my thesis... Pretty please?"
    narika "但作为交换，我只是想让你分享一些知识......关于我的论文......好吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5148
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_d8d0707a:

    # "She bats her eyes so fast she almost gives the old guy a seizure."
    "她的眼睛眨得太快，差点让老家伙癫痫发作。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5150
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_bcd3789c:

    # "Professor" "*sigh* All right, you're such a sweet girl, there's really no harm in that..."
    "教授" "唉……好吧，你真是个好女孩，这样做真的没什么坏处……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5152
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_f0b49e64:

    # "Professor" "I know of the item you asked about. It's one fine piece of magic engineering, based on ancient Cimerian principles... They used mithril to..."
    "教授" "我知道你问的那件东西。那是一件精妙绝伦的魔法工程杰作，基于古老的西米里亚原理……他们用秘银……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5154
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_bdf01d02:

    # narika "*growing impatient* Cut to the chase, old man, where is it?" with vpunch
    narika "*越来越不耐烦* 别拐弯抹角了，老头，东西在哪儿？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5156
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ba714924:

    # "The Professor stops, startled, Narika catches herself and immediately reverts to her schoolgirl act."
    "教授停了下来，吃了一惊，鸣香控制住了自己，并立即恢复了她优雅淑女的样子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5158
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_4df4556a:

    # narika "*in character* Pretty please, Prof-chan?"
    narika "*在性格上*拜托了，陈教授？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5160
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_30e2f23a:

    # "Professor" "Well, uhm... It's here in the Dean's vault, the most secure place in the whole University. Building it was an early feat for the Dean and we keep it away from the public, as it is priceless."
    "教授" "嗯……它就在院长金库里，这是全校最安全的地方。建造这个金库是院长早期的一项壮举，我们把它藏起来不对公众开放，因为它价值连城。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5162
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_51c8ce02:

    # narika "Of course, of course... And this vault is completely unbreachable, isn't it?"
    narika "当然，当然...而且这个金库是完全无法攻破的，不是吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5164
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_e43b128e:

    # "Professor" "Quite so! One would have to be a master at evading magical traps to even make it past the entrance to the vault, but then..."
    "教授" "的确如此！要想进入金库，就必须精通躲避魔法陷阱，但是……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5166
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ef6e2bfe:

    # narika "Yes? *eager*"
    narika "但是？ *渴望*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5168
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_b3eef211:

    # "Professor" "There's a final piece of security that no thief could ever work around..."
    "教授" "还有最后一道安全防线，任何窃贼都无法绕过……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5170
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_c60e1c20:

    # narika "What is it?" with vpunch
    narika "那是什么？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5172
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ba6fafe5:

    # "Professor" "It is, er... *lowers his voice*"
    "教授" "呃……（压低声音）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5174
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_8d648585:

    # "You can't quite make out what the Professor is saying. Narika raises an eyebrow."
    "你根本听不清教授在说什么。鸣香扬起一边眉毛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5176
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_f702184e:

    # narika "Really? I see..."
    narika "真的吗？我知道了..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5178
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ebe5546e:

    # "Professor" "So, that's all I know about it. Now, will you give me my... present?"
    "教授" "这就是我所知道的全部了。现在，你能把我的……礼物给我吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5180
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ce71f7e3:

    # narika "You know what, I have to go now, but I'll drop by next week and I'll give it to you for sure!"
    narika "你知道吗，我现在必须走了，但我下周会过来，我一定会把它给你！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5185
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_33a96761:

    # "Professor" "Wait, young lady! I-"
    "教授" "等等，小姐！我——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5187
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_a8a0af98:

    # "Professor" "She's gone..."
    "教授" "她走了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5191
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ad5148ee:

    # "You ponder what you just saw."
    "你思考你刚刚看到的事情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5193
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_48c762cc:

    # you "She's definitely out to get a magical item from the Vault."
    you "她肯定是想从金库里获取一件魔法物品。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5195
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_698800af:

    # you "It's not quite enough information to unravel her plan yet. I need to keep investigating."
    you "目前还没有足够的情报来揭露她的计划。我需要继续调查。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5199
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_fbd7af4e:

    # "You are back to Magic U. today, again touring the different classrooms looking for Narika."
    "今天你回到了魔法学院，再次巡视不同的教室寻找鸣香。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5201
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_49b669e2:

    # you "Day Four already. I only have one week. I need to make progress."
    you "已经第四天了。我只有一周的时间。我需要取得进展。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5203
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_18e401c7:

    # "You hear some yelling coming from one of the halls."
    "你听到其中一间大厅里传来一些叫喊声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5205
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_29eb6eae:

    # "Professor Emeritus" "Search again, damnit! It must be around somewhere! Masou will have my hide if she finds out I lost it!"
    "名誉教授" "Search again, damnit! It must be around somewhere! Masou will have my hide if she finds out I lost it!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5207
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_3886d55f:

    # "You catch a glimpse of half a dozen servants running around the vast and expensive lab, before one of them spots you and slams the door shut."
    "你瞥见六个仆人在这个巨大而昂贵的实验室里跑来跑去，然后其中一个发现了你并关上了门。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5209
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_60fd85d1:

    # "Intrigued, you keep exploring, when you suddenly hear something."
    "当你好奇地继续探索时，你突然听到了什么动静。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5212
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_36c8d30f:

    # ev_girl2 "Oh no! Help!" with vpunch
    ev_girl2 "哦不！救命！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5214
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ad54842f:

    # "The cry comes from one of the student rooms."
    "哭声从其中一间学生宿舍里传来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5221
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_f0448d2d:

    # ev_girl2 "Aaaah!!!" with vpunch
    ev_girl2 "啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5223
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_fcfde869:

    # ev_girl2 "I completely messed up the magic formula... The Demon is not obeying any of my orders!"
    ev_girl2 "我完全搞乱了魔法咒语...恶魔不听我的任何命令！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5225
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_065a69b2:

    # "You peek inside the room and see a student in the middle of a sticky situation."
    "你向房间里面看去，发现一名学生正处于困境之中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5241
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_acd854b5:

    # "Unsheathing your weapon, you leap inside the room and starts hacking at the creature."
    "你拔出武器，跳进房间并开始攻击那个生物。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5246
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ca9192d7:

    # "Stepping inside the room, you try to think fast and figure out the demon's type and weakness before it can fully take form in the material world."
    "走进房间，你快速思考，在恶魔在物质世界中完全成形之前找出它的类型和弱点。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5249
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_f03cca47:

    # ev_girl2 "Eeek!!! Help me!" with vpunch
    ev_girl2 "啊啊啊！！！救命！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5261
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_f616b77a:

    # "You slice off most of the monster's appendages."
    "你切掉了怪物的大部分附肢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5265
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_06098739:

    # "With a roar of pain, the demon withdraws and his body shines briefly before disappearing into thin air."
    "伴随着一声痛苦的咆哮，恶魔退了出去，身体短暂地发出光芒，然后消失在了稀薄的空气中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5268
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_044c47be:

    # you "POYE POLOMI!!!" with vpunch
    you "波耶·波洛米！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5272
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_bd267cff:

    # "Your fingers blast arcane lightning at the thing, searing his mind through the interdimensional veil. The creature withdraws in pain."
    "你的指尖向那怪物发射了一道闪电，透过维度灼烧他的思想。它痛苦地退缩了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5276
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_30689b99:

    # ev_girl2 "Oh, thank you so much!"
    ev_girl2 "哦，太谢谢你了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5278
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_bcadd1a3:

    # ev_girl2 "It's gone back to where it came from, it didn't have time to fully materialize!"
    ev_girl2 "它又回到了原来的地方，还没来得及完全实体化！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5282
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ec4cab1d:

    # "The girl is really grateful. She gives you something for your trouble."
    "她十分感激。给了你一些东西来答谢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5290
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_759587e9:

    # "The creature notices you, and a wrigling mass of tentacles spurts towards you."
    "怪物注意到了你，一大坨蠕动的触手向你喷射。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5292
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_89104e31:

    # "You fall back in disgust, trying to fence off the attacks as best as you can."
    "你嫌恶地向后退，尽可能地抵御攻击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5296
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_0cef24e1:

    # you "OUCH!!!" with vpunch
    you "哎哟！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5298
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_e7ffbee9:

    # "Alas, you hit your head hard on a shelf, and a dozen large and heavy magic tomes rain down on you."
    "砰，你的头重重地撞到了架子上，十几本又大又重的魔法书如雨点般落在你身上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5300
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_19008ad7:

    # "You are knocked out; fortunately the beast is content with leaving you alone and focussing its attention back on the hapless girl."
    "你被击败了；幸运的是，野兽放着你不管，将注意力集中在了那个倒霉的女孩身上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5306
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_19a1ee56:

    # "When you come back to your senses, the demon and the girl are nowhere to be seen."
    "等你回过神来，恶魔和少女已经不见了踪影。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5308
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_1616cb9b:

    # "Defeated, you head back home, with your stamina spent and a nasty headache."
    "你失败了，体力耗尽，头痛欲裂，你回到了家。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5314
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_3f1462e6:

    # you "(I shouldn't get involved, but I'll keep an eye on it. You know, just in case...)"
    you "（我不应该参与其中，但我会密切关注。你知道，只是以防万一......）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5320
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_0c3ccc94:

    # "Once the beast is sated, it goes into a half-asleep state. The girl finally begins to stir and motions to free herself."
    "一旦怪物满足了，它就会进入休眠状态。女孩终于开始动弹，并示意帮她挣脱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5322
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_13ee257d:

    # "You decide not to stick around and retreat before anyone sees you."
    "你决定离开此处，并在有人看到你之前撤退。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5325
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_a0ea2ed0:

    # you "Today is the fifth day of class... This time I will find that little minx."
    you "今天已经是第五天了...这次我要去找那个小妖精了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5329
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_b8c4ac9e:

    # sill "Master... You're sure about this?"
    sill "主人...你确定吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5331
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_29081e12:

    # you "Yes. Today, I will check the Dean's floor. Narika's probably been snooping around Shizuka's office."
    you "是的。今天，我将检查院长所在的那一层。鸣香大概一直在静香的办公室里调查。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5336
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_38bb0566:

    # "You cast a discretion spell on yourself. You'll try poking your nose inside the dean's office to see if there is anything fishy."
    "你对自己施加了潜行咒语。你可以试着把鼻子伸进院长办公室看看是否有什么可疑的东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5339
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_caf4baaf:

    # you "Your magic will help me. You have studied that discretion spell all night, as I commanded you?"
    you "你的魔法会帮助我。你已经按照我的命令整夜研究了那个潜行咒语了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5341
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_748862db:

    # sill "Yes... I didn't get any sleep... *sob*"
    sill "是的...我一夜没睡...*哽咽*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5343
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_b48e9ef7:

    # you "Good, good. What are you waiting for? Cast it!"
    you "好，很好。还等什么？施展咒语！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5347
translate chinese_simplified c3_narika_MU_class_ee53594a:

    # "Sill does her best to shield your aura from magic detection."
    "希露尽全力保护你不被魔法探测到。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:5349
