    "水晶" "我的知识和建议曾被认为十分宝贵。第一位大法师帕特里克提出用西米利亚魔法来保存我的灵魂。就在你眼前这块水晶碎片里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10532
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_837b6273:

    # "Crystal" "Perhaps 'offered' isn't the right word. Rather sentenced. Patrik wanted to harness my knowledge of the underworld. For his own purposes."
    "水晶" "或许用“提供”这个词并不恰当，更应该说是“判刑”。帕特里克想利用我对黑道的了解，为他自己所用。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10534
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_4a9b52b6:

    # girl.char "And you accepted?"
    girl.char "你接受了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10536
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_00df5e74:

    # "Crystal" "The alternative was quartering. So yes."
    "水晶" "另一种选择是将人分成四份。所以，是的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10538
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_29498da3:

    # "Crystal" "The joke's on him though. Now he's long gone. Most mages have forgotten that I exist. But I remain. I was reclaimed by Shalia and her followers a few centuries ago."
    "水晶" "不过，他才是笑到最后的人。他早已消失无踪。大多数法师都忘记了我的存在。但我依然存在。几个世纪前，我被莎莉娅和她的追随者们重新接纳。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10540
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e242dc2d:

    # girl.char "Centuries ago? Then you might know her..."
    girl.char "几个世纪以前？那你可能认识她……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10547
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_93f70b90:

    # girl.char "What are you doing here?"
    girl.char "你在这里做什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10549
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_c97d7c82:

    # "Crystal" "I am the covent's Mentor. I answer questions and offer advice to the faithful. And other curious souls like you."
    "水晶" "我是修道院的导师。我解答信徒们的疑问，并提供建议。也欢迎像你一样充满好奇心的人们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10551
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_206341ee:

    # "Crystal" "I can also tell people about our history. I was around for five or six centuries, after all."
    "水晶" "我还可以向人们讲述我们的历史。毕竟，我存在了五六个世纪。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10553
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_4289b6f2:

    # girl.char "Can you make time to answer all these questions?"
    girl.char "您能抽出时间回答所有这些问题吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10555
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_9e26fbee:

    # "Crystal" "You'd think it'd keep me busy. But not many people stop by. Overconfidence is a boon to the youth..."
    "水晶" "你可能会觉得这会让我忙个不停。但其实很少有人来。过度自信对年轻人来说是一种优势……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10557
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_3e315785:

    # "Crystal" "Until they get shanked in a dark alley."
    "水晶" "直到他们在黑暗的小巷里被人捅死。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10559
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_86ce0208:

    # "Crystal" "Now I sit here, and devise haikus. Would you like to hear one?"
    "水晶" "现在我坐在这里，创作俳句。你想听一首吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10561
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_c3b84d6d:

    # girl.char "Well... No."
    girl.char "嗯……不。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10568
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_08e943c2:

    # girl.char "You should know that Shalia's worship has been banned by the Council! That's why no one has come to the tower for a while."
    girl.char "你应该知道，议会已经禁止了对莎莉娅的崇拜！这就是为什么好久没人来塔楼的原因。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10570
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_d11237f9:

    # "Crystal" "Oh, again? It's only been a hot minute since the last time."
    "水晶" "哦，又来了？上次才过去没多久啊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10572
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_4a4d401f:

    # "Crystal" "What was it, like 80 years ago?"
    "水晶" "那大概是80年前的事了吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10574
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_99b7844b:

    # "Crystal" "Fret not, youngster. It's a momentary setback. Such bans only last for a few decades, half a century at most."
    "水晶" "别担心，年轻人。这只是暂时的挫折。这种禁令最多只会持续几十年，最多半个世纪。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10576
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e8a9cc2c:

    # "Crystal" "But that explains why {i}they{/i} are gathering outside..."
    "水晶" "但这就能解释为什么他们聚集在外面了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10578
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_8c16e03b:

    # girl.char "They? Who's they?"
    girl.char "他们？他们是谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10580
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_2dce234d:

    # "Crystal" "The golems. They've come for you, I'm afraid. You should hurry with your questions."
    "水晶" "那些魔像。恐怕它们是来抓你的。你最好快点问问题。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10582
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e89bace3:

    # girl.char "Oh, crap."
    girl.char "糟糕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10590
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_7dada8d1:

    # "[_name] gives the crystal a description of Mizuki."
    "[_name] 给水晶赋予了瑞希的描述。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10594
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f1deb67a:

    # girl.char "And we believe she was a Shalia follower. Would that ring any bell?"
    girl.char "我们认为她是莎莉娅的粉丝。你觉得这有道理吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10596
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_7d1c723b:

    # "The crystal gives a sort of chuckling noise."
    "水晶发出一种咯咯的笑声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10598
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_daea31ac:

    # "Crystal" "Of course it does. Child, I have known many merciless killers. But Ike Mizuki stands out. She's the most cold-blooded assassin I've ever met."
    "水晶" "当然了。孩子，我认识很多冷酷无情的杀手，但水木池绝对是其中最特别的一个。她是我见过的最冷血的刺客。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10600
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_5d85ba38:

    # girl.char "Mizuki? So you knew her under her alias?"
    girl.char "瑞希？原来你认识她的时候用的是化名？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10602
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_8e7d6078:

    # "Crystal" "I sure did. I gave it to her."
    "水晶" "没错，我把它给了她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10604
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_67a7e777:

    # girl.char "You... What?"
    girl.char "你……什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10609
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fca236fd:

    # "Crystal" "It happened two centuries ago. I was a dark night..."
    "水晶" "那件事发生在两个世纪前。我当时身处一个漆黑的夜晚……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10614
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_ec4af880:

    # "Shalia follower" "Mentor! Mentor!"
    "Shalia的追随者" "Mentor! Mentor!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10618
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_37b5ff97:

    # "Crystal" "Yes, son?"
    "水晶" "是的，儿子？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10620
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_1ebb73d4:

    # "Men pour into the room, out of breath. They are carrying a body on a stretcher."
    "几个男人气喘吁吁地涌进房间。他们用担架抬着一具尸体。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10622
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f4aa3b17:

    # "Shalia follower" "We found her outside in the snow... She has Shalia's mark on her..."
    "Shalia的追随者" "We found her outside in the snow... She has Shalia's mark on her..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10624
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_347a3c4f:

    # "Crystal" "Alive?"
    "水晶" "活？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10626
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_de181365:

    # "Shalia follower" "No, Mentor, we checked. Dead as a doornail. But it's not one of us who did her in, I swear."
    "Shalia的追随者" "No, Mentor, we checked. Dead as a doornail. But it's not one of us who did her in, I swear."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10628
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_2f3b5828:

    # "Crystal" "If she's dead, then... Why is she moving?"
    "水晶" "如果她死了，那么……她为什么还会动？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10632
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fcf42c5c:

    # "Shalia follower" "WHAAAAH!!!" with vpunch
    "Shalia的追随者" "WHAAAAH!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10634
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_7825c80c:

    # "The men drop the stretcher in awe as the cold body stirs."
    "男人们惊恐地扔下担架，因为冰冷的尸体动了一下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10636
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_ec1fd94e:

    # "Shalia follower" "What sorcery is this? She had no pulse! She was gone!"
    "Shalia的追随者" "What sorcery is this? She had no pulse! She was gone!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10638
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_bcbef94e:

    # "Crystal" "Shalia saw fit to protect her. A rare honor."
    "水晶" "莎莉娅决定保护她。这是难得的荣誉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10642
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_b86567fd:

    # "Crystal" "This is how I met her. Mizuki."
    "水晶" "我就是这样认识她的。瑞希。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10646
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_a3cfc3b5:

    # "Crystal" "When she got to her senses, she wouldn't answer anyone's questions. We nursed her back to a semblance of health, but she was mute for the whole time."
    "水晶" "她恢复意识后，拒绝回答任何人的问题。我们悉心照料她，让她恢复了些许健康，但她始终无法开口说话。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10648
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_c0ab3fbe:

    # "A wave of energy crackles around the crystal. Almost like a shiver."
    "一股能量波在水晶周围噼啪作响，几乎像一阵颤栗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10650
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_16acf921:

    # "Crystal" "When she finally spoke, months had passed. I still remember her words, crystal clear *cough*. She said..."
    "水晶" "她终于开口说话时，已经过去了几个月。我至今仍清晰地记得她的话（咳嗽）。她说……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10654
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_d2621dba:

    # mizuki angry "I need to kill someone. Teach me."
    mizuki angry "我需要杀人。教教我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10656
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_0f2b586f:

    # "Crystal" "We were all taken aback. She didn't seem the type. Some of the followers even thought she was from a well-to-do family in the city."
    "水晶" "我们都吓了一跳。她看起来不像那种人。有些粉丝甚至以为她出身于城里的富裕家庭。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10658
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fc694914:

    # "Crystal" "I too thought she had a soft side... I misjudged her."
    "水晶" "我也曾以为她有温柔的一面……我误判她了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10660
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_527a28a6:

    # "Crystal" "Regardless, she was under Shalia's protection. It was my duty to help."
    "水晶" "不管怎样，她当时在莎莉娅的保护之下。帮助她是我的职责。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10662
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_7a106ba0:

    # girl.char "What did you do?"
    girl.char "你做了什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10664
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e50b4569:

    # "Crystal" "There was a ninja school in the mountains nearby. It was the Water school, which seemed fitting."
    "水晶" "附近山里有一所忍者学校，是水遁忍者学校，这名字似乎很贴切。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10666
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e3206413:

    # "Crystal" "I pulled some favors to have her enroll there, under the alias 'Ike Mizuki'. She chose it."
    "水晶" "我动用了一些关系，让她以“水树池”的化名在那里入学。她自己选择了这所学校。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10668
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_64c6e97f:

    # "Crystal" "She trained at the ninja school for years. They told me she was exceptionally gifted and hard-working. She would visit us from time to time."
    "水晶" "她在忍者学校训练了好几年。他们告诉我她天赋异禀，而且非常勤奋。她会时不时地来看我们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10670
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_53b4d58d:

    # girl.char "You didn't ask her who she wanted to kill?"
    girl.char "你没问她想杀谁吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10672
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_ad57f822:

    # "Crystal" "In such matters, I know better than to pry."
    "水晶" "在这种事情上，我深知不该多管闲事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10674
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fb5730ec:

    # "Crystal" "Regardless, we soon found out."
    "水晶" "然而，我们很快就发现了这一点。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10676
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_6d36008c:

    # "Crystal" "There was a civil war in Westmarch at the time. Something about four kingdoms vying for ultimate power, or such political nonsense."
    "水晶" "当时西境正处于内战之中。大概是四个王国争夺最终权力之类的政治闹剧吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10678
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fbfd6a6f:

    # "Crystal" "A large battle was held to breach into one of the capital cities. A young lord died in that fight."
    "水晶" "为了攻入其中一座都城，双方爆发了一场大战。一位年轻的领主在那场战斗中阵亡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10680
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_60bd4f2a:

    # "Crystal" "As soon as Mizuki heard the news, she got up and left Karkyr, without a single word."
    "水晶" "水木一听到这个消息，就起身离开了卡尔基尔，一句话也没说。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10682
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_1d1c6b67:

    # "Crystal" "But the people who met her gaze that day swore they had seen death incarnate."
    "水晶" "但那天与她目光相遇的人都发誓，他们看到了死神化身。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10684
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_3480fe9d:

    # "Crystal" "We thought we would never hear from her again... But we were wrong."
    "水晶" "我们以为再也听不到她的消息了……但我们错了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10686
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_70f2823b:

    # girl.char "What happened?"
    girl.char "发生了什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10688
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_85024ed5:

    # "Crystal" "Back in Westmarch, lords started dying. Brutally."
    "水晶" "回到西境，领主们开始死去。死状极其惨烈。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10690
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_80161d08:

    # "Crystal" "It didn't matter how much security they had. They were picked off one by one."
    "水晶" "不管他们的安保措施有多严密，都无济于事。他们还是被一个接一个地干掉了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10694
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_a7c4b89e:

    # "Crystal" "For some, it was a blade..."
    "水晶" "对某些人来说，它是一把刀……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10698
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_94296edc:

    # "Crystal" "For others, poison..."
    "水晶" "对另一些人来说，则是毒药……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10702
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_2a26c6d2:

    # "Crystal" "Others again, magic..."
    "水晶" "另一些人则觉得，这简直太神奇了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10704
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_3c36c883:

    # "Crystal" "She dealt death in every possible way. Even..."
    "水晶" "她用尽一切手段杀人。甚至……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10709
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_4d961289:

    # "Echoes of a lord's voice" "Ngggh... N-No more... I-It hurts... P-Please let me go..."
    "领主的声音回荡" "Ngggh... N-No more... I-It hurts... P-Please let me go..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10713
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_12e62f74:

    # mizuki ninja "Fufufu... Of course."
    mizuki ninja "呵呵……当然了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10718
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_25995742:

    # "Echoes of a lord's voice" "M-M-Mercy!!! AAARGH!!!"
    "领主的声音回荡" "M-M-Mercy!!! AAARGH!!!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10722
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_bee3a762:

    # mizuki "Finally, it's my turn to have a good time."
    mizuki "终于轮到我好好享受一番了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10724
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_07e037e2:

    # mizuki "Time to drop dead, dear father-in-law."
    mizuki "岳父大人，是时候去死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10728
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_2c0b8bdd:

    # "*twist*"
    "*捻*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10733
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_1566bb39:

    # "Echoes of a lord's voice" "AAAAARH!!!" with vpunch
    "领主的声音回荡" "AAAAARH!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10737
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_00cd8286:

    # "Crystal" "Everyone she marked for death, died."
    "水晶" "所有被她判处死刑的人，都死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10739
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f8b77c6e:

    # "Crystal" "The Western realms were thrown into chaos, all of their ruling families decimated."
    "水晶" "西方诸国陷入混乱，所有统治家族都被消灭殆尽。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10741
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_5f9aa092:

    # "Crystal" "But she didn't stop in Westmarch. The trail of murders continued, and I still hear about it to this day. 200 years later."
    "水晶" "但她并没有止步于西境。谋杀案仍在继续，直到今天，两百年过去了，我仍然能听到这些故事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10743
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_8cc3c939:

    # "Crystal" "Seems I'm not the only one who cheated death."
    "水晶" "看来我不是唯一一个死里逃生的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10752
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f10e28d6:

    # "[_name] thanks the Mentor for what he told her, then takes her leave."
    "[_name] 感谢导师告诉她的一切，然后告辞了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10757
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_d065bd31:

    # "As she exits the tower, [_name] is confronted by a towering figure, a massive golem guard infused with magical energy."
    "当她走出高塔时，[_name] 遇到了一个高大的身影，一个充满魔法能量的巨大魔像守卫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10761
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_42640071:

    # golem "This building if off-limit to the public. You have been found in violation of Council resolution 50E-B512A."
    golem "此建筑禁止公众进入。您已被认定违反了市议会第50E-B512A号决议。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10763
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_a9086839:

    # golem "You will now be removed from the city perimeter. Any resistance will be met with lethal force."
    golem "你现在将被驱逐出城市警戒线。任何抵抗都将遭到致命武力镇压。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10765
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_0bdc59aa:

    # "Unwilling to risk a confrontation, [_name] follows the golem guards quietly to the city's outskirts."
    "由于不愿冒险发生冲突，[_name] 悄悄地跟随魔像守卫来到了城市郊外。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10772
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_d5d69758:

    # golem "Unlawful worshipper. You have been banned from the city for a duration of... One year. Any attempt to enter the city premises again will be met..."
    golem "非法礼拜者。你已被禁止进入本市，禁令为期一年。任何再次试图进入本市的行为都将受到处罚。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10774
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_ded434d9:

    # girl.char "...with lethal force, yeah, yeah, I get it."
    girl.char "……使用致命武力，是啊，是啊，我明白了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10782
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_5e6c3f76:

    # girl.char "So I looked everywhere for information within the city."
    girl.char "于是我在城里到处寻找相关信息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10784
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_75f9fab8:

    # girl.char "But I could never find out where that cursed tower was. People would just shut me down every time I asked."
    girl.char "但我始终找不到那座被诅咒的高塔在哪里。每次我问起，人们都对我避而不答。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10786
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_5b670ab6:

    # girl.char "Eventually my stipend ran out, I had to come back."
    girl.char "最终我的津贴用完了，我不得不回来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10792
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_00a8f6f7:

    # girl.char "And that's it. After that, I took the next wagon out of the city, and came straight back to you."
    girl.char "事情就是这样。之后，我搭上下一班马车出了城，直接回到了你身边。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10796
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_7c079a29:

    # you "Very impressive. You did very well."
    you "非常棒！你做得很好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10802
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_eb944994:

    # girl.char "Thank you, Master."
    girl.char "感谢师父。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10806
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_c91b4dfd:

    # you "I guess we found at least one hint. I hope we can learn more."
    you "我想我们至少找到了一条线索。希望我们能了解更多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10808
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fc6b92a2:

    # girl.char "Yes, Master."
    girl.char "是的，主人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10812
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_57d51302:

    # you "So you were not able to retrieve even a single piece of useful information?"
    you "所以你连一条有用的信息都没能获取到？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10814
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_6129a434:

    # girl.char "I'm sorry, Master, I... *look down*"
    girl.char "对不起，主人，我……*低头*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10818
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_57f970f3:

    # you "Well, you did your best. It's on me for giving you an assignment that was too hard."
    you "你已经尽力了。怪我给你布置了太难的作业。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10820
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_21005255:

    # girl.char "Sorry..."
    girl.char "对不起..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10822
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_0219507e:

    # you "Please go get some rest."
    you "请去休息一下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10828
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f8c6a213:

    # you "What a waste of time and money. You will have to work extra hard to make up for that! Out of my sight!"
    you "真是浪费时间和金钱！你得加倍努力才能弥补！滚出我的视线！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10830
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_fbf00f5d:

    # girl.char "Aw..."
    girl.char "啊……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10839
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_e1d2ed04:

    # "Suzume looks defeated."
    "铃芽看起来很沮丧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10841
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_23660b39:

    # suzume doubt "[MC.name], I'm afraid this failure means we won't be able to uncover Mizuki's secret. We are missing some important clues..."
    suzume doubt "[MC.name]，恐怕这次失败意味着我们无法揭开瑞希的秘密。我们缺少一些重要的线索……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10846
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_f05cc9d3:

    # suzume "I believe we now know enough to expose Mizuki's secret."
    suzume "我相信我们现在已经掌握了足够的信息来揭露瑞希的秘密。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10848
translate chinese_simplified c3_crystal_menu_26d0d557:

    # "You can call on Suzume from the {b}Visit city{/b} screen to progress Mizuki's story."
    "你可以从“访问城市”界面召唤铃芽，推进瑞希的故事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10855
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_6708efac:

    # girl.char "You wanted to see me, Master?"
    girl.char "主人，您想见我吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10857
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_c936c862:

    # you "Yes. I'm going to send you on a secret mission to Westmarch."
    you "是的，我要派你去西境执行一项秘密任务。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10860
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_649d83fb:

    # girl.char "Oh, I'm from Westmarch!"
    girl.char "哦，我来自西境！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10862
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_6db7bc05:

    # you "It's good, because I will need someone who knows the lay of the land."
    you "这很好，因为我需要一个了解当地情况的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10864
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_a8dcdb51:

    # you "You will need to investigate some political events that happened there 200 years ago."
    you "你需要调查200年前在那里发生的一些政治事件。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10866
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_47f21065:

    # girl.char "200 years ago? Why?"
    girl.char "200年前？为什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10868
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_1eccc3fe:

    # you "Suzume will fill you in on the details. You'll leave on the next stagecoach to the West."
    you "铃芽会告诉你详情。你将搭乘下一班前往西部的驿马车。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10872
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_go_2f5f95bc:

    # "[girl.fullname] leaves for Westmarch."
    "[girl.fullname] 前往西境。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10878
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_b2543a7a:

    # girl.char "Master, I have learned many things from my travels. It is a long and poignant story about Mizuki's past..."
    girl.char "师父，我从旅途中学到了很多东西。这是一个关于瑞希过去漫长而感人的故事……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10880
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_f183b621:

    # you "Oh, that? Forget it, that won't be necessary."
    you "哦，你说的是那个吗？算了，没必要了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10882
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_9c60f913:

    # girl.char "Whaaaat???" with vpunch
    girl.char "什么？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10884
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_e3139556:

    # suzume "Oh yeah, we got rid of her already!"
    suzume "哦，是的，我们已经把她甩掉了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10886
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_b41b3408:

    # girl.char "B-B-But what about my story?"
    girl.char "BB：可是我的故事呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10888
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_d7f65e36:

    # you "Oh, you can tell Sill, she's dying to hear all the details."
    you "哦，你可以告诉希尔，她很想知道所有细节。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10890
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_f24c5062:

    # sill sad "What? I, uh, no... I need to clean the attic..."
    sill sad "什么？呃，不……我需要打扫阁楼……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10892
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_b41c3436:

    # girl.char "Wait, where are you all going? Waiiiit!!!"
    girl.char "等等，你们都要去哪儿？等等！！！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10898
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_quest_check_6a8f9477:

    # "[girl.fullname] is now back to [brothel.name]. You may want to let her rest before putting her back on the job."
    "[girl.fullname] 现在回到了 [brothel.name]。你最好让她休息一下再让她重新开始工作。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10905
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_5c894fcd:

    # girl.char "[girl.fullname] returns from Westmarch."
    girl.char "[girl.fullname] 从西境返回。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10909
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_c0bfa3d6:

    # suzume "[MC.name], good news! [girl.fullname] just got back from Westmarch."
    suzume "[MC.name]，好消息！[girl.fullname]刚从西境回来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10911
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_d9907b47:

    # "[_name]'s clothes are damp from the constant mist and rain on the road to Westmarch. She looks tired and miserable."
    "[_name]的衣服被前往西境的路上持续不断的雾雨浸湿了。她看起来疲惫不堪，十分沮丧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10913
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_18497c41:

    # "You tell Sill to get her a change of fresh clothes before she sits down before you to report."
    "你告诉希尔，在她坐下向你汇报之前，给她拿一套干净的衣服来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10919
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_1b278a60:

    # you "So, how did your investigation of Mizuki in Westmarch go?"
    you "那么，你在西境对瑞希的调查进展如何？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10923
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_66f901f9:

    # girl.char "It was... Complicated. Even finding the right place was a challenge."
    girl.char "情况……很复杂。就连找到合适的地方都是个挑战。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10930
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_64a2f7b8:

    # girl.char "Westmarch is comprised of many independent cities. Based on Suzume's information, I targeted the larger ones, but I didn't find what I was looking for until I reached the old royal capital, Telago."
    girl.char "西境由许多独立的城市组成。根据铃芽提供的信息，我优先搜索了较大的城市，但直到抵达旧王都特拉戈，才找到我想要的东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10932
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_edc2d7c0:

    # girl.char "The older people there could remember the Lady in blue, as they called her. She was the wife of a Prince, came from Karkyr, then she died a tragic death."
    girl.char "那里年纪大的人都记得那位被他们称为“蓝衣女士”的女子。她是一位王子的妻子，来自卡尔基尔，后来死于非命。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10934
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_f977138c:

    # suzume "It matches what we know about Mizuki's story."
    suzume "这与我们对瑞希的故事的了解相符。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10936
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_3d544cea:

    # girl.char "People were fuzzy on the details, but after some time I heard about someone who could be of help..."
    girl.char "人们对细节了解得并不清楚，但过了一段时间后，我听说有人或许能提供帮助……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10940
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_0635c6c2:

    # woman "...that old coot still lives in the old Mitsuhide Manor. You can find him there at most times, but beware, he isn't the friendly sort."
    woman "……那个老家伙还住在光秀旧宅里。你大多数时候都能在那里见到他，不过要小心，他可不是个友善的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10942
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_5e0ee98f:

    # girl.char "An old man living alone in an abandoned manor... Thats isn't much to go on, but it's my best lead yet."
    girl.char "一位老人独自住在废弃的庄园里……线索不多，但这是我目前为止找到的最好线索。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10946
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_dfbda9b9:

    # girl.char "Finally, I found it..."
    girl.char "最后，我找到了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10948
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_b4dd1324:

    # girl.char "This isn't a house, it's a palace! Definitely the home of a High Lord..."
    girl.char "这可不是房子，这是宫殿！绝对是位高阶领主的府邸……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10950
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_7ca28e91:

    # girl.char "Could it really be that only one man lives here?"
    girl.char "难道这里真的只有一个人居住吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10954
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_a02ede4d:

    # "Old Elf" "Go away!"
    "老精灵" "Go away!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10956
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_ca1bc608:

    # girl.char "Eh?"
    girl.char "嗯？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10958
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_ea2b70a4:

    # "Old Elf" "Go away! Don't loiter, or I will call the militia!"
    "老精灵" "Go away! Don't loiter, or I will call the militia!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10960
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_a0944fbe:

    # "An old skinny man is barring the way with his diminutive frame, dressed in clothes that were once fancy but are way past their prime."
    "一位瘦骨嶙峋的老人挡住了去路，他身穿的衣服曾经华丽，但早已过时。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10964
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_b44e771d:

    # girl.char "S-Sir?" with vpunch
    girl.char "先生？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10966
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_043652b2:

    # "[_name] is stunned to see that the man is in fact an elf, a rare sight in Zan. And a male one at that, which is even rarer."
    "[_name] 震惊地发现，眼前这个人竟然是一位精灵，这在赞恩大陆极为罕见。而且还是男性精灵，那就更是凤毛麟角了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10968
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_369d389b:

    # "Old Elf" "What's the matter with you, wench, are you deaf? Why are you staring at me like this?"
    "老精灵" "What's the matter with you, wench, are you deaf? Why are you staring at me like this?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10970
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_62cafa5b:

    # girl.char "N-Nothing, Sir, I've just never met a male elf before..."
    girl.char "没、没什么，先生，我只是以前从没见过男性精灵……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10972
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_aa51bc20:

    # "She has to remind herself that unlike Zan, the Western principalities are not actually at war with the Elves, although racist sentiment is as prevalent here as anywhere else."
    "她必须提醒自己，与赞恩不同，西方诸侯国实际上并没有与精灵族交战，尽管种族主义情绪在这里和其他地方一样普遍。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10974
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_76cad4dc:

    # "Old Elf" "What, you uncough peasant have never seen a city elf? You think all Elves are like these wretches who hide in the forest, munching on roots and drinking plant juice like the degenerates they are?"
    "老精灵" "What, you uncough peasant have never seen a city elf? You think all Elves are like these wretches who hide in the forest, munching on roots and drinking plant juice like the degenerates they are?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10976
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_af5919c0:

    # girl.char "N-No..."
    girl.char "不……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10978
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_a9b2cfdd:

    # "Old Elf" "Well now you have. Now, go away, shoo."
    "老精灵" "Well now you have. Now, go away, shoo."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10980
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_ccbd72ea:

    # girl.char "Wait! Please Sir, do you live here? It's you I've come seeking."
    girl.char "等等！先生，您住在这里吗？我是来找您的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10982
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_898251c9:

    # "Old Elf" "Me? Ha! Preposterous!"
    "老精灵" "Me? Ha! Preposterous!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10984
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_869f8194:

    # "Old Elf" "What in Arios's name would a street girl like you have to do with me, a proud servant of the Mitsuhide Clan?"
    "老精灵" "What in Arios's name would a street girl like you have to do with me, a proud servant of the Mitsuhide Clan?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10986
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_4e3cae9f:

    # girl.char "The Mitsuhide Clan? But... There doesn't seem to be anyone else living here."
    girl.char "光秀一族？可是……这里似乎没有其他人居住。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10988
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_fadb1fbc:

    # "Old Elf" "*sigh deeply* No, not anymore... But I keep the glorious memory of the Mitsuhide's alive, and I will for the centuries to come, for as long as I draw breath!"
    "老精灵" "*sigh deeply* No, not anymore... But I keep the glorious memory of the Mitsuhide's alive, and I will for the centuries to come, for as long as I draw breath!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10990
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_b92c7c6a:

    # girl.char "Such loyalty is... Noteworthy? Err, can you tell me about the Mitsuhide family?"
    girl.char "这种忠诚……值得称道？呃，你能跟我说说光秀家的情况吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10992
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_e6bec8eb:

    # "The old elf suddenly mellows and starts spewing information at her. [_name] has clearly stumbled upon his favorite topic."
    "老精灵突然变得温和起来，开始滔滔不绝地向她讲述各种信息。[_name] 显然偶然发现了自己最喜欢的话题。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10994
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_f9019d2b:

    # "Old Elf" "The flamboyant Mitsuhide family, pride of Telago, and beloved champions of Westmarch! Of course, I know all about it!"
    "老精灵" "The flamboyant Mitsuhide family, pride of Telago, and beloved champions of Westmarch! Of course, I know all about it!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10996
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_0e0ba93c:

    # "Old Elf" "There is a reason the name 'Mitsuhide' is revered and feared in equal measure across our lands and beyond... It was the most powerful and enlightenned family to ever grace these parts. There were no other clan like them, and mark my words, there shan't be another!"
    "老精灵" "There is a reason the name 'Mitsuhide' is revered and feared in equal measure across our lands and beyond... It was the most powerful and enlightenned family to ever grace these parts. There were no other clan like them, and mark my words, there shan't be another!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:10998
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_e2d825b6:

    # "Old Elf" "They were patrons to warriors, priests and artists alike, and they very nearly united Westmarch as one country, were it not for their untimely demise..."
    "老精灵" "They were patrons to warriors, priests and artists alike, and they very nearly united Westmarch as one country, were it not for their untimely demise..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11000
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_27fecfad:

    # girl.char "Really? What happened?"
    girl.char "真的吗？发生了什么事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11002
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_fdb9eaf3:

    # "Old Elf" "I was but a young lad with no hair on my chin then... Barely 60 years old... To think such an illustrious clan could stumble and fall, all because of the sins of a cursed woman!"
    "老精灵" "I was but a young lad with no hair on my chin then... Barely 60 years old... To think such an illustrious clan could stumble and fall, all because of the sins of a cursed woman!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11004
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_2dc7cf45:

    # girl.char "A cursed woman? Tell me more..."
    girl.char "一个被诅咒的女人？跟我说说更多……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11006
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_1dc174ea:

    # "The man clams up all of a sudden."
    "那人突然沉默不语。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11008
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_1e7b5562:

    # "Old Elf" "That vile, evil blue witch! I won't say a word about that wretch. Now, leave me be!"
    "老精灵" "That vile, evil blue witch! I won't say a word about that wretch. Now, leave me be!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11010
translate chinese_simplified mizuki_w_back_b51fd6cc:

    # "[_name] suddenly panics: she is in danger of losing the plot, this close to succeeding."
    "[_name] 突然惊慌失措：她眼看就要成功了，却有可能会功亏一篑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:11012
