    # mizuki angry "A {i}nice{/i} woman? Ha! For all the good it did me. *frown*"
    mizuki angry "一个好女人？哈！对我一点好处都没有。*皱眉*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12754
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_44a729b9:

    # mizuki "If anything, my story should serve as a warning for anyone who thinks being good will get you anywhere - in this life or the next."
    mizuki "我的故事应该能给那些认为行善就能让你有所收获的人敲响警钟——无论是在今生还是来世。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12756
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_207c0799:

    # mizuki normal "I was a spoiled noble girl with a heart full of ideals and a head full of air."
    mizuki normal "我曾是一个娇生惯养的贵族小姐，心中充满理想，头脑却空洞无物。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12758
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_9fd380b6:

    # mizuki "I was wooed by the first playboy to show up at my dad's court... And, no surprise, it turned out he was only after my father's money."
    mizuki "我被第一个出现在我父亲庄园里的花花公子追求了……不出所料，他只是觊觎我父亲的钱财。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12760
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_d64f4f84:

    # mizuki sad "All I wanted from this life was to be a good daughter, a good wife, and a good mother... And I failed on all counts."
    mizuki sad "我这辈子唯一的愿望就是做一个好女儿、好妻子、好母亲……结果我全都失败了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12763
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_11fdb519:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12768
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_d2f18669:

    # you "But you tried to do the right-"
    you "但你努力想做正确的事——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12770
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_94afe921:

    # mizuki angry "And what for? Every kindness I ever did, was repaid in cruelty." with vpunch
    mizuki angry "这一切又是为了什么？我所做的每一件事，都换来了残酷的回报。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12772
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_3159c0c6:

    # mizuki "It's only when I started to wield a blade, that I could begin to make things right."
    mizuki "只有当我开始挥舞利刃时，我才能开始拨乱反正。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12777
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_53204706:

    # you "You failed because you were too soft."
    you "你失败是因为你太心软了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12779
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_c72045b8:

    # mizuki "Ha! You got that right. How I despise my old self for it."
    mizuki "哈！你说得对。我真恨以前的自己。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12781
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_ca84000a:

    # mizuki "I paid dearly for my weakness."
    mizuki "我为自己的软弱付出了惨痛的代价。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12784
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_e1e8da72:

    # you "Many people make mistakes. You couldn't know it would end like this."
    you "很多人都会犯错。你不可能预料到事情会以这种方式结束。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12786
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_ef3d1a4d:

    # mizuki "Yes, I was a young fool, and fools are a denar a dozen."
    mizuki "是的，我当时是个年轻的傻瓜，而傻瓜到处都是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12788
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_2b423ab7:

    # mizuki "But I'm old and deadly now. I don't make mistakes anymore."
    mizuki "但我现在老了，而且身手不凡。我不会再犯错了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12790
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_e1bbf9d3:

    # mizuki normal "I had to die and be reborn for it. But now, I know the hearts of men and women."
    mizuki normal "我必须经历死亡和重生才能做到这一点。但现在，我了解了男人和女人的心。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12792
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_35151840:

    # mizuki "And I know that all most of them deserve is a knife between the shoulders."
    mizuki "我知道他们大多数人罪有应得，只配被人用刀捅穿肩膀。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12794
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_568fa98f:

    # you "You're scary..."
    you "你真可怕……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12796
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_1a1e6551:

    # mizuki normal "Well, at least I'm still on the fence about you, sweetheart. That's why you're still standing."
    mizuki normal "好吧，至少我对你还持观望态度，亲爱的。这就是你还站在这里的原因。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12802
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_3350cbbc:

    # you "I know you started a new family in Westmarch with your husband. You even had a child, a boy..."
    you "我知道你和丈夫在韦斯特马奇组建了新的家庭。你们甚至还有了个孩子，一个男孩……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12807
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_c31a622e:

    # mizuki angry "DON'T MENTION HIM! NOT NOW! NOT EVER!!!" with flash
    mizuki angry "别提他！现在别提！以后也别提！！！" with flash

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12811
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_5c6b2fec:

    # "Her voice booms, otherworldly. A gust of icy wind rush by you."
    "她的声音洪亮而空灵。一阵刺骨的寒风从你身边呼啸而过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12813
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_18bd1005:

    # "You keep your mouth shut. For the first time, she really looks like a spook to you."
    "你保持沉默。你第一次觉得她真的像个幽灵。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12817
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_7c0c4493:

    # "Fury flickers in her eyes, then fades. The icy commotion dies down."
    "她眼中闪过一丝怒意，随即消散。冰冷的骚动也随之平息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12819
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_1cb05716:

    # mizuki normal "*sigh* I know you have nothing to do with these Mitsuhide pigs, nor with my son's fate. But his memory is mine to cherish."
    mizuki normal "唉，我知道你跟这些光秀猪猡没有任何关系，也跟我儿子的命运无关。但他的记忆，我将永远珍藏。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12821
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_a041d5f7:

    # mizuki sad "They took my family from me, my honor, and even my life. But the one sin I will never forgive is, they killed my son."
    mizuki sad "他们夺走了我的家人、我的荣誉，甚至我的生命。但我永远无法原谅的罪孽是，他们杀死了我的儿子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12823
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_970f56c6:

    # you "Didn't he die in battle?"
    you "他不是战死沙场了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12825
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_1564d026:

    # mizuki angry "They sent a mere boy to storm a wall, when he had no idea what he was doing! They might as well have held the lance that pierced his gut."
    mizuki angry "他们竟然派一个懵懂无知的男孩去攻城，他根本不知道自己在干什么！他们还不如拿着刺穿他腹部的长矛呢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12827
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_97373183:

    # mizuki "They poisoned his mind with tales of heroism, while they comfortably sat on their ass in the back of every engagement..."
    mizuki "他们用英雄事迹毒害他的思想，而他们自己却在每次战斗中都舒舒服服地坐在后排……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12829
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_f95f9319:

    # mizuki "That heartless dog, my so-called 'husband', never lifted a finger to help raise him. But he sure knew how to send him to his death."
    mizuki "那条冷血无情的狗，我所谓的“丈夫”，从来没帮过他一把。但他却很懂得如何送他去死。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12831
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_387171da:

    # mizuki "But soon, he shall be avenged. I'll make sure the last of their cursed blood is spilled and swallowed by the dark earth."
    mizuki "但很快，他必将得到复仇。我一定会让他们的最后一滴血都洒落在黑暗的大地上，被其吞噬。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12837
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_86f5a106:

    # you "I know how you were betrayed... Your husband repudiated you, chased you away from his city..."
    you "我知道你是如何被背叛的……你的丈夫抛弃了你，把你赶出了他的城市……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12839
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_063ad672:

    # "She spits her next words angrily."
    "她愤怒地吐出接下来的话。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12841
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_8a4d577c:

    # mizuki angry "The fucking mongrel! The dirty whoreson! Let me tell you, his death was slow and painful... But everyday I regret not making it ten times worse."
    mizuki angry "这个该死的杂种！这个肮脏的混蛋！我告诉你，他死得很慢很痛苦……但我每天都后悔没让他死得更惨十倍。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12843
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_ed00ebba:

    # mizuki "I got all the others, too. His parents, his uncles, his brothers, his mistresses, his bastards... But he was my first kill, and the most satisfying."
    mizuki "其他人我也都杀了。他的父母、叔伯、兄弟、情妇、私生子……但他是我第一个杀的人，也是最让我感到满足的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12845
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_34095154:

    # mizuki sad "What they did to me... They took my life away..."
    mizuki sad "他们对我做了什么……他们夺走了我的生命……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12847
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_5ec6b1f7:

    # mizuki "I could have died in my bed 200 years ago, a happy and dumb wife, living only to pop out more heirs for the local lordling..."
    mizuki "我本可以两百年前就死在床上，做一个幸福而愚钝的妻子，活着只是为了给当地的小贵族生更多的继承人……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12849
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_ff689d9e:

    # mizuki normal "Now, you and I would consider this kind of life appalling, but it would have been a blessing. I would have suffered much less."
    mizuki normal "现在，你我或许会觉得这种生活很糟糕，但对我来说却是一种福气。那样我会少受很多苦。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12851
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_c1f38461:

    # you "You took your own life..."
    you "你结束了自己的生命……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12853
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_d2ab2f53:

    # mizuki "Did I really? I'm still standing before you, am I not? Good old Sui was so helpless, she couldn't even off herself."
    mizuki "我真的站在这里了吗？我还站在你面前，不是吗？可怜的老隋真是无助，连自杀都做不到。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12855
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_97a10bbd:

    # mizuki "Don't mistake {i}me{/i} for that hopeless fool. {i}She{/i} died."
    mizuki "别把我当成那个无可救药的傻瓜。她死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12861
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_42b2a332:

    # you "You died, didn't you? How did you survive? How did you make your way back to Karkyr?"
    you "你死了，对吧？你是怎么活下来的？你是怎么回到卡尔基尔的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12863
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_11ccccf9:

    # mizuki normal "I haven't the faintest idea... And I don't care."
    mizuki normal "我一点头绪都没有……而且我也不在乎。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12865
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_1eec3d51:

    # mizuki "That old talking crystal at the Tower thought I received Shalia's blessing or some such nonsense. Maybe, maybe not, but that's not my concern."
    mizuki "塔楼里那块会说话的老水晶以为我得到了莎莉娅的祝福之类的胡言乱语。也许是，也许不是，但这与我无关。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12867
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_31a2e807:

    # mizuki "All I know is that I gained powers. My natural affinity for water magic emerged much stronger, and that I could disappear like a ghost."
    mizuki "我只知道我获得了力量。我对水系魔法的天然亲和力变得更加强大，而且我还能像幽灵一样消失。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12869
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_d63e7cac:

    # mizuki "I like the power, but I couldn't care less where it comes from. I despise gods and their schemes, and bringing me back to this valley of tears was {i}not{/i} a kindness."
    mizuki "我喜欢这种力量，但我根本不在乎它从何而来。我鄙视神明和他们的阴谋诡计，把我带回这泪谷绝非仁慈。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12871
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_cbff7a9e:

    # you "Did it change you?"
    you "它改变了你吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12873
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_313f34b0:

    # mizuki "Not immediately. When I was reborn, I could feel a rage inside, a white-hot fury I didn't think I was capable of."
    mizuki "并非立刻如此。当我重生时，我感到内心燃起一股怒火，一种我从未想过自己能够拥有的炽热狂怒。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12875
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_31ac71e0:

    # mizuki "I wanted revenge, so I honed my skills as a killer. It's good that the local ninja temple would have me, but I would have sold my body just as well to the first rogue I met, if he'd teach me how not to hold a dagger upside down."
    mizuki "我一心复仇，所以磨练了自己的杀手技艺。当地的忍者寺庙愿意收留我固然是好事，但如果我遇到的第一个恶棍愿意教我如何正确握匕首，我也会毫不犹豫地出卖自己的身体。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12877
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_5f88629e:

    # mizuki "But I was still soft. The more I trained, the more foolish my plans for revenge seemed to be. I dithered. I delayed."
    mizuki "但我仍然心软。我训练得越多，就越觉得我的复仇计划愚蠢至极。我犹豫不决，拖延不决。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12879
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_da29b7eb:

    # you "Something put your plans into motion."
    you "某些事情促使你的计划开始实施。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12881
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_f1c77232:

    # mizuki sad "Yes. As I was pondering whether I was ready to get my revenge for the umpteenth time, words came that my son had died in battle."
    mizuki sad "是的。正当我琢磨着是否该第N次复仇的时候，却传来消息说我的儿子战死沙场。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12883
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_091a8b2a:

    # "For the first time, tears start to stream freely down her face. The mighty ghost killer is crying, just before your eyes."
    "她第一次泪流满面。就在你眼前，这位强大的驱魔人竟然哭了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12885
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_328e0c75:

    # mizuki "I couldn't believe it. My baby was a child still, barely sixteen."
    mizuki "我简直不敢相信。我的孩子还是个孩子，才十六岁。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12887
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_189668cd:

    # mizuki "It was his first battle, a siege. I was told he was the first over the wall."
    mizuki "那是他参加的第一场战斗，一场围城战。我听说他是第一个翻过城墙的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12889
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_42fc9d2d:

    # mizuki "He wanted to impress his dog of a father, to gain his approval... As if that worthless piece of shit could feel anything over than vanity and envy."
    mizuki "他想博得他那狗一样父亲的欢心，获得他的认可……仿佛那个没用的人渣除了虚荣和嫉妒之外还能感受到其他任何东西似的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12891
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_93ea3566:

    # mizuki normal "I left the temple immediately. Let me tell you, I never again hesitated."
    mizuki normal "我立刻离开了寺庙。我告诉你，我之后再也没有犹豫过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12893
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_c5323690:

    # mizuki "I spent years hunting them all down... The Mitsuhide's, that cursed King whose army slaughtered my son, their relatives and relatives of their relatives..."
    mizuki "我花了数年时间追捕他们……光秀家族，那个该死的国王，他的军队屠杀了我的儿子，还有他们的亲戚，以及他们的亲戚的亲戚……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12895
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_e8bf3447:

    # mizuki "They were all oh-so-ambitious, so keen to build their legacy. I made sure their bloodlines were completely extinguished."
    mizuki "他们都野心勃勃，一心想建立自己的显赫家世。我确保他们的血脉彻底断绝。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12897
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_ab1aa6e1:

    # mizuki "As I speak to you, my work on this earth is nearly done..."
    mizuki "当我与你们交谈时，我在世上的使命已接近尾声……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12901
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_f03a701f:

    # you "Thank you for telling me your story. I still don't understand how you came back from the dead, but regardless: why are you here now? In Zan?"
    you "谢谢你跟我讲述你的故事。我至今仍然不明白你是如何死而复生的，但无论如何：你现在为什么会在这里？在赞恩？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12903
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_5fa9ba14:

    # mizuki normal "Hmph. You know my story now, so I might as well indulge you. But if you squeal, you know I won't hesitate to put a dagger in your heart."
    mizuki normal "哼。既然你现在知道了我的故事，那我就顺着你讲讲吧。不过你要是敢告密，我可不会手软，我会毫不犹豫地一刀捅进你的心脏。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12905
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_9b38c8ff:

    # you "That is a given."
    you "这是理所当然的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12907
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_fc3488f4:

    # mizuki "I told you I hunted the Mitsuhide's to the last, and I almost did."
    mizuki "我告诉过你，我会追捕光秀一伙到最后一刻，而且我几乎做到了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12909
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_06e371c6:

    # mizuki "But these cockroaches had a way to multiply, what with their dalliances and cousins and whatnot."
    mizuki "但是这些蟑螂有办法繁殖，靠的是它们的婚外情、亲戚等等。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12911
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_2b9b6094:

    # mizuki "One by one I got them, even after they had fled to the four corners of the known world."
    mizuki "即使他们逃到了已知世界的四个角落，我还是一个接一个地抓住了他们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12913
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_1ae7da22:

    # mizuki "But one of them remains. A couple of decades ago, I learnt about a holdover from the Mitsuhide bloodline, the long lost heir to some bastard who fled Westmarch during the war."
    mizuki "但其中一人还活着。二十年前，我得知了光秀血脉的后裔，他是某个在战争期间逃离西境的私生子的失散多年的继承人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12915
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_6f847997:

    # mizuki "When I got to him, he had already been killed, strangely enough. But he has a daughter..."
    mizuki "当我找到他时，他已经遇害了，真是匪夷所思。但他有个女儿……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:12917
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_investigation_menu_68c59801:

    # you "Daughter? You mean you kill innocent women too?"
    you "女儿？你是说你也杀害无辜女性？"

