    # "Now fully sated, you drift away into half-sleep, only to be roused by a chill breeze upon your bare skin."
    "你心满意足地进入了半梦半醒的状态，却被拂过裸露肌肤的凉风惊醒。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14157
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_b1cf126d:

    # you "Is the window open? Mizuki?"
    you "窗户开着吗？瑞希？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14159
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_45bcbe7e:

    # "Glancing around, Mizuki is nowhere to be seen amidst the tangled sheets."
    "环顾四周，却在凌乱的床单中找不到瑞希的身影。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14163
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_9723f846:

    # "The window stands wide open, and you sigh."
    "窗户大开着，你叹了口气。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14165
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_990c8527:

    # you "Another shadowy ninja trick? Let me close this..."
    you "又一个阴险的忍者伎俩？我这就结束这个话题……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14172
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_9fd0c4a4:

    # mizuki "We've had our differences... But in the end, you've helped me, and it was worth a lot to me."
    mizuki "我们之间有过分歧……但最终你帮助了我，这对我来说意义重大。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14174
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_b0fb6a0e:

    # mizuki "After tonight, we won't see each other ever again. I want you to have this. It served me well."
    mizuki "今晚之后，我们再也不会见面了。我想把这个送给你。它对我帮助很大。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14181
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_911b3226:

    # "Mizuki drops her kimono to the ground."
    "美月将和服扔到地上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14183
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_323118c2:

    # you "Uh??? What?"
    you "呃？？？什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14185
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_291ae5ad:

    # "Mizuki bows slightly, and heads out into the night."
    "瑞希微微鞠躬，走进了夜色中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14189
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_ca742f59:

    # you "Hey! Where are you going, crazy lady!"
    you "嘿！你这疯女人要去哪儿！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14193
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_32a032d2:

    # "You step outside right after her."
    "你紧随她之后走了出去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14195
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_18d13b29:

    # "A cold shadow seems to dim the light of the moon, sending a shiver down your spine."
    "一道冰冷的阴影似乎遮蔽了月光，让人脊背发凉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14197
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_61529f7b:

    # you "M-Mizuki?"
    you "M-水木？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14203
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_feb8c473:

    # "To your surprise, Mizuki materializes from thin air. But it is more than a ninja trick: she is hovering high above the ground, surrounded by a ghostly glow."
    "出乎意料的是，瑞希凭空出现。但这不仅仅是忍者技巧：她悬浮在高空，周身环绕着幽灵般的光芒。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14205
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_3da55dbb:

    # "Her eyes are soft yet distant, weary as if they were witnessing the passing of eons."
    "她的眼神温柔而疏离，带着疲惫，仿佛见证了漫长岁月的流逝。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14207
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_7542d676:

    # mizuki naked "I am tired, [MC.name]... And I am done. It is time for me to join my son."
    mizuki naked "我累了，[MC.name]……我做完了。我该去陪我儿子了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14209
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_32a36398:

    # you "You... you mean..."
    you "你……你的意思是……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14211
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_f1b155e0:

    # mizuki "I never knew joy in the life I was given. I got more than my share of hatred, pain and tears."
    mizuki "我从未在命运的安排下体验过快乐。我得到的远比我应得的要多，只有仇恨、痛苦和泪水。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14213
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_3e63a646:

    # mizuki "But thanks to you, now, at the end... I can finally make peace with it."
    mizuki "但多亏了你，现在，到了最后……我终于可以释怀了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14215
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_1ddb873a:

    # you "Mizuki..."
    you "水木..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14217
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_fe43f17a:

    # mizuki "Farewell, [MC.name]. I do not believe in the afterlife... But as a spirit, I have to say... Stranger things have happened."
    mizuki "再见了，[MC.name]。我不相信有来世……但作为灵魂，我不得不说……更奇怪的事情都发生过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14223
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_1d07d3d5:

    # you "Mizuki!"
    you "水树！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14227
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_204ede13:

    # mizuki "Godspeed, [MC.name]..."
    mizuki "一路顺风，[MC.name]..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14233
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_ed2e4133:

    # "With her face finally peaceful and at rest, Mizuki fades into the air, her form dissolving like mist under the moonlight."
    "水木的脸终于平静下来，她的身影渐渐消失在空气中，如同月光下的薄雾一般消散。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14237
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_08d9a644:

    # "Thus disappeared from the face of Xeros, the legendary phantom Kunoichi."
    "于是，传说中的幻影女忍者从泽罗斯的脸上消失了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14243
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_goodbye_6fe4e84d:

    # "The princess will want to hear of this... But for now, your mind drifts, not finding sleep until the wee hours of the morning."
    "公主殿下一定会想知道这件事……但现在，你思绪飘忽，直到凌晨时分才得以入睡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14256
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_a3c9ae70:

    # "As expected, the events of the past few days have earned you a summon to the Royal Palace."
    "不出所料，这几天的种种事件让你被召入皇宫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14262
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_4a7b180c:

    # knight "Come. The Princess will see you shortly."
    knight "来吧，公主殿下马上就来见你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14267
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_eb84a111:

    # "Kurohime welcomes you by herself, dismissing the knight. She looks tired and concerned."
    "黑姬独自一人迎接你，打发走了骑士。她看上去既疲惫又担忧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14269
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_a5f6f9bc:

    # kuro "[MC.name]... It is good to see a friendly face."
    kuro "[MC.name]……很高兴见到友善的面孔。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14272
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_561d213c:

    # kuro "As I'm sure you've heard, Commander Kenshin was brutally killed in broad daylight just a couple of days ago."
    kuro "正如你们所听说的，剑心司令官就在几天前光天化日之下被残忍杀害。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14274
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_679eb8b4:

    # "You hold your breath, hoping that she didn't get wind of your involvement in that matter."
    "你屏住呼吸，希望她没有察觉到你参与了这件事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14276
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_4be55c3b:

    # kuro "Details are scarce, but it seems she was murdered by one of the Kunoichi that's been rampaging around the city."
    kuro "细节尚不清楚，但她似乎是被一名在城里横冲直撞的女忍者杀害的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14278
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_d061e11b:

    # kuro "It is crucial we put an end to this string of assassinations, or my family will lose what little sway we still have over the Court."
    kuro "我们必须制止这一系列暗杀事件，否则我的家族将失去我们对法院仅存的一点影响力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14280
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_fec1fe3c:

    # you "What do you mean?"
    you "你是什么意思?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14282
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_b290ed48:

    # kuro "The Knight Commander was my right hand. We did not always agree on everything, but without her I have lost control of the knight orders, whose loyalties are now split between various influential factions."
    kuro "骑士团长是我的得力助手。我们并非事事意见一致，但失去她后，我已失去了对骑士团的控制，他们的忠诚如今分散在各个强大的派系之间。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14284
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_9b6334c1:

    # you "What are you going to do?"
    you "你会怎样做？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14286
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_2307a348:

    # kuro "There is only one way out, of course. We need to hurry and proceed with this foolish wedding. I guess we're running out of time, and I must tell my father to make a choice soon among the powerful pretenders..."
    kuro "当然，只有一条出路。我们必须抓紧时间，继续这场愚蠢的婚礼。我想时间不多了，我必须告诉父亲，让他尽快在那些有权有势的竞争者中做出选择……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14292
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_19719159:

    # you "Sounds good. A noble husband would protect you, and stabilize the Kingdom."
    you "听起来不错。一位高尚的丈夫会保护你，也会稳定王国。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14294
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_5eee2452:

    # "The Princess looks annoyed."
    "公主看起来很生气。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14296
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_2363760e:

    # kuro "Or precipitate a civil war! You shouldn't make light of this. The lives of the city's people is very much at stake!"
    kuro "否则可能会引发内战！你可不能掉以轻心。这座城市人民的生命危在旦夕！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14298
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_685847ec:

    # you "Well..."
    you "嗯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14300
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_2f24627d:

    # kuro "Anyway, you must hurry and complete your assignment. I cannot afford to have assassins roaming free, killing my people anymore."
    kuro "总之，你必须抓紧时间完成任务。我不能再让刺客逍遥法外，残害我的子民了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14302
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_f753a716:

    # you "I'm on it..."
    you "我正在处理……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14307
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_ddc9d805:

    # you "You should give it time. Rushing to marrying the first noble you find is only going to make your position more precarious."
    you "你应该给彼此一些时间。急于迎娶遇到的第一个贵族只会让你的处境更加岌岌可危。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14309
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_ce761f07:

    # you "Who knows, another power figure may emerge sooner than you think?"
    you "谁知道呢，或许另一位权力人物会比你想象的更快出现？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14311
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_37f55342:

    # kuro "I know you're right, but... Time is running out."
    kuro "我知道你是对的，但是……时间不多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14313
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_9be25bfc:

    # you "I can buy you time: my investigation in the Kunoichi will soon be complete."
    you "我可以为你争取时间：我对女忍者的调查很快就会完成。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14315
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_f0c125b3:

    # you "And by the way, you should know something about Kenshin's killer."
    you "顺便一提，你应该了解一下剑心的凶手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14317
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_d7291693:

    # kuro "Yes?"
    kuro "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14319
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_8b129821:

    # you "I could uncover her motives. She was not part of a conspiracy, but held a long-term grudge against Kenshin's family."
    you "我可以揭开她的动机。她并非阴谋者，而是对谦信的家族怀有长久的仇恨。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14321
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_ba9b5f51:

    # you "Now that they are all dead, she is no longer a threat to you."
    you "既然他们都死了，她对你不再构成威胁了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14323
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_3604ce47:

    # kuro "Really? How did you find out this information?"
    kuro "真的吗？你是怎么知道这些信息的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14325
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_d867c8d7:

    # you "It's a long story, but I assure you this is genuine."
    you "说来话长，但我保证这是真的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14327
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_bfdb9167:

    # kuro "Well, that's a relief... Although it's too bad for my poor Uesugi. She didn't deserve this."
    kuro "哦，那真是松了一口气……不过可怜的上杉，她不该遭受这样的对待。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14329
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_31d16bc7:

    # you "Life is unfair..."
    you "生活是不公平的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14332
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_57ee8fb7:

    # kuro "Lady Kenshin was just here. She told me everything."
    kuro "剑心夫人刚才来过。她把一切都告诉我了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14334
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_c881453b:

    # kuro "And it seems we got rid of one of the pesky assassins that plagued our city."
    kuro "看来我们已经除掉了一个困扰我们城市的讨厌刺客。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14336
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_47623cf3:

    # you "Absolutely. I can confirm that Mizuki is gone. She won't be back."
    you "没错。我可以确认瑞希已经走了。她不会回来了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14338
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_0bc4ef77:

    # kuro "Wonderful! I commend you for your actions. Your quick-thinking saved the day back then."
    kuro "太棒了！我赞赏你的行动。当时你的机智化险为夷。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14340
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_7ff04b91:

    # you "Thank you..."
    you "谢谢..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14342
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_fa80666a:

    # kuro "But this is discomforting nonetheless. Uesugi Kenshin acted on her own without my knowledge, and could very well have gotten herself killed."
    kuro "但这仍然令人不安。上杉谦信在我不知情的情况下擅自行动，而且很可能因此丧命。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14344
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_2b05ff58:

    # kuro "Her recklessness is now the talk of the Court, as well as rumors she is from a cursed bloodline... I don't like the gossip I'm hearing."
    kuro "她的鲁莽行为现在成了宫廷里的谈资，还有传言说她出身于一个被诅咒的血统……我不喜欢我听到的这些流言蜚语。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14352
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_85af4cd4:

    # you "She only wanted to do right by you, investigating every lead..."
    you "她只是想对你好，所以调查了每一条线索……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14354
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_5eee2452_1:

    # "The Princess looks annoyed."
    "公主看起来很生气。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14356
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_6bb326fb:

    # kuro "That's what I asked {i}you{/i} to do! She isn't supposed to waste time and put her life in danger running errands while we have a situation at court!"
    kuro "我就是让你这么做的！我们法庭那边还有事要办，她不应该浪费时间，更不应该冒着生命危险去跑腿办事！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14364
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_466efe1c:

    # you "She was foolish to disobey you."
    you "她不听你的话真是愚蠢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14366
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_5f26c407:

    # "She gives you a weak smile."
    "她勉强挤出一个笑容。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14368
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_9e7ceba2:

    # kuro "Indeed you're right. My confidence in her is shaken, to say the least. Worse, it made us look weaker."
    kuro "你说得对。说实话，我对她的信任动摇了。更糟糕的是，这让我们显得更加软弱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14370
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_71ebe3b6:

    # kuro "And now we have a situation at Court..."
    kuro "现在法庭那边出现了这种情况……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14372
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_5660e530:

    # you "A situation?"
    you "情况？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14374
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_13007567:

    # kuro "Yes. Things are accelerating around that foolish wedding. My father is under even more pressure to choose a pretender, the powers-that-be insisting that we need a man in charge."
    kuro "是的。围绕那场愚蠢的婚礼，事情进展得越来越快。我父亲面临着更大的压力，他必须选择一个接班人，因为当权者坚持认为我们需要一个男人来掌权。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14376
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_c844593d:

    # kuro "And people start questioning whether Kenshin is right for the job... And thus, my judgement."
    kuro "于是人们开始质疑剑心是否胜任这份工作……因此，我做出了判断。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14378
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_01cc214a:

    # kuro "Finally, there is another matter..."
    kuro "最后，还有一件事……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14380
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_b9f03b8c:

    # you "Yes?"
    you "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14382
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_b3ee05f1:

    # kuro "Kenshin told me the story about her father's disappearance, and about his young ward in the forest."
    kuro "剑心给我讲述了她父亲失踪的故事，以及他在森林里抚养的年轻养女的故事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14384
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_d3f8f11e:

    # you "Yeah, what was that all about?"
    you "是啊，那到底是怎么回事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14386
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_ee9dee28:

    # kuro "I have my suspicions about his identity, but I need to follow a few more leads to make sure."
    kuro "我对他的身份有所怀疑，但我需要再追查一些线索来确认。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14388
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_2569c028:

    # kuro "Listen to me, [MC.name]. Do not - {i}under any circumstances{/i} - let anyone know about this."
    kuro "听我说，[MC.name]。无论在任何情况下，都不要让任何人知道这件事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14390
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_6261ee96:

    # you "Erm, okay... I won't."
    you "呃，好吧……我不干了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14392
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_princess_debrief_553ce3f1:

    # kuro "Anyway. Thank you for coming this morning. I am sorry - I have so many things to attend to that I cannot keep you for lunch."
    kuro "总之，谢谢你今天早上过来。很抱歉，我有很多事情要处理，不能和你一起吃午饭了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14396
