translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_39fead9e:

    # "The cell is empty. Mizuki's chains stand on the floor, but her shackles aren't broken or opened."
    "牢房空空如也。瑞希的锁链散落在地上，但她的镣铐并未断裂或打开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14629
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_8a4ef60c:

    # you "SUZUMEEEEEEEE!!!" with vpunch
    you "铃目！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14633
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_bc7b4cff:

    # suzume doubt "Yeah, boss?"
    suzume doubt "什么事，老板？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14635
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_d3f7daa4:

    # you "My prisoner! Where is my prisoner!" with vpunch
    you "我的俘虏！我的俘虏在哪里！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14637
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_28c23309:

    # "Suzume looks around."
    "铃芽环顾四周。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14639
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_86e0bb01:

    # suzume "It appears she isn't here, boss."
    suzume "老板，她好像不在。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14641
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_d8310f5b:

    # you "And how the fuck did she manage to slip off! You told me this cell was magic-proof!!!" with vpunch
    you "她到底是怎么溜出去的！你不是说这牢房防不住魔法吗！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14643
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_213ce03f:

    # suzume "I don't know, boss... Maybe she really was a ghost..."
    suzume "我不知道，老板……也许她真的是个鬼魂……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14645
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_22693972:

    # "A chill goes down your spine."
    "一股寒意涌上脊背。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14647
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_1ddb873a:

    # you "Mizuki..."
    you "水木..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14649
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_2e794789:

    # "You have the creeping feeling you will never see her again. It's for the best, as she would surely skin you alive."
    "你隐隐觉得再也见不到她了。这或许是最好的，因为她肯定会把你活活剥皮。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14651
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_2a52ace1:

    # you "Suzume, from now on you will double the patrols, and you will personally be on the lookout for trouble 7 days a week. Got it?"
    you "雀，从现在开始，你的巡逻次数要加倍，而且要你亲自负责，一周七天都要注意防范麻烦。明白了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14653
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_baff5c84:

    # suzume "Ow, boss... *tearing up*"
    suzume "哎哟，老板……（眼眶含泪）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14659
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_gone_d970bfc2:

    # "Mizuki is gone for good."
    "瑞希彻底离开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14666
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_374ba697:

    # "Suzume came back to report."
    "云雀回来报告。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14673
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_4feb38d3:

    # suzume "Phew! I brought Mizuki to the Palace just in the nick of time. She was beginning to wake up, but the Royal Mages put her in stasis before she could try some ghost business."
    suzume "呼！我真是千钧一发之际把瑞希带回了宫殿。她当时正要醒来，但皇家魔法师们在她来得及耍什么鬼把戏之前就把她施了休眠术。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14675
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_fe133d87:

    # you "Good. Here's hoping she never escapes, or we'll be in trouble."
    you "好。但愿她永远不会逃跑，否则我们就麻烦了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14677
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_8eb4473b:

    # suzume "I doubt it. I heard they're going to keep her in stasis and study her for years to come. 'Fascinating post-mortem phenomenon', and all that."
    suzume "我对此表示怀疑。我听说他们打算让她保持低温冷冻状态，并进行多年的研究。“引人入胜的死后现象”之类的说法。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14679
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_6d709636:

    # suzume "The Princess didn't care though. All she wanted was one less assassin on the streets."
    suzume "公主却毫不在意。她只希望街上少一个刺客。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14681
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_eee3062c:

    # you "And what of our reward?"
    you "那么我们的回报又是什么呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14684
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_2f9b94a8:

    # suzume "Hehehe... Here it is!"
    suzume "嘿嘿嘿……就是它！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14692
translate chinese_simplified c3_mizuki_arrested_27815011:

    # "You have received a reward for capturing Mizuki Ike."
    "你因抓获水木池而获得奖励。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14707
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_b44954bf:

    # you "So... How do we go about this?"
    you "那么...我们接下来该怎么做呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14710
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2960e0df:

    # suzume doubt "I suppose we could have told Kenshin about it... But we can't, on account she's dead."
    suzume doubt "我想我们本来可以告诉剑心这件事……但是我们不能，因为她已经死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14712
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_27341a5a:

    # you "Yeah. You don't need to remind me."
    you "是啊，不用你提醒我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14715
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2e9f7bf3:

    # suzume "We could ask Kenshin to introduce us to prison's brass..."
    suzume "我们可以请剑心给我们介绍一下监狱的管理人员..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14717
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_09a5660d:

    # you "But what if she's in league with the abductors?"
    you "但如果她和绑匪是一伙的呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14719
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_704daf50:

    # suzume "Then we don't tell her everything."
    suzume "那我们就保持沉默。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14721
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_87b84ba2:

    # suzume normal "Or... We could just wing it. Talk our way inside the Prison."
    suzume normal "或者……我们可以随机应变，想办法混进监狱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14723
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_c663ca23:

    # you "What? I don't like the sound of that..."
    you "什么？我不喜欢那声音..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14725
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_75d5892a:

    # suzume "Come on! It'll be fun."
    suzume "别这么说嘛！会很有趣的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14727
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_c235a220:

    # you "Nothing about going to prison is 'fun'."
    you "进监狱一点也不“有趣”。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14734
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_4357afda:

    # you "All right, let's visit Kenshin. As the Captain of the Knights, she's our best bet."
    you "好吧，我们去拜访一下剑心吧。作为骑士团的团长，她是不二人选。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14742
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_6e73eab4:

    # kenshin "You want to do {i}what{/i}?"
    kenshin "你想做什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14744
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_3ca4c9ea:

    # you "Inspect the prison. Talk to the knights in charge. I have information of interest to them."
    you "检查监狱。与负责看守的骑士交谈。我有他们感兴趣的信息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14746
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_bbecd69c:

    # kenshin "Then why don't you tell me that information immediately then? I can talk to them."
    kenshin "那你为什么不立即告诉我这个信息呢？我可以和他们谈。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14748
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_73ff2084:

    # you "Sorry, but this is confidential information. It's related to the Princess's assignment, you see..."
    you "抱歉，这是机密信息。这和公主的任务有关，你看..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14750
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_67da7017:

    # kenshin annoyed "Again with that assignment! I'm the Princess's most loyal servant! There's no need to hide anything from me!" with vpunch
    kenshin annoyed "又是这项任务！我是公主最忠诚的仆人！无需对我隐瞒任何事情！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14752
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_993d603f:

    # "Kenshin's eyes spark with fury."
    "剑心的眼睛里闪烁着愤怒的怒火。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14754
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_3aa18a1d:

    # you "Are you questioning the Princess's judgement?"
    you "你是在质疑公主的判断吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14756
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_e50afecb:

    # kenshin "Grrr..."
    kenshin "咆哮声..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14758
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_41d54eca:

    # you "So, will you help me or not?"
    you "那么，你到底帮不帮我？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14760
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_83e084e4:

    # kenshin "You... You..."
    kenshin "你...你..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14764
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_0e8198e6:

    # kenshin normal "Fine, go talk to them, whatever. They'll give me a report afterwards anyway."
    kenshin normal "行，你去跟他们谈谈吧，随便你。反正他们事后也会给我一份报告。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14766
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_9b98686a:

    # you "Thank you. I assume you will give me a safe-conduct then?"
    you "谢谢。我想你会给我一份推荐信吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14768
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_e4ee662b:

    # kenshin "Hmph, see that with my scribe. But one more thing, [MC.name]..."
    kenshin "哼，去找我的文员要吧。但还有一件事，[MC.name]..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14770
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_b9f03b8c:

    # you "Yes?"
    you "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14772
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_3dcef296:

    # kenshin "You are not allowed to enter the maximum security area of the Prison, got it?"
    kenshin "你不可以进入监狱的禁地，明白吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14774
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_4a693d16:

    # you "Why not?"
    you "为什么不可能？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14776
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ba4da0ad:

    # kenshin "{i}Because{/i} we have there the most dangerous criminals in all of Xeros, and I don't want you to go around and stir trouble!"
    kenshin "{i}因为{/i}那里关押有全克塞罗斯最危险的罪犯，我不想让你到处惹事生非！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14778
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_94666dd1:

    # you "Aw, you don't me to get hurt... That melts my heart a little..."
    you "噢，你舍不得让我受伤...这让我受宠若惊..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14780
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_16472569:

    # kenshin blush "What? No, I... *blush*"
    kenshin blush "什么？不，我……*脸红*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14782
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_9dceb864:

    # you "You're cute when you're blushing."
    you "你脸红的时候很可爱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14784
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_88192a87:

    # kenshin annoyed "GO AWAY! NOW! *mad*" with vpunch
    kenshin annoyed "滚开！现在就滚！*生气*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14788
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_96c4d05e:

    # you "I think she's warming up to me."
    you "我觉得她对我越来越热情了"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14790
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_f5f55841:

    # scribe "Here is your letter of conduct. Show it to the Prison Warden and he'll know you came with orders from Lady Kenshin."
    scribe "这是您的推荐信。把它拿给典狱长看，他就会知道你是奉剑心团长的命令而来的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14799
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_3430eb0e:

    # "Joined by Suzume, you head back to the lower city to visit the Prison."
    "在云雀的陪伴下，你回到下城区去参观监狱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14803
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_222be20f:

    # knight "These are not visiting hours, citizen. State your business or leave."
    knight "公民，现在不是探视时间。说明你的来意或离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14805
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_f98b7945:

    # you "Here, we have a letter of conduct from the Lady Commander."
    you "你看，我们有一封来自女团长的推荐信。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14807
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_544d47af:

    # knight "Let me see it... Hmm... Everything looks to be in order."
    knight "让我看看...嗯...一切看起来都很正常。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14809
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_7d67d2ab:

    # knight "Come on in then. I shall take you to the Warden."
    knight "那就进来吧。我带你去见典狱长。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14814
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2791bc30:

    # you "Uh, hello. *clear throat*"
    you "呃，你好。 *清嗓子*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14816
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_e0baeafb:

    # warden "Hmm, yes? Who might you be?"
    warden "嗯，你是？你是谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14818
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_fc0ac366:

    # you "I'm [MC.name], Sir. I work with Lady Kenshin on a royal investigation. And this is my... Bodyguard, Suzume."
    you "我是[MC.name]，先生。我与剑心团长一起负责王室的调查任务。这是我的...保镖，云雀。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14820
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_099cd7c8:

    # suzume "*chuckles*"
    suzume "*咯咯笑*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14822
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_cf45a533:

    # "The Warden takes one bored look at your papers, and nods towards a couple of chairs by his desk."
    "典狱长无聊地看了一眼你的文件，朝办公桌旁坐着的几个人点了点头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14824
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_9cf1d9ea:

    # you "Sir, I have grave news. The Prison is in danger of a security breach, and... Sir?"
    you "先生，我有一个重大情报。监狱有一个严重的安全漏洞，而且...先生？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14826
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_b3011a4d:

    # "The Warden is busy shuffling papers around as he absent-mindedly listens to you."
    "典狱长一边忙着整理文件，一边心不在焉地听你说话。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14828
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_1289fe45:

    # warden "Hmm Hmm... *whistle*"
    warden "哼哼...*口哨*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14830
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_7ec41a5c:

    # you "Someone is trying to break a prisoner out of here, and..."
    you "有人试图把一名囚犯带出这里，然后..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14832
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ea74bb6e:

    # "The Warden rolls his eyes."
    "典狱长翻白眼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14834
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_72dffe85:

    # warden "Oh, of course they are. *sigh*"
    warden "哦，当然了。 *叹*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14836
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_aef6d86e:

    # warden "Come on, my boy, not a day goes by without a foolish wench trying to break her lover out of the prison yard by throwing herself at a guard..."
    warden "淡定，我的孩子，每天都会有一个愚蠢的姑娘试图通过向警卫献身来将她的情人从监狱里救出来......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14838
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_c2ce92a2:

    # warden "And we have riots every other week... I have to hang a dozen inmates to restore order, every time."
    warden "每隔一周监狱里就会发生骚乱...每次我都必须绞死十几个囚犯才能恢复秩序。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14840
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_dddfea8c:

    # warden "None of this is worth my time, or, might I say, Lady Kenshin's... No one ever escaped the Xotar Prison."
    warden "这些都不值得我花时间，或者说，剑心团长的时间...没有人能逃出索塔尔监狱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14842
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_be4fa93f:

    # suzume "But it's not just any threat, though... It's a highly trained killer!"
    suzume "但这不次不是普通人...是一个训练有素的杀手！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14844
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_84a2fea4:

    # warden "*yawn*"
    warden "*打哈欠*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14846
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_739c5fbd:

    # you "And their target is the maximum security part of the Prison."
    you "而他们的目标，就是监狱戒备最森严的部分。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14848
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ae13782c:

    # "Suddenly, he stops in his tracks and looks back straight at you. His voice takes a more serious tone."
    "突然，他停下脚步，回头直视着你。他的语气变得更加严肃。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14850
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_6eb64174:

    # warden "The maximum security area? Well, you should have mentioned it immediately, my boy."
    warden "底层禁地？好吧，你一开始就该提到它，年轻人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14852
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_8b2675fe:

    # you "Why?"
    you "为什么?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14854
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_19486e4b:

    # warden "As it happens, under the security arrangement mandated by the King, I am only in charge of the upper levels of the Prison."
    warden "很不凑巧，根据国王授权的岗位职责，我只负责管理监狱的上层区域。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14856
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2cb9907b:

    # you "Was that always the deal?"
    you "一直都是这样吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14858
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_364b544a:

    # warden "Well, no. We changed that recently. But it suits me fine."
    warden "嗯，不。我们最近改变了工作内容。但它很适合我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14860
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_6756c5c9:

    # warden "When I bought this office, I didn't really want to handle the wild beasts we keep downstairs anyway."
    warden "当我买下这间办公室时，我其实并不想处理那些楼下圈养的野兽。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14862
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_89513e8a:

    # suzume "You {i}bought{/i} this office?"
    suzume "你说{i}买下{/i}这间办公室？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14864
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_481e92aa:

    # warden "Why, sure, how else do you think people get commissioned to high office? On merit? Bwahahaha!"
    warden "当然，除此之外，你以为人们如何升官呢？难道靠功绩？哇哈哈！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14866
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_e8f146e2:

    # warden "I have certain dealings that work best with access to the Prison population, and... Anyway. You needn't concern yourself with that."
    warden "我经营着最适合接触监狱人员的生意，而且...总之，那不是你需要了解的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14868
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_a6e549f9:

    # warden "The maximum security area below the penitentiary is the private domain of the King, and only the Knights of the Flaming Hound stand guard down there."
    warden "监狱下方的最高安全区域是国王的私人领地，只有烈焰猎犬骑士团在那里站岗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14870
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_9f26113e:

    # suzume doubt "The Flaming what, now?"
    suzume doubt "燃烧的什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14872
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_74ecc30e:

    # warden "The flaming Hounds. They're a Knight Order of the first Circle, fanatically devoted to the Royal family..."
    warden "血牙。他们是第一骑士团的成员，狂热地效忠于王室..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14874
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ab36c008:

    # warden "I try to leave them to their own devices. They're a frightening bunch, if you ask me."
    warden "我尽量让他们自行其是。如果你问我的话，他们是一群可怕的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14876
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_9ff2fe87:

    # warden "It cannot be easy to deal with the worst scum in Xeros, every day. The people we have up here are just petty thieves or murderers. They have it far worse."
    warden "每天与克塞罗斯中最糟糕的败类打交道并不容易。我们这里关的只是小偷或杀人犯。他们的情况更糟。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14878
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_d9cfec39:

    # you "Can I talk to them then?"
    you "那我可以和他们谈谈吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14880
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ae39bf0e:

    # "The Warden looks annoyed, but he pushes the papers back towards you."
    "典狱长看起来很生气，但他把文件推回给你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14882
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_74f656bb:

    # warden "Well, Lady Kenshin allowed it, correct?"
    warden "好吧，剑心大人允许了，对吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14884
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_c57add41:

    # suzume "Uhuh. Sure thing. She said, 'Go right ahead!'."
    suzume "呃。当然可以。她说，“自由行动！”。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14886
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_b53f2f9d:

    # you "Yup. I believe these were her exact words."
    you "是的。我相信这就是她的意思。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14888
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2465f5d4:

    # warden "Do as you please, then... And don't bother coming back, I'm very busy. The knights will show you out."
    warden "那就随你的便吧...别回来烦我了，我很忙。骑士们会带你出去的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14892
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_591c03fe:

    # "A knight waits for you outside of the Warden's office. He motions for you to follow him."
    "一位骑士在典狱长办公室外面等你。他示意你跟着他。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14901
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_33a4d282:

    # you "So... Here we are. What do we do, now?"
    you "所以...我们到了。现在我们该怎么办？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14905
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_29d66e77:

    # suzume "Easy... You knock!"
    suzume "简单...你敲门！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14907
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_bb683af0:

    # you "I knock? On the door of the largest prison in Xeros?"
    you "我敲？敲克罗斯最大监狱的门？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14909
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_37122480:

    # suzume "Sure. It's not like you're going to damage it."
    suzume "当然。难道你能敲坏它？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14911
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_c3f682ab:

    # you "Why am I even listening to you... *sigh*"
    you "为什么我要照你说的做......*叹气*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14917
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_5ec62c56:

    # "You knock and wait expectantly."
    "你敲门并满怀期待地等待。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14921
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ebabf604:

    # "An intimidating knight opens a small hatch and gives you a cold stare."
    "一位令人生畏的骑士打开一个小舱门，冷冷地盯着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14923
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_222be20f_1:

    # knight "These are not visiting hours, citizen. State your business or leave."
    knight "公民，现在不是探视时间。说明你的来意或离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14925
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_ea42d7f9:

    # you "I, err, want to talk to the manager..."
    you "我，呃，想和典狱长谈谈......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14927
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_e04741e5:

    # knight "The mana... The Warden? Are you out of your mind? This is the Xotar penitentiary here, not a cursed tavern!"
    knight "魔力……典狱长？你疯了吗？这里是索塔尔监狱，不是什么诅咒酒馆！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14929
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_6ac4e635:

    # you "Listen. I have crucial information regarding the security of the Prison. Somebody is trying to break in."
    you "听着。我有关于监狱安全的重要消息。有人试图闯入这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14931
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_cb3e7853:

    # knight "Break {i}in{/i}? That's a first. People usually try to break out of prison!"
    knight "闯入？这还是头一回听说。人们通常只会想往外逃！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14933
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_84a9216e:

    # knight "Now, if you're done wasting my time..."
    knight "现在，别再浪费我的时间了..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14935
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_f2ceb448:

    # suzume "Wait! They {i}are{/i} trying to break in then break someone out... They're Kunoichi, you see, and..."
    suzume "等等！他们{i}策划{/i}闯入然后将某人带出去......他们是女忍者，你看，而且......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14937
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_2e054b79:

    # knight "WAIT! What did you just say?" with vpunch
    knight "等等！你刚才说什么？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14939
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_0b48ab91:

    # you "Kunoichi. It's a kind of ninja..."
    you "女忍者。这是忍者的一种..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14941
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_d1e8f26f:

    # knight "Oh, I {i}know{/i} what a Kunoichi is."
    knight "哦，我{i}知道{/i}女忍者是什么人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14943
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_46a21cc1:

    # "His tone becomes cold as ice."
    "他的语气变得冰冷如冰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14945
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_0edc7dc3:

    # knight "I think we need to have a little chat, after all... Come in, you two."
    knight "我想我们需要聊聊，毕竟...请进，两位。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14949
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_da2227c2:

    # "As the door opens, you notice the knight has a firm grip on his sword's hilt."
    "当门打开时，你注意到骑士紧紧握住他的剑柄。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14951
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_82682103:

    # knight "Leave all your weapons here, and follow me."
    knight "把你所有的武器都留在这里，跟我来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14964
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_5e223973:

    # "You follow the knight across the Prison yard."
    "你跟随骑士穿过前厅。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14966
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_641644b9:

    # "The place is dark and decrepit, and you can make out hundreds of people living in squalor in the various levels of the Prison."
    "这个地方又黑又破，你可以看到数百人生活在监狱的各个级别的肮脏牢房中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14968
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_b2bd0f15:

    # "Screams of fear and pain regularily echo against the cold stone walls. You shiver and try not to pay attention to them."
    "恐惧和痛苦的尖叫声经常在冰冷的石墙上回响。你颤抖着，尽量不去在意他们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14972
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d06cbe67:

    # "The knight goes down a flight of stairs and takes you to an isolated office, a good deal away from the entrance."
    "骑士走下一段楼梯，带你来到一个孤立的办公室，距离入口很远。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14976
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_410f835e:

    # "You take a good look at the knight for the first time. He's like any other, but he bears an unusual red marking on his chestplate, resembling a scar. It could be a trick of the light, but the marking looks as if it is glowing from the inside."
    "你这才有空仔细观察骑士。他和其他人一样，但他的胸甲上有一个不寻常的红色印记，就像一道疤痕。这可能是光线导致的，但印记看起来好像是从内部发光的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14978
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_1cabbfd6:

    # knight "Wait here."
    knight "稍等片刻。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14982
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_23375778:

    # "The knight leaves the room. You can't help but notice he locked the door behind him. Something feels off."
    "骑士离开房间。你不由得注意到他把门顺手锁上了。感觉有些不对劲。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14986
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_dc0d29a9:

    # you "Looks like we're in."
    you "看来我们已经进来了"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14988
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_f1fd0ef5:

    # suzume "Told ya! Winging it was the way to go."
    suzume "我就说吧！随风而行是正确的选择。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14990
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_068fa51f:

    # you "No one knows that we're here though. We could disappear now and no one would be the wiser."
    you "但没有人知道我们在这里。我们现在可能会消失，没有人能发现我们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14992
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d5aee6e5:

    # you "I didn't like the look of that k-..."
    you "我不喜欢那个骑士的打扮..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14995
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_a5951d3a:

    # you "Seems like the Warden is only nominally in charge here."
    you "看来典狱长只是名义上负责这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14997
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_8d2a9029:

    # suzume "It's the knight orders who wield the real power."
    suzume "真正掌握权力的是骑士团。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:14999
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_943dc4aa:

    # you "I noticed. Lots of fishy business involving knights, don't you think?"
    you "我注意到了。有很多涉及骑士团的可疑交易，你不觉得吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15003
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_e7a1f44e:

    # "You interrupt yourself as you hear the lock opens."
    "当你听到锁打开的声音时，你闭上了嘴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15012
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_ccd25162:

    # "The knight you met ushers in another knight, who looks like small giant. You can tell he is an officer of sorts."
    "你遇到的骑士带来了另一位骑士，他看起来像个小巨人。你可以看出他是一名军官。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15014
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_0b691726:

    # hound_knight "Well, what do we have here? Who are these civilians?"
    hound_knight "那么，发生什么事了？这些平民是谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15017
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_9e33aa25:

    # knight "They say they possess information about a potential intruder. A {i}kunoichi{/i}, Sir."
    knight "他们说他们要汇报有关密谋的入侵者的信息。长官，是{i}女忍者{/i}。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15019
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_57732b66:

    # knight "I took the liberty to bring them in for you to interrogate."
    knight "所以我就擅自做主把他们带进来给你审问。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15021
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_a43325ad:

    # hound_knight "Hmm..."
    hound_knight "嗯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15024
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d98e285b:

    # knight "The Warden sent them. On a mission for Lady Kenshin, apparently."
    knight "典狱长派他们来的。他们显然是在执行剑心的任务。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15026
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_66bd221d:

    # hound_knight "Hmph. We don't have time to entertain idle chat with guests, but if it suits Her Ladyship... *snark*"
    hound_knight "哼。我们可没有时间与客人闲聊，但如果是剑心派你们来的话...*讽刺*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15028
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_150ff371:

    # hound_knight "What business do you have with the Flaming Hounds?"
    hound_knight "你和血牙骑士团有什么关系？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15030
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_eb31d943:

    # you "Well, you are in charge of the maximum security area of the Prison, correct?"
    you "嗯，监狱的禁地是你负责看管的，对吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15032
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_1219fb13:

    # hound_knight "Aye. The prisoners here are the worst scum in all of Xeros, but we keep them in check. Using any means necessary."
    hound_knight "是啊。这里的囚犯是所有克塞罗斯中最糟糕的败类，但我们控制着他们。使用任何必要的手段。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15034
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_f9462646:

    # you "We got word of a plot to free one of the prisoners..."
    you "我们得到消息，有人密谋解救一名囚犯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15036
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_dd7da28f:

    # you "Are you the one in charge of the maximum security part of the prison?"
    you "你是监狱禁地的负责人吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15039
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_91a706e8:

    # hound_knight "{i}We{/i} are in charge here. Ever since the incident, the Order of the Flaming Hound is the only force allowed in the bowels of Xotar prison."
    hound_knight "{i}我们{/i}负责看守这里。自意外事件发生以来，血牙骑士团就成为了索塔尔监狱内部唯一合法的部队。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15041
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_5f838948:

    # you "The incident?"
    you "意外事件？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15043
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_ffdf7817:

    # hound_knight "A maximum security prisoner had an unfortunate accident recently. Some corrupt guard officer. That's what you get, when you leave high security to amateurs."
    hound_knight "一名禁地的囚犯最近遭遇了不幸的事故。一些腐败的警卫官员。要是你指望这些业余的安保人员，这就是下场。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15046
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_c79891e5:

    # hound_knight "{i}We{/i}, the knights of the Flaming Hound, are in charge here."
    hound_knight "{i}我们{/i}，血牙骑士团的骑士，确保这里万无一失。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15048
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_918d3bbf:

    # hound_knight "There used to be a small detachment of the Warden's incompetent guards, but they got scared and they left off."
    hound_knight "典狱长无能的卫兵中曾经有一支小队，但他们因为害怕而离开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15050
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_10fc7388:

    # hound_knight "But no one scares us. That's why they're only too happy to handle the scum down here."
    hound_knight "但我们无所畏惧。这就是为什么他们非常乐意处理这里的败类。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15052
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_870ed3ce:

    # you "I have never heard of your order before. Are you Kenshin's men?"
    you "我以前从未听说过你的事迹。你们是剑心大人的部下吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15054
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_5cb0879c:

    # "He scoffs."
    "他嗤之以鼻。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15056
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_6643044b:

    # hound_knight "Of course you haven't. Our order favors discretion, among other things."
    hound_knight "你当然不可能听说过。与普通的任务不同，我们执行的都是上层直接指挥的特殊行动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15058
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_7a9871c3:

    # hound_knight "We are of course loyal to the Crown and Her Ladyship, as the Commander of all knight orders of the first circle."
    hound_knight "作为第一骑士团的指挥官，我们当然忠于国王和王后。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15060
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我明白了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15062
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_195402fb:

    # hound_knight "Now that your curiosity has been sated, you will indulge mine. What is this plot you came to warn us about?"
    hound_knight "现在你的好奇心已经满足了，该满足我的好奇心了。你说的阴谋是什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15064
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_685847ec:

    # you "Well..."
    you "嗯..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15066
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_2f03758c:

    # hound_knight "A word of warning, first. The Knights of the Flaming Hound are not renowned for their patience."
    hound_knight "首先警告一句。血牙骑士团并没有多少耐心。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15068
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_8a4c8af7:

    # "He leans forward towards you, bringing his helmet only a few inches from your face."
    "他向前倾身向你，头盔离你的脸只有几厘米。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15071
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_4869eb46:

    # hound_knight "Tell me, young lad, what was this about a {i}kunoichi{/i}?"
    hound_knight "告诉我，年轻人，那些该死的{i}女忍者{/i}是怎么回事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15074
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_aa961ffc:

    # hound_knight "Let us hear more about this {i}plot{/i} against our prison."
    hound_knight "详细解释一下这个针对我们监狱的{i}阴谋{/i}。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15082
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_1356d51f:

    # "You came here to discuss the Earth kunoichi, so it's time to get down to business."
    "你来这里是为了得到大地忍者的情报，所以该开始进入正题了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15084
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_3deac785:

    # you "Her name is Haruka. She a kunoichi from the Earth school. She's been skulking around the prison for some time."
    you "她的名字叫鹰守遥。她是掌握土元素力量的女忍者。她已经在监狱里潜伏了一段时间了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15086
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_b0837df7:

    # "The knight straigthens up."
    "骑士挺直腰板。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15088
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_81cd7d92:

    # hound_knight "Ah yes, we did know that, but thanks for confirming her identity. She's been poking around our defenses. Do you know her motives as well?"
    hound_knight "啊，是的，我们也发现了这一点，但感谢您提供了她的身份信息。她一直在试探我们的防御。你知道她的动机吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15090
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_a995594c:

    # you "She's looking for her mentor, Subaru. The word is she's locked up in the maximum security area of this prison."
    you "她正在寻找她的忍者导师昴。据说她被关在这座监狱的禁地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15092
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_4e542a11:

    # hound_knight "Is that so..."
    hound_knight "理应如此..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15094
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_7c4b866f:

    # "The head knight doesn't seem surprised."
    "骑士团长似乎并不惊讶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15100
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_e655a810:

    # "You decide to explore what they know about Subaru, the missing kunoichi."
    "你决定打听一下关于失踪的女忍者昴的情报。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15102
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_a2976dab:

    # you "It's about a kunoichi called Subaru. She is believed to be in the city right now..."
    you "那是一个叫昴的女忍者。据可靠消息称她现在就在泽恩..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15104
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_da5cc078:

    # "The knight doesn't flinch. He says nothing, waiting for you to continue."
    "骑士没有打断你。他什么也没说，等着你继续。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15106
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d54c340f:

    # you "We have reasons to believe she's here, in this very prison..."
    you "我们有理由相信她就在这里，就在这座监狱里......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15108
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_55eed6d9:

    # hound_knight "Pointless speculation. We know all the prisoners here. We have not registered anyone called 'Subaru'."
    hound_knight "毫无根据的猜测。我们认识这里所有的囚犯。这里没有任何名为“昴”的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15110
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_eeeec1d7:

    # you "She could be here under a fake name..."
    you "她可能以假名出现在这里..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15112
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_af7482bd:

    # hound_knight "I don't see the need to continue this conversation."
    hound_knight "我认为对话没有必要继续下去了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15114
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d635d7fb:

    # "There is a hint of a threat in his voice."
    "他的声音里带着一丝威胁。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15117
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_e4a870a3:

    # you "Wait! Your man, here, reacted earlier when we mentioned a kunoichi. It cannot just be a coincidence..."
    you "等等！当我们提到女忍者时，你的手下立刻就有了反应。这不可能只是巧合..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15119
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_691214da:

    # hound_knight "Did he, now?"
    hound_knight "他现在有反应吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15121
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_c88e3763:

    # "You can see the smaller knight cower a little, but the head knight quickly returns his attention to you."
    "你看到体型较小的骑士畏畏缩缩，但骑士团长很快就把注意力转向你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15126
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_543cd00d:

    # hound_knight "I see our estimed Warden may have had a lapse in judgment. It happens to the best of us."
    hound_knight "我认为我们的典狱长可能判断失误了。他可是我们之中最强悍的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15128
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_a9780dd6:

    # hound_knight "This hearsay doesn't concern us knights of the Flaming hound. Perhaps it is best you return to the Warden, to waste {i}his{/i} time."
    hound_knight "这个传闻与我们血牙骑士无关。也许你最好回到典狱长那里，去浪费他的时间。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15130
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_c1191374:

    # "You hear the sarcasm in his voice, but see that there is no more information to be obtained here."
    "你听出了他声音中的讽刺，但这里已经没有更多的信息可以从他嘴里撬出来了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15132
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_5789cdfe:

    # knight "Follow me. I will show you out."
    knight "跟我来。我来带你出去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15137
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d42d112d:

    # "Feeling nervous, you decide to stay vague until you learn more about the situation."
    "你感到十分紧张，只好先含糊其辞，慢慢打探情报。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15139
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_fa041f45:

    # you "Well, it's, err, rumors... Of an all powerful female ninja, out to liberate, er... Someone at the prison."
    you "好吧，这是，呃，传闻.....一个强大的女忍者，要来劫狱，呃......监狱里的某个人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15141
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_2c8483ac:

    # "The knight brings his helmet even closer to your face. You can almost feel the cold metal brushing against your forehead."
    "骑士把他的头盔拉得离你的脸更近。你几乎可以感觉到冰冷的金属刷过你的额头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15143
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_ad5a27a9:

    # hound_knight "What is this giberrish? Didn't you say you were privy to some secret information?"
    hound_knight "这是什么乱七八糟的东西？你不是说你知道一些机密情报吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15145
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_c5a03b02:

    # you "I... I realize it's a bit vague, yes. I'm sorry, I shouldn't have wasted your time."
    you "我...这确实有点模棱两可，是的。对不起，我不应该浪费你的时间。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15147
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_d5fc2f91:

    # hound_knight "No. You shouldn't have."
    hound_knight "是啊，你真的不应该。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15150
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_30336d35:

    # "The anger is palpable in his voice. You are painfully aware that you are stuck in the depth of Xotar prison, far from the surface and unarmed. He could skewer you and no one would hear you scream."
    "他的声音中明显带着愤怒。你痛苦地意识到自己被困在索塔尔监狱的深处，远离地表，而且手无寸铁。他可以对你为所欲为，没有人会听到你的呼救声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15152
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_4e653e10:

    # "There is a long pause, then the knight straightens up."
    "气氛凝固了一段时间，然后骑士起身。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15154
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_44acbb9d:

    # hound_knight "Show this man out. Levy an appropriate fine for wasting our precious time. *sigh*"
    hound_knight "把这个人带出去。对浪费我们宝贵的时间征收适当的罚款。 *叹*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15156
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_6a58a2a4:

    # "The other knight grabs you and Suzume, and shoves you both in the corridor."
    "另一个骑士抓住你和云雀，把你们俩押到走廊里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15158
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_350e3857:

    # knight "You're lucky we don't throw your filthy commoner's ass in jail for contempt! Come with me!"
    knight "你很幸运，我们没有因为藐视法庭而把你这个肮脏的下等人扔进监狱！跟我来吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15164
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_afd4c43b:

    # "You are thrown out of the jail. You had pay a 100 gold fine before you leave."
    "你被赶出了监狱。离开之前你缴纳了100金币的罚款。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15167
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_c86af7ce:

    # hound_knight "You're lucky the Warden and Lady Kenshin vouched for you, or I would have you flogged in the courtyard."
    hound_knight "你很幸运，典狱长和剑心大人为你作了担保，不然我会在院子里给你几十鞭子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15169
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_f65cc859:

    # hound_knight "Out with you!"
    hound_knight "给我滚出去！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15173
translate chinese_simplified c3_meet_hound_knights_82153c31:

    # "One of the knights escorts you back out of the jail, visibly annoyed. They let you go without a word."
    "一名骑士护送你离开了监狱，他显然很生气。但他们还是沉默的让你走了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15179
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_fb07a1cd:

    # "He takes a long look at you, in silence. You {i}feel{/i} as if his gaze is piercing your soul."
    "他久久地看着你，沉默不语。你{i}感觉{/i}他的目光仿佛能刺穿你的灵魂。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15183
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_b6afcf13:

    # hound_knight "Very well. Follow me."
    hound_knight "很好。跟我来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15185
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_11391a70:

    # "He nods towards Suzume."
    "他向云雀点头示意。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15187
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_d9512387:

    # hound_knight "Let her stay here."
    hound_knight "她留在这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15189
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_c042ca97:

    # "Disappointed, Suzume sits back down on her chair."
    "云雀失望地坐回椅子上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15193
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_7df74e7f:

    # "The other knight stays back with her as you follow the leader back into the Prison yard."
    "当你跟他回到监狱大厅时，另一位骑士则在云雀身边盯着她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15200
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_8e038a65:

    # "You go down several long flight of stairs, then through a maze of corridors. In spite of his massive armor, the Knight doesn't seem to tire."
    "你走下几段长长的楼梯，然后穿过迷宫般的走廊。尽管他身披厚重的盔甲，但他却丝毫不觉得疲惫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15202
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_d32b3e6e:

    # "You are now in one of the lowest levels of the Prison, far from any direct sunlight. The air is thick with menace, even the screams have given way to an unatural silence."
    "你来到了监狱的最深处，不见天日。空气中充满了死亡的味道，就连尖叫声也被一种不自然的寂静所取代。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15206
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_f00ad5f5:

    # "Not a word is exchanged until you stand before a thick, heavy metal door. Another knight is standing guard in the shadows, silent as a tomb."
    "你们来到了一扇又厚又重的金属门前，然后他才开口说话。另一位骑士在阴影中站岗，沉默得像是块墓碑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15211
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_6845ff94:

    # hound_knight "Take a look inside this cell. You might find it interesting."
    hound_knight "看看这个密室里面。你可能会觉得很有趣。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15213
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_de7ba51f:

    # "He slides open a metal slot, gesturing for you to observe."
    "他滑开一个金属槽，示意你观察。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15219
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15221
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_ff4bb439:

    # "From the description Haruka gave you, and the missing forearm, you have no difficulties recognizing Subaru."
    "从遥给你的描述，以及残缺的前臂，你可以肯定她就是昴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15223
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_e00f9031:

    # hound_knight "Is this the woman prisoner you were concerned about?"
    hound_knight "这就是你提到的那个女囚犯吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15227
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_eb61f755:

    # you "Yes. This is Subaru."
    you "是的。她就是昴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15229
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_85dd8398:

    # hound_knight "Indeed."
    hound_knight "的确。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15232
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_22dea4c2:

    # you "Well... I'm not sure..."
    you "嗯...我不确定..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15234
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_9ac6feb6:

    # hound_knight "You're not sure? Ha! *hiss*"
    hound_knight "你不确定吗？哈! *嘶*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15236
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_08644610:

    # you "Why is she in jail?"
    you "她犯了什么事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15238
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_a3ccef0c:

    # hound_knight "Her crimes are highly classified. All that you need to know is that she is an enemy of the Crown."
    hound_knight "她的罪行属于高度机密。你只需要知道她是王室的敌人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15240
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_994327b7:

    # hound_knight "Make no mistake, she will rot here she dies of old age, or we deliver the King's mercy."
    hound_knight "毫无疑问，她会在这里腐烂，老死，除非国王大发慈悲。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15242
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_3a716ef7:

    # you "She is a feared warrior. Doesn't she try to escape?"
    you "她是一位令人畏惧的战士。她不想逃跑吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15244
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_1acbbe4a:

    # hound_knight "{i}Was{/i} a feared warrior. Her body is weak, and we keep her on a special mix of spices for unruly prisoners that makes them... fully compliant."
    hound_knight "{i}曾经是{/i}一位令人畏惧的战士。现在她的身体很虚弱，我们让她服用一种专门为不守规矩的囚犯配制的药剂，让他们...完全顺从。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15246
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_7e145173:

    # hound_knight "And the walls in this part of the Prison were rebuilt from Cimerian ruins, and still infused with powerful antimagic runes. Her spells are no use down here."
    hound_knight "监狱最内层的墙壁是用席米亚废墟搭建的，里面充满了强大的反魔法符文。她的忍术在这里毫无用处。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15249
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_1cc4cbf2:

    # you "(So that's why I've been feeling strangely light-headed... Magic is useless here. Better make note of that.)"
    you "（所以这就是为什么我一直觉得晕晕乎乎的...魔法在这里没用。我得记住这一点。）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15251
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_7781f05a:

    # you "Does she talk?"
    you "她会说话吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15253
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_ffe9e5bf:

    # hound_knight "We... 'interrogate' her at least twice a week, using... various means. But she has yet to give us information of any value."
    hound_knight "我们...每周至少“审问”她两次，使用...各种手段。但她尚未向我们提供任何有价值的信息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15255
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_666d2389:

    # hound_knight "Believe me, it's not that the men are going easy on her."
    hound_knight "相信我，我的手下并不是对女人心慈手软。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15257
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_83cdf853:

    # "The silent knight in the shadow, who hadn't said anything up until now, gives out a rasp chuckle."
    "阴影中一直没有说话的沉默骑士发出一声刺耳的笑声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15259
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_f2af19b8:

    # you "Damn. She seems all right, given the circumstances."
    you "该死。现在看来，她过得还不错。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15261
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_b8255b09:

    # hound_knight "We haven't been able to break her will yet. But she hasn't been with us for that long."
    hound_knight "我们还无法击垮她的意志。但她和我们在一起的时间并不长。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15263
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_8c4b67dd:

    # hound_knight "Eventually, she will break. They all do..."
    hound_knight "不过到最后，她肯定会崩溃。他们都是如此..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15265
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_bbc08653:

    # hound_knight "But I didn't bring you down here for idle chatter."
    hound_knight "我带你来这里并不是为了闲聊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15267
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_fae29d93:

    # "You know going in there was going to be a catch."
    "你知道前面就是等着你的陷阱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15271
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_0f0f11b1:

    # hound_knight "This 'apprentice' of hers, Haruka... We know of her."
    hound_knight "她的那位‘徒弟’，鹰守遥...我们认识她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15273
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_7d49a4ec:

    # hound_knight "If we could capture her..."
    hound_knight "如果我们能抓住她的话..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15276
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_4fabd613:

    # you "... you could torture her in front of her mentor, and maybe then she would tell you what you need to know."
    you "...你可以在她的导师面前折磨她，然后她可能会告诉你你需要知道的事情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15278
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_e574aaa4:

    # hound_knight "Precisely. I like the way you think..."
    hound_knight "哈哈。我喜欢你的计划..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15281
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_b9f03b8c:

    # you "Yes?"
    you "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15283
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_a868004e:

    # hound_knight "We could use her against her own mentor. Surely the pupil doesn't have the same mental fortitude..."
    hound_knight "我们可以利用她来对抗她自己的导师。学生肯定没有同样的意志力......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15285
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_9e651a36:

    # hound_knight "And even is she did, her master might care about her enough to finally break."
    hound_knight "即使她这样做了，她的导师也可能会担心她到最终崩溃的程度。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15287
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_dae0ec55_1:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15291
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_cb368b58:

    # hound_knight "As I'm sure you understand, this is of the utmost importance that mortal enemies of the King like this assassin remain safely locked up in this very prison."
    hound_knight "相信你明白，将国王的死敌牢牢地关在这座监狱里是至关重要的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15293
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_f7fe3276:

    # hound_knight "But someone has been skulking around the prison lately, looking for an unguarded entrance. A kunoichi, by the looks of her."
    hound_knight "最近有人在监狱周围踩点，寻找警卫薄弱的突破口。从她的外表来看，应该是女忍者。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15295
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_62169b9a:

    # you "You don't say."
    you "你之前可没说过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15297
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_9cf9d8b4:

    # hound_knight "Since you're so concerned about the security of the prison: know that we are looking for information on this intruder."
    hound_knight "既然你如此关心监狱的安全：请与我们分享入侵者的情报。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15299
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_2f8311ff:

    # hound_knight "If you could help us with her arrest, you would do your King a favor, of course, but you would also earn a handsome reward."
    hound_knight "如果你能帮助我们抓住她，那你就立了一个大功，当然你也会获得丰厚的奖励。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15302
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_06b17c32:

    # you "Well, I can't make promises..."
    you "好吧，但我可不保证..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15304
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_edb9251f:

    # hound_knight "Hmph."
    hound_knight "哼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15307
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_42a832d7:

    # you "I'm all ears."
    you "我在认真听。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15309
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_guards_success_83221c66:

    # hound_knight "Good."
    hound_knight "好的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15311
