    you "我们得赶紧救她出来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15843
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_b7f68a5c:

    # haruka "But I've tried everything. There's no way in. The Prison is too heavily guarded, and even then you'd have to fight through the main yard just to get to the lower levels."
    haruka "但我已经尝试了一切手段。我没办法进去。监狱戒备森严，即便绕开了外围的守卫，你也必须穿过大厅才能抵达底层。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15844
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_fc42b8c4:

    # you "There is another way, though. A secret passage."
    you "不，还有另一条路。一条秘密通道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15846
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_b425e00c:

    # haruka "There is? Tell me!"
    haruka "秘密通道？快告诉我！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15848
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_fe5363d9:

    # you "Only if we make a deal, though."
    you "不过，你得先和我达成协议。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15850
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_46cae01b:

    # haruka "A deal? What deal?"
    haruka "达成协议？什么交易？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15852
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_4422dd24:

    # you "I want to secure this city, make sure no upstanding citizen is being murdered by the likes of you."
    you "我想保护这座城市，确保没有正直的公民被你们这样的人杀害。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15854
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_1e4995f0:

    # haruka "If you help me rescue Subaru, we'll leave this Arios-forsaken city forever. I promise."
    haruka "如果你帮我救出昴，我们立刻离开这座被太阳神抛弃的城市。我保证。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15856
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_825d9f6a:

    # you "Okay. But we'll do things my way. And Suzume is coming with us."
    you "好的。但要按照我的方式做事。云雀也跟着我们一起去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15858
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_776a8b40:

    # haruka "Fine, whatever. The important thing is to save Subaru."
    haruka "好吧，随你的便。只要能救昴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15860
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_negotiate_97142442:

    # "You shake hands. She is reluctant at first, but you feel her becoming slightly less tense as you let her hand go."
    "你们握手言和。一开始她很不情愿，但当你放开她的手时，你感觉到她的紧张感稍微减轻了一些。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15868
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_54c43487:

    # "You remember well the offer of the Hound Knight Leader."
    "你清楚地记得血牙骑士团长的提议。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15870
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_92b834ad:

    # hound_knight "({i}You just have to lead her inside, we'll handle the rest.{/i})"
    hound_knight "（{i}你只需要把她带进去，剩下的事情我们会处理。{/i}）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15872
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_43e0cb5e:

    # hound_knight "({i}Think about the reward. We will be generous.{/i})"
    hound_knight "（{i}想想奖励。我们会很大方的。{/i}）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15882
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_033f5c7b:

    # you "The secret passage is in the Sewers. Leads right into the maximum security part of the Prison."
    you "秘密通道位于下水道中。直接通向监狱最核心的部分。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15884
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_297e91a3:

    # haruka "Really?"
    haruka "真的吗?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15886
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_2f83b2f6:

    # suzume "We don't know where it is yet, but if you work together with us... We can shadow the next convoy and find the secret entrance."
    suzume "我们还不知道它在哪里，但如果你和我们一起努力...我们可以跟踪下一个车队并找到秘密入口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15888
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_ca63f246:

    # you "Using force is out of question, at least until we locate Subaru. We need to enter discreetly."
    you "使用武力是绝对不可能的，至少在我们找到斯巴鲁之前是这样。我们需要悄悄潜入。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15890
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_fb6cf40c:

    # haruka "Okay. Seems like this is our best chance. Let me gather some equipment, and we can meet at night, by the Sewers."
    haruka "好吧。看来这是我们最好的机会了。让我准备一些装备，我们可以晚上在下水道旁碰头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15892
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_155b3e39:

    # suzume "Sure thing... Finally, we're going to see some action!"
    suzume "当然...总算，我们能开始行动了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15894
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_e7551c1a:

    # you "All right, we'll meet you later by {b}the Sewers{/b}."
    you "好的，我们稍后会在{b}下水道{/b}和你见面。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15904
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_7dcd347d:

    # you "(This Subaru business is no concern of mine. If I help the knights, I can get rid of Haruka and make some money and allies in one fell swoop.)"
    you "（昴的事情与我无关。如果我帮助骑士团的话，我就能除掉遥，得到一大笔报酬和新的盟友。）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15906
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_8574e9fa:

    # you "There is a secret passage, by the Eastern postern. I managed to lift the key from one the guards. From there, it's straight down to Subaru's cell."
    you "东门后有一条秘密通道。我设法从一名警卫手中偷来了钥匙。从那里，可以直接到达昴的牢房。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15908
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_e7fc682b:

    # "Suzume knows you're lying, but to her credit, she doesn't display any emotion."
    "铃芽知道你在撒谎，但值得称赞的是，她没有表现出任何情绪。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15910
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_1f164973:

    # haruka "That's... Perfect. The Eastern part of the Prison has less patrols. If we can get in and out fast, we can break Subaru out of there!"
    haruka "那很完美。监狱东边的巡逻人员较少。如果我们能够出其不意的话，我们就能把昴从那里救出去！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15912
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_79bbd203:

    # you "Sure, sure..."
    you "当然，当然..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15914
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_9a6220b8:

    # haruka "All right, let's meet by the prison at night. I'll gather the necessary equipment."
    haruka "好吧，晚上监狱里见面吧。我会准备好必要的装备。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15916
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_51d372aa:

    # you "All right, we'll meet you at {b}the Prison{/b}."
    you "一言为定，我们在{b}监狱{/b}碰头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15926
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_033f5c7b_1:

    # you "The secret passage is in the Sewers. Leads right into the maximum security part of the Prison."
    you "秘密通道位于下水道中。直接通向监狱最核心的部分。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15928
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_297e91a3_1:

    # haruka "Really?"
    haruka "真的吗?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15930
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_2f83b2f6_1:

    # suzume "We don't know where it is yet, but if you work together with us... We can shadow the next convoy and find the secret entrance."
    suzume "我们还不知道它在哪里，但如果你和我们一起努力...我们可以跟踪下一个车队并找到秘密入口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15932
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_ca63f246_1:

    # you "Using force is out of question, at least until we locate Subaru. We need to enter discreetly."
    you "使用武力是绝对不可能的，至少在我们找到斯巴鲁之前是这样。我们需要悄悄潜入。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15934
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_fb6cf40c_1:

    # haruka "Okay. Seems like this is our best chance. Let me gather some equipment, and we can meet at night, by the Sewers."
    haruka "好吧。看来这是我们最好的机会了。让我准备一些装备，我们可以晚上在下水道旁碰头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15936
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_155b3e39_1:

    # suzume "Sure thing... Finally, we're going to see some action!"
    suzume "当然...总算，我们能开始行动了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15938
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_e7551c1a_1:

    # you "All right, we'll meet you later by {b}the Sewers{/b}."
    you "好的，我们稍后会在{b}下水道{/b}和你见面。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15943
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_bb04ea28:

    # haruka "Wait, [MC.name]..."
    haruka "慢着，[MC.name]..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15945
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_b9f03b8c:

    # you "Yes?"
    you "什么事?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15947
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_checkpoint_4f57523a:

    # haruka happy "Thank you."
    haruka happy "谢谢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15958
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_3141afc7:

    # "You wait until nightfall before meeting with Haruka."
    "等到夜幕降临，你前往与遥碰头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15968
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_a344b6b9:

    # haruka "[MC.name]! You came."
    haruka "[MC.name]！你来了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15970
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_906a2155:

    # you "Of course."
    you "当然。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15974
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_6ae7916c:

    # suzume "Heyah!"
    suzume "嘿嘿！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15976
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_587dea39:

    # haruka defiant "Ah. So you're here, too."
    haruka defiant "啊，你也在这里啊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15978
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_31b43827:

    # suzume "I did some reconnaissance, and I saw the guard patrol we're looking for. They're moving some political prisoners in by night. It's likely they'll use the sewers entrance."
    suzume "我侦察了一下，我看到了我们要找的警卫巡逻队。他们要在夜间将一些政治罪犯转移进来。他们很可能会使用下水道的秘密入口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15980
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_ab240c0e:

    # haruka "Great. Let's follow them from a distance. We can't be seen, at least not until we know where that entrance is."
    haruka "妙极了。让我们远远地跟踪他们。我们不会被发现，至少在我们知道入口在哪里之前不会。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15985
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_31582b1d:

    # "You and the girls take position in a dark alley next to the main road. Soon, you see the patrol emerge. Half a dozen soldiers escort a couple of hooded figures, in chains."
    "你们在主路旁边的一条阴暗小巷里就位。很快，巡逻队出现了。六名士兵护送着几个戴着兜帽的人，他们手脚都戴着铁链。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15987
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_d3e938f7:

    # "The group is led by a knight who seems at ease skulking in the dark."
    "这群人由一位骑士带领，他似乎轻松地潜伏在黑暗中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15989
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_fa8a51dc:

    # haruka "I know this coat of arms. This is a knight of the Flaming Hound, the order that defends the prison."
    haruka "我认识这枚徽章。他是守卫监狱的血牙骑士团的一名骑士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15991
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_625d25aa:

    # suzume "Let's see where they are headed."
    suzume "让我们看看他们会去哪里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15995
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_160908e7:

    # "The patrol passes you by as you watch from the shadows. You wait until they are some way off, then start following them carefully."
    "当你在阴影中观察时，巡逻队从你身边经过。等到他们走远了，然后小心翼翼地跟着他们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:15997
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_64368e19:

    # "In spite of your efforts, you feel slow and clumsy, compared to the Kunoichi who seem to glide effortlessly into the night, silent as ghosts."
    "尽管你很努力，但与那些自然地融入夜色、宛如幽灵的女忍者相比，你还是感觉缓慢而笨拙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16000
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_5fe266c9:

    # "Your experience fighting Elven scouts in the dark forests of the Holy Lands taught you a lot about sneaking though, so you manage to follow, not too far behind."
    "你在圣地的黑森林中与精灵斥候战斗的经验教会了你很多关于潜行的知识，你勉强跟上她的步伐，没落后太远。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16003
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_d4c26da8:

    # "You cast a noise reduction spell on yourself, allowing you to move faster to keep up with the girls."
    "你对自己施加了静音光环，让你可以更快地跟上女孩们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16006
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_aab426d4:

    # "As someone with a lot of experience thieving, you know enough about sneaking to follow cautiously. Besides, you have an ace up your sleeve."
    "作为一个惯偷，你对如何潜行了然于胸，你小心翼翼地跟随。此外，你还有一招绝招。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16008
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_b5f3cccd:

    # "Looking up, you see a dark silhouette gliding silently dozens of feet above the streets. It's your pet dragon, keeping an eye on your prey for you."
    "抬头一看，你看到一个黑色的人影在街道上空几十米的高度悄无声息地滑行。原来是你的宠物龙，它可以监视你的猎物。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16010
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_4d2c5611:

    # "Fortunately, the squad is unsuspecting and does not stop to see if they are followed. Soon, it seems they have reached their destination."
    "幸运的是，小队毫无戒心，没有停下检查他们是否被跟踪。很快，他们就到达了目的地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16012
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_5294ab02:

    # suzume "Wait, what are they doing?"
    suzume "等等，他们在做什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16014
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_af475614:

    # "The guards stop in front of a building, which on closer inspection appears to be a barracks."
    "警卫们停在一座建筑物前，仔细一看，那似乎是一个营房。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16021
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_07d57b09:

    # "They exchange words with someone inside, then the whole group enters, save for one sentinel."
    "他们与里面的人交谈了几句，然后整个队伍都进去了，除了一名哨兵。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16023
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_50e694e7:

    # haruka angry "This can't be right! You said they were headed to the Sewers!"
    haruka angry "这不可能！你说过他们要去下水道！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16025
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_74ca6714:

    # you "I thought so... I..."
    you "我也是这么想的...我..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16027
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_626105d5:

    # "Haruka rummages frantically in her satchel, then pulls out a scroll."
    "遥在书包里疯狂地翻找，然后拿出一张卷轴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16029
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_4777262b:

    # haruka defiant "Let me see... Could it be..."
    haruka defiant "让我想想……会不会是……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16031
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c775fd19:

    # "You and Suzume give her a puzzled look."
    "你和云雀一脸疑惑地看着她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16033
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c3a2c14c:

    # haruka "Here! I see. Let me just confirm something."
    haruka "原来如此！我懂了。让我确认一下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16035
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_78192d21:

    # "Haruka leaps on top of an old cart, lifts herself up on a balcony then climbs up a building effortlessly. A moment later, she reaches the roof, disappearing from view."
    "遥跳上一辆旧手推车，在阳台上站起来，然后毫不费力地爬上建筑物。片刻之后，她到达屋顶，消失在视野中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16037
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_9afd1bdd:

    # you "What the..."
    you "什么..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16039
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c4096080:

    # suzume doubt "Hush, don't worry. She'll be back in a moment."
    suzume doubt "嘘，别担心，她马上就回来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16041
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_19c5f0d2:

    # "A minute later, Haruka comes back down, jumping in a somersault to land just next to you without barely a noise."
    "一分钟后，遥回来了，翻了个跟头，落在你身边，几乎没有发出任何声音。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16043
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_b2b06d6d:

    # haruka "I've seen them. There's a grate to the Sewers in the court behind the barracks. That's where they took the prisoners."
    haruka "我见过他们。军营后面的院子里有一个通往下水道的格栅。那就是他们押运俘虏的地方。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16045
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_077d59db:

    # haruka "The only way in is through the barracks' entrance, though."
    haruka "不过，进入的唯一途径是军营的入口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16047
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_bdd5fd21:

    # you "We can't fight our way through a guards' barracks! Even if we win, this will bring the whole city's attention down on us."
    you "我们无法杀出一条血路穿过守卫营房！就算我们做到了，动静也会引起全城的关注。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16049
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_61fe4441:

    # haruka "I know. We need to infiltrate. And there's the issue of the sentinel they posted at the door..."
    haruka "我知道。我们需要潜伏进去。还有他们在门口巡逻的哨兵的问题......"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16051
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_3f9ecb52:

    # haruka "We can't sneak past him, and he's wearing armor, so a takedown from afar is too risky..."
    haruka "我们无法从他眼皮底下溜进去，而且他穿着盔甲，所以远距离击杀风险太大..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16053
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_cc508f30:

    # suzume shrewd "Seems like we need to come up with a plan, and fast. I think I know just what to do."
    suzume shrewd "看来我们得赶紧想个办法了。我想我知道该怎么做了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16055
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_a7035cf6:

    # "She kneels besides Haruka, and whispers something in her ear."
    "她跪在遥身边，在她耳边低声说了些什么。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16057
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_f272336a:

    # haruka surprise "What?!? I don't... It's not..." with vpunch
    haruka surprise "什么？！我不……不是……" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16059
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_3cd313af:

    # haruka angry "Why don't {i}you{/i} do it?"
    haruka angry "你为什么不做呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16061
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_b7117f61:

    # suzume "I'm going to stay out here to cover you guys. It's better if no one sees me. But you need to get inside with [MC.name] fast, don't you?"
    suzume "我会留在这里掩护你们。反正没有人看见我。但你需要和[MC.name]快速潜入，不是吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16063
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_8428aa08:

    # haruka surprise "Y-Yes, but..."
    haruka surprise "是的，但是……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16065
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_fe2a99ae:

    # suzume normal "Don't argue, then! This is your chance to save Subaru. Don't let it slip!"
    suzume normal "那就别争辩了！这是你拯救昴的机会，千万别错失良机！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16067
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_ec502592:

    # haruka blush "I... You... I guess you're right..."
    haruka blush "我……你……我想你是对的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16069
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_3f5d490f:

    # you "Will someone tell me what's going on?"
    you "有人能告诉我发生了什么事吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16071
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_26a4f9ed:

    # "Suzume grins, and whispers her plan in your ear."
    "云雀微笑着，在你耳边低声讲述她的计划。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16079
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_048d8266:

    # suzume "Well done, you two! I feel like you could have gone on for a bit longer!"
    suzume "干得好，两位！我觉得你还可以再坚持一段时间！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16086
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_a7d53326:

    # haruka blush "C-Couldn't you think of anything else to distract the guard?"
    haruka blush "C：你就不能想到其他办法分散守卫的注意力吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16088
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_31ad7b06:

    # suzume "Hey, it was just the first thing that came to mind!"
    suzume "嘿嘿，我第一个想到的就是这个！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16090
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_443dbcd6:

    # haruka angry "What kind of mind thinks like this???" with vpunch
    haruka angry "什么样的人才会这么想？！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16092
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_07d60541:

    # suzume doubt "I suppose we could just have whistled to get the guard's attention... But hey, that way was more fun!"
    suzume doubt "我想我们本来也可以吹口哨引起守卫的注意……但是，嘿，那样做更有趣！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16094
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_f3a03a88:

    # haruka "Fun for whom!!!" with vpunch
    haruka "谁觉得好玩！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16096
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_2495b7e6:

    # you "Stop squabbling, you two! Haruka, we need to rush to the Sewers before we lose the trail."
    you "你们别吵架了！遥，我们得赶紧进入下水道，以免失去他们的踪迹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16098
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_9725c1d6:

    # you "Suzume, hide the body and meet us at the rendezvous point."
    you "云雀，把尸体藏起来，到集合点来接应我们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16100
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_4a0f1cab:

    # suzume bend "Okay. Good luck out there."
    suzume bend "好的，祝你好运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16105
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_16997eaf:

    # haruka "Quick, let's follow them!"
    haruka "快点，我们得跟上他们！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16112
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_b39e4dbd:

    # "Moving quickly, you go through the grate behind the barracks and descend into the Sewers."
    "你快速移动，穿过营房后面的栅栏，进入下水道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16114
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_88ea7e4b:

    # "Once you reach the ground, Haruka motions for you to stay silent. She places her palm on the wall, concentrating."
    "当你到达地面时，遥示意你保持安静。她将手掌放在墙上，集中注意力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16116
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_38dc2bc6:

    # you "What... What are you doing?"
    you "什么...你在做什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16118
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_44e1eb0e:

    # haruka defiant "Hush! I can sense their footsteps echoing through the tunnels... They're already pretty far. We need to hurry."
    haruka defiant "嘘！我能感觉到他们的脚步声在隧道里回荡……他们已经走远了。我们得快点。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16120
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c1f04ac1:

    # "Haruka darts into the nearest tunnel, and you follow her as fast as you can, half-blinded by the darkness."
    "遥冲进了最近的隧道，你以最快的速度跟在她后面，你几乎看不到任何东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16122
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_914d9e79:

    # you "Hey! Wait..."
    you "嘿！等待..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16126
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_fe016dd7:

    # "From time to time, Haruka stops to feel the ground's vibrations, giving you time to catch up."
    "遥时不时地停下来感受地面的振动，让你有时间跟上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16128
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_78f67829:

    # "Eventually, she stops dead in her tracks and pulls you close."
    "最终，她停下脚步，将你拉近。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16130
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_0831383c:

    # haruka "They're just around the bend over there. We must be quiet."
    haruka "他们就在那边的拐角处。我们必须保持安静。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16132
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_339de26c:

    # "You can see the flickering of torches up ahead. You both move silently in the shadows, until you can cautiously look around the corner."
    "你看到前方有闪烁的火把。你们在阴影中无声地移动，直到可以观察拐角处。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16140
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_08b79779:

    # knight "We'll take over from here. Common guards are now allowed beyond this point."
    knight "现在把犯人交给我们。普通的守卫也可以通过这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16148
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_32d74a4b:

    # guard "Me legs are killing me, and me throat is parched!"
    guard "我的腿快要酸死了，我的喉咙也干了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16150
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_8fd1ad36:

    # guard "Aw, have a heart, Sir, at least let us rest a little in yer cosy barracks! I need me a drink!"
    guard "噢，请发发慈悲吧，先生，至少让我们在您舒适的营房里休息一下吧！我想喝一杯！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16152
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_ec13e8e9:

    # knight "Giving me orders, are you now, commoner?"
    knight "你在教我做事？你认真的吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16157
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_10568cdd:

    # guard "OW!!!"
    guard "噢！！！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16160
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_6e80b855:

    # "The knight casually smacks the guard in the jaw with his armored gauntlet, knocking out a tooth."
    "骑士随手一挥用他的护臂敲了敲守卫的下巴，打掉了一颗牙齿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16162
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c88a97a9:

    # knight "Is this how you address your betters, pleb? I gave you an order. Now, scram with the rest of you."
    knight "贱民，这就是你称呼上级的方式吗？我已经下了命令。现在，你们给我赶快滚。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16164
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_2bb28bef:

    # "Frightened, the other guards grab their knocked-out comrade and skitter back through the tunnel."
    "其他守卫吓坏了，扶住了他们被击倒的队友，然后从隧道里溜了回来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16166
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_53cf5517:

    # "Haruka pulls you down behind a broken crate just in time for you to let the guards pass."
    "遥把你拉到一个破损的板条箱后面，正好躲开返回的守卫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16168
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_0a9a6d71:

    # "There's not much space behind the crate, so you have to stay close together. It isn't unpleasant."
    "板条箱后面没有太多空间，所以你们必须紧贴在一起。这并不令人不快。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16170
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_086ef755:

    # "She whispers in your ear."
    "她在你耳边低语。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16172
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_0d7f4e4e:

    # haruka "(Let's wait until they're out of hearing range. Then we move.)"
    haruka "（等到他们走远了。然后我们再行动。）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16174
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_8e43af99:

    # "You turn your attention back to the knight and his wretched prisoners, blinded by hoods."
    "你把注意力转回到骑士和他那些被头巾盖住的可怜囚犯身上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16176
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_4ca5fe3a:

    # "Elder prisoner" "Please, Sir! Where are you taking us? I-I can't walk much longer..."
    "老年囚犯" "Please, Sir! Where are you taking us? I-I can't walk much longer..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16178
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_1d674723:

    # knight "Save your breath, old man. Or I'll be more than happy to give you the same treatment I gave that stupid guard."
    knight "省点口气吧，老东西。或者和那个愚蠢的守卫得到一样的待遇？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16180
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_336ee60c:

    # "The knight places his hand on the wall and does something."
    "骑士将手放在墙上，鼓捣了一番。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16185
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_ec117104:

    # "You can feel the rumble of stone as the wall slowly moves to reveal an entrance."
    "当墙壁缓慢移动并露出入口时，你感受到岩壁的震动声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16187
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_90ef5ce6:

    # "He yanks the chains to lead the prisoners inside."
    "他猛拉铁链，把囚犯带进去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16189
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_db40b5b4:

    # haruka "(We strike, now!)"
    haruka "（就是现在，行动！）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16208
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_a35a0c9c:

    # "One second Haruka is besides you, the next she is leaping across the tunnel, closing the gap with the knight at a terrifying speed."
    "前一秒遥还在你身边，下一秒她就跃过了隧道，以可怕的速度逼近了骑士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16212
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_4e783466:

    # knight "Uh-"
    knight "呃-"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16218
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_32a35395:

    # "The knight doesn't have a chance to turn around before Haruka plunges her dagger in his neck, striking at the gap between his armor and helmet."
    "骑士还没来得及转身，遥就将匕首插进他的脖子，插进了盔甲和头盔之间的缝隙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16222
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_25d79d32:

    # "For a second, Haruka freezes behind the knight's body, frowning."
    "一瞬间，遥在骑士的身后僵住了，皱着眉头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16224
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_e5639f63:

    # "Elder prisoner" "What is going on? Please, anyone, can you help us!"
    "老年囚犯" "What is going on? Please, anyone, can you help us!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16226
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_017b03ff:

    # "The hooded prisoners start panicking, unable to see what just happened. Haruka snaps out of her daze."
    "蒙面囚犯开始惊慌，他们无法看到刚刚发生的事情。遥从茫然中回过神来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16228
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c393d72c:

    # haruka angry "Quick, [MC.name], come with me! We need to go get her!"
    haruka angry "快，[MC.name]，跟我来！我们得去接她！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16230
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_db578ed0:

    # "You look at the two wretched prisoners, shackled and powerless."
    "你看看这两个可怜的囚犯，他们戴着镣铐，无能为力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16232
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_5c96ef6f:

    # you "What about these people?"
    you "这些人呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16234
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_084428c6:

    # haruka "What about them? We have no time, [MC.name]!"
    haruka "你还有工夫管他们？我们没有时间浪费了，[MC.name]！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16240
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_65b858ca:

    # you "I just can't leave them here..."
    you "可我不能把他们留在这里..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16242
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_749fb348:

    # "Haruka sighs with exasperation as you remove the hooded sacks from their heads. She helps you snap their bounds open with her steel."
    "当你从他们头上取下带兜帽的麻袋时，遥恼怒地叹了口气。她帮你粉碎了他们的镣铐。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16244
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_daeb6ffe:

    # "The prisoners are an old man and his teenage daughter, whom on better days look like they might have been part of good society."
    "囚犯是一位老人和他十几岁的女儿，在还未被逮捕时，他们可能是什么上流人士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16246
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_caf7b185:

    # "They thank you profusely before running away in the tunnels."
    "他们在隧道里逃跑之前向你致以万分的感谢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16248
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_6b971bc9:

    # haruka defiant "Here, happy now? Now, let's go!"
    haruka defiant "好了，现在满意了吧？好了，我们走吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16257
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_5e9f6f6b:

    # you "You're right, we have more important things to do."
    you "你说得对，我们还有更重要的事情要做。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16259
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_sewers_c8fdad92:

    # "Haruka charges recklessly inside the Prison through the secret entrance, barely giving you time to follow."
    "遥从秘密入口鲁莽地冲进监狱，几乎不给你反应的时间。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16268
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7bbed873:

    # you "Wait, Haruka, wait!"
    you "等等，遥，等等！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16270
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_0e712770:

    # "Haruka stops, looking uncertain."
    "遥停了下来，看上去有些犹豫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16272
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_527013c3:

    # haruka surprise "The vibrations, I can't feel them any more. I can't locate Subaru!"
    haruka surprise "我感觉不到震动了。我找不到斯巴鲁了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16274
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_49b7dca0:

    # you "These walls are Cimerian-built. I think they have wards against magic."
    you "这些墙是席米亚人建造的。我认为里面有魔法防护装置。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16276
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e64b0df3:

    # haruka angry "Damn it!"
    haruka angry "该死的！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16279
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_005f039b:

    # you "Wait, I recognize this corridor... We're close to Subaru now!"
    you "等等，我认得这条走廊...我们已经很接近昴了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16281
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f2fe45a1:

    # you "It seems like we are already in the deepest part of the Prison... She can't be very far now, can she?"
    you "看来我们已经到了监狱的最深处...她现在不可能走得太远吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16283
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_6060c2a7:

    # haruka angry "Look, down here!"
    haruka angry "看，下面！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16285
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_73619529:

    # "Haruka shows you some markings on the wall. To you, they look like a series of random scratches."
    "遥向你展示了墙上的一些标记。对你来说，它们看起来像是一系列随机的划痕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16287
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_ce3366f7:

    # haruka "I recognize this, this is a code from the Earth school. Subaru must have found a way to leave this alongside the way, behind her captors' back."
    haruka "我认得，这是大地氏族的暗号。昴肯定找到了一种方法，在守卫没注意到的时候留下了这些记号。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16289
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_59c03581:

    # haruka "This should lead her to her cell!"
    haruka "这应该会引导我们找到她的牢房！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16292
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_eaebe435:

    # "After just a few turns, you finally reach the cells."
    "转了好几个弯后，你终于到达了牢房。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16296
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_8df7973b:

    # haruka "The trail ends here!"
    haruka "这里就是尽头了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16298
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_40a200c3:

    # you "There are no guards..."
    you "这里居然没有守卫..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16300
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_5861b412:

    # haruka "We've been lucky! Look, it's her cell! Quick, let's break her out!"
    haruka "我们很幸运！看，这是她的牢房！快点，让我们把她救出来！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16302
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e30c566a:

    # you "But don't you think it's strange..."
    you "但你不觉得这很奇怪吗..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16307
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_8e4e291f:

    # "Without listening to you, Haruka throws a ninja bomb at the cell's door, blowing it open." with vpunch
    "遥不顾你的劝阻，向牢房门投掷了一枚忍者炸弹，将门炸开了。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16309
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_ab65055f:

    # "A silhouette emerges from the smoke, stumbling out of the cell."
    "一道人影从烟雾中出现，跌跌撞撞地走出了牢房。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16311
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_289db849:

    # haruka "Sensei!"
    haruka "老师！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16313
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_87025a6b:

    # subaru "Haruka? Is that you?"
    subaru "遥？是你吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16315
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_cd0bb754:

    # haruka "It' me, Sensei! We're breaking you out!"
    haruka "是我，老师！我们来救你出去！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16319
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_a662e7fd:

    # "Haruka flings a weapon at Subaru, who catches it swiftly with her good arm, in spite of her tired state."
    "遥向昴扔出一把武器，尽管昴很疲惫，但昴还是用完好的手臂迅速接住了武器。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16324
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_9fd5deff:

    # subaru "We? Who's with you?"
    subaru "我们？你和谁在一起？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16326
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e648c242:

    # haruka "This is [MC.name]. He can be trusted. We need to make our way out, now. Can you walk?"
    haruka "这是[MC.name]。他值得信赖。我们现在要想办法出去。你还走得动吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16329
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_70d80b0b:

    # subaru "This man... This man..."
    subaru "这个家伙...这个家伙..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16331
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_fb5757fb:

    # haruka "What is it, Subaru?"
    haruka "他怎么了，昴？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16333
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_680fbb35:

    # subaru "He's with them!"
    subaru "他和他们是一伙的！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16341
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f42734c5:

    # "Faster than your eyes can hope to follow, Subaru leaps at you, plunging her blade through your heart."
    "昴用你无法捕捉到的速度向你扑来，将她手里的剑刺入你的心脏。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16343
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_3af955bf:

    # subaru "Die, monster..."
    subaru "去死吧，畜生..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16347
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_6567f73d:

