    # haruka angry "What the hell are you saying! I've never met you in my life" with vpunch
    haruka angry "你到底在说什么！我这辈子都没见过你。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16396
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_715480a5:

    # hound_knight "Oh, but you have..."
    hound_knight "哦，看来你忘了..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16423
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_2fb39cc8:

    # noroi_leader "Haven't you?"
    noroi_leader "我们没见过吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16425
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f49ac211:

    # haruka "No! No! It's impossible..."
    haruka "不！不！这不可能..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16427
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7a8c3662:

    # subaru "These knights. They're Noroi, Haruka."
    subaru "这些骑士。他们是诺罗伊魔族，遥。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16429
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_60c99589:

    # you "What in the Seven Hells is this?"
    you "这到底是什么见鬼的情况？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16432
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_5eb4d106:

    # "Noroi Leader" "And here is our little interloper... The Princess's own errand boy."
    "诺罗伊领袖" "And here is our little interloper... The Princess's own errand boy."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16434
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_279060e1:

    # "Noroi Leader" "And who is that fool?"
    "诺罗伊领袖" "And who is that fool?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16436
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_68622b80:

    # noroi_leader "No matter, just kill him. And get the girls alive. Cut off their limbs if you have, to but don't let them die!"
    noroi_leader "没关系，杀了他。让这些雌性活下去。如果需要的话就砍掉他们的四肢，但别让他们死了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16438
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_1254aa4d:

    # "Norois" "Yes, boss!!!" with vpunch
    "诺罗伊斯" "Yes, boss!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16443
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_2d6e96e2:

    # "Clutching your sword, you empty your mind, ready to enter the fray."
    "你握紧你的剑，理清思绪，准备投入战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16445
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_a93db0aa:

    # "Unable to use your spells, you are at a serious disadvantage. You will have to think quick."
    "你无法在这里使用法术，你现在处于下风。你必须快速思考。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16448
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e7e56548:

    # drogon "*ROAR*"
    drogon "*吼*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16449
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_745c1cd9:

    # "A loud roar echoes through the corridors. You know your pet dragon has been following you the whole time, and he is now rushing to help."
    "一声巨响在走廊里回荡。你知道你的宠物龙一直跟着你，现在它正冲过来帮忙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16464
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e97f8631:

    # "The first Noroi comes clawing at you, mistaking you for an easy target."
    "一个魔族来抓你，他以为你是一个很好解决的目标。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16471
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7c477f45:

    # "Your blade slashes through him like butter, and he gives you a dumbfounded look as his body is sliced cleanly in halves."
    "你的刀刃像切黄油一样切过他，他的身体被干净利落地切成两半，你一脸愕然。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16476
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_48bc8fba:

    # "Reduced to using your staff as a mace, you hit the charging demon in the face, eliciting a painful grunt."
    "你只能用你的法杖作为物理武器攻击，你击中了冲锋的恶魔的脸，引起一阵痛苦的咕噜声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16480
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_48d51025:

    # "Before he can recover, you grab your staff with both hands and bring it down on his skull, hearing a statisfying crunch."
    "在他恢复过来之前，你用双手抓住你的法杖，锤在他的头骨上，传来一阵令人满足的嘎吱声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16485
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_6b35a3d6:

    # "His cry of triumph becomes a scream as Drogon swoops in and locks his neck between his jaws, crushing it."
    "当龙猛扑过来，把他的脖子扭在下巴之间，将其压碎时，他胜利的呼喊变成了尖叫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16489
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_d16cabf3:

    # "Demon blood splashes around as Drogon increases the pressure, while the demon jerks around helplessly. It isn't long before he stops moving."
    "随着龙增加力道，恶魔的血液四处飞溅，他无助地扭动着。没过多久他就停止了呼吸。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16498
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_caf96a67:

    # "A shriek of pain comes from the next Noroi as Subaru severs his arm at shoulder level, before swirling and taking his head off."
    "下一个魔族发出一声痛苦的尖叫，昴在肩膀处切断了他的手臂，然后旋转并砍下了他的头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16508
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_c480189b:

    # "Haruka also found her mark, sticking two kunais in the chest of her victim before extending her arms outwards and ripping it open."
    "遥也选择了她的目标，她将两颗苦无刺入胸口，然后向外伸出双臂，将其撕开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16510
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_cd2de33d:

    # noroi_leader "Get them! Get them!"
    noroi_leader "抓住他们！抓住他们！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16516
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7938b911:

    # "The last Noroi soldier hesitates just a bit too long before a kunai thrown by Haruka hits his throat. He dies in a gurgle."
    "最后一名魔族士兵犹豫了许久，遥扔出的苦无击中了他的喉咙。他在咯咯声中死去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16520
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_a458e766:

    # subaru "It's just you, now, demon!"
    subaru "现在就剩你了，恶魔！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16522
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_45acc948:

    # noroi_leader "You will not get past me! I should have killed you a long time after all, but now I won't make that mistake!"
    noroi_leader "你无法击败我！我本来早就该杀了你的，但现在我不会再犯这样的错误了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16529
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_d77bafb4:

    # "Dark energy swirls around the Noroi as he seems to feed on the remains of his dead comrades. He ends up towering above all of you, large as an ogre."
    "黑暗能量在魔族周围盘旋，他似乎正在以死去战友的遗体为养料。他的体型变得越来越大，像食人魔一样高大。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16533
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_9121f97a:

    # noroi_leader "Hyaaaaahahaha, POWER!!!"
    noroi_leader "哈哈哈哈，我充满了力量！！！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16535
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_91b0617a:

    # noroi_leader "Now you DIE!"
    noroi_leader "全都去死吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16540
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_c1a843dd:

    # "Charging at you with surprising speed, you barely have time to avoid the demon's strike but the shock sends you flying into the wall, hitting your head hard."
    "他以惊人的速度向你冲来，你来不及躲避恶魔的攻击，冲击力让你飞到墙上，你的头受到了猛烈的撞击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16542
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_b7151261:

    # you "OUCH!" with vpunch
    you "哎哟！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16544
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f6f358d8:

    # "Subaru and Haruka dodged away, but he is on them in an instant. Subaru can barely parry his flurry of attacks with her good arm, while Haruka struggles to find an opening."
    "昴和遥躲开了，但他立刻就追上了他们。昴无法只用独臂来抵挡他的连续攻击，而遥则努力寻找突破口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16546
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_bae04b3b:

    # noroi_leader "Your temple is over! Your people is over!"
    noroi_leader "你的神社已经被毁灭了！你的族人也完了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16550
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_8afcc9f1:

    # noroi_leader "With every life you lose, you grow weaker, but we feed on death! We are unstoppable!"
    noroi_leader "每失去一个生命，你就会变得更加虚弱，而我们却以死亡为食！我们势不可挡！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16554
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_95ac7267:

    # subaru "Maggots feast on the dead too, but I can still crush them under my heel!"
    subaru "蛆虫也会以死者为食，但我仍然可以将它们踩在脚下！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16558
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_57abdde9:

    # "*HIT*" with vpunch
    "*打*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16560
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_6f30d585:

    # "Seeing a fleeting opening in his guard, Subaru kicks him right in the chin, sending his head flinging backwards."
    "昴看到他露出了一丝破绽，一脚踢在他的下巴上，把他的头向后甩了出去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16563
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_d7c8125d:

    # noroi_leader "ARRRH!" with vpunch
    noroi_leader "啊啊啊！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16565
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_9b5f9fe9:

    # "Stumbling blindly forward, trying to grab her, the Noroi ogre fails to see Subaru is already sliding between his legs, slashing at the back of both his knees."
    "魔族视野受限跌跌撞撞，试图抓住她，却没有看到昴已经在他的双腿之间滑动，划伤了他的双膝。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16568
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_32cea6c1:

    # "*SLASH*"
    "*斩击*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16571
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_74b56890:

    # noroi_leader "AAAAARRRRH!!!" with vpunch
    noroi_leader "啊啊啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16573
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_2507392a:

    # "The demon flips around. He nearly crushes Subaru's head with his weapon, but Haruka blocks it at the last moment."
    "恶魔转过身来。他差点用武器砸碎昴的头，但遥在最后一刻挡住了它。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16579
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_3046a2d7:

    # haruka "Haaaah!!!" with vpunch
    haruka "哈哈！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16581
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_43bc9ebc:

    # "Kicking Haruka viciously, the demon sends her flying, knocking down Subaru at the same time. He looms over them, ready to strike a killing blow."
    "恶魔狠狠地踢了遥一脚，将她踢飞，同时将昴击倒。他俯视着他们，准备给予致命一击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16583
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_3c0e3db3:

    # haruka "Subaru!!! Watch out!!!" with vpunch
    haruka "斯巴鲁！！！小心！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16585
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_a1f753b3:

    # you "(It's my chance!)"
    you "（好机会！）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16587
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e7b839a0:

    # "Having regained your footing, you take advantage of the giant's inattention."
    "稳住身形后，你利用了巨人的疏忽。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16589
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_248fda6d:

    # you "Hey, hunchback!"
    you "嘿，驼背！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16591
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_3d9e9adc:

    # "Grabbing a kunai on the floor, you leap over the demon's back, sticking the weapon in his neck."
    "你抓起地上的一把苦无，跳过恶魔的背，将武器插在他的脖子上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16595
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_4e7aba2c:

    # noroi_leader "*GROAR*" with vpunch
    noroi_leader "*咆哮*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16600
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_875c8025:

    # "The monster trashes around as dark blood spurts from his neck, trying to shake you off. Eventually, he manages to fling you off, turning around to face you."
    "他四处冲撞，黑色的血液从他的脖子上喷涌而出，他试图将你甩开。最终，他成功地把你甩开，转身面对你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16602
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7c8f4ea5:

    # noroi_leader "YOU WORM! ANY LAST WORDS?!?" with vpunch
    noroi_leader "你这条虫子！还有什么遗言吗？！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16611
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_856b7835:

    # "*SPLAT*" with vpunch
    "*啪*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16630
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_62b13028:

    # "Before he can say anything further, his body is split cleanly in half by a blade."
    "还没等他再说什么，他的身体就被利刃劈成了两半。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16640
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_bc757986:

    # "As his lifeless body crashes to the ground, you can see Subaru standing behind him, her blade covered in gore."
    "当他毫无生机的身体倒在地上时，你看到昴站在他身后，她的剑上沾满了血迹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16642
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_68cb7756:

    # subaru "Phew. Thanks, you guys. It nearly got the best of us."
    subaru "呼。谢谢你们。它差点就杀了我们最强的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16644
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_5488107c:

    # subaru "I'm really badly out of shape."
    subaru "我的身体大不如前了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16649
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_7a75e712:

    # haruka normal "You used to be able to defeat three of these single-handedly... You need rest, Sensei. "
    haruka normal "你以前能单枪匹马打败其中三个……你需要休息了，老师。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16651
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_568ce381:

    # subaru "Well, I need to learn to do a lot of things single-handedly now. *chukles*"
    subaru "嗯，我现在需要学会一个人做很多事情。 *咯咯笑*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16653
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_eedb6de6:

    # haruka sad "I-I didn't mean..."
    haruka sad "我并不是那个意思……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16655
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_a7f5bc7d:

    # you "Ladies, shall we get out of here? I think we've overstayed our welcome."
    you "女士们，我们要离开这里吗？我认为我们已经不受欢迎了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16657
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f2511b56:

    # subaru "I for one would love to leave this place behind. Lead the way."
    subaru "我也很想离开这个地方。带路吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16661
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_13d734ce:

    # haruka angry "Of course! Follow me, let's go!"
    haruka angry "当然！跟我来，我们走吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16668
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_66900265:

    # "Running like the wind, Haruka leads you and Subaru back through the maze of corridors. You're glad that she has memorized the way perfectly, as it is easy to get lost in the dimly-lit prison."
    "遥像风一样奔跑，带领着你和昴穿过迷宫般的走廊。你很高兴她完全记住了路线，因为在光线昏暗的监狱里很容易迷路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16675
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_0737222c:

    # "You finally come out through the Sewers exit."
    "你终于从下水道出口出来了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16679
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_bc78e4ad:

    # "*BUMP*" with vpunch
    "*撞*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16681
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_6bfce0db:

    # you "What's that?"
    you "那是什么?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16683
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_f1139507:

    # you "Haaah!" with vpunch
    you "哈哈！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16685
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_34b8e680:

    # "With horror, you realize you stumbled on a mangled corpse. Although its features are barely recognizeable, you realize it's one of the shackled prisoners from earlier."
    "你惊恐地发现自己无意间撞到了一具血肉模糊的尸体。虽然它的面容几乎无法辨认，但你意识到它是之前被戴上镣铐的囚犯之一。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16687
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_c7c51704:

    # "The body of the other prisoner is further away in the sewer, missing some limbs."
    "另一名囚犯的尸体在距离下水道较远的地方，失去了一些肢体。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16689
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_cdb0ce9e:

    # you "W-What happened to them..."
    you "他们、他们怎么了..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16691
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_5622a77f:

    # haruka sad "Seems like some sewer monster got to them while they were left here..."
    haruka sad "看来他们被留在这里的时候，遭到了某种下水道怪物的袭击……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16693
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_305da459:

    # you "Damn... We shouldn't have left them alone here..."
    you "该死...我们不应该把他们一个人留在这里..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16695
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_dfa790be:

    # haruka "I'm sorry. What's done is done."
    haruka "对不起。但已经无法挽回了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16697
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_4b05228b:

    # subaru "Let's leave before the Noroi catch up to us... Or this 'thing' comes back for seconds."
    subaru "让我们在诺罗伊魔族追上我们之前离开吧...否则这个“东西”随时可能会出现。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16700
translate chinese_simplified c3_haruka_rescue_e3161885:

    # "The three of you run through the sewers at top speed, not looking back."
    "三人头也不回地以极快的速度穿过下水道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:16707
translate chinese_simplified c3_free_subaru_5155ea07:

    # "You manage to make your way back to another sewer exit, where you previously set up a rendezvous with Suzume."
    "你设法回到另一个下水道出口，你与云雀事先约好在那里会合。"

