    # "A scuffle starts, and the driver hurries past the group onto the relative safety of the bridge."
    "双方发生扭打，司机迅速从人群中穿过，驶上相对安全的桥上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19324
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_992cbc37:

    # "You are still thinking about the incident when the princess shows up."
    "你还在想着那件事的时候，公主出现了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19327
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_f36dc23e:

    # kuro "Welcome, [MC.name]. I was hoping we could catch up after the events of the last few weeks."
    kuro "欢迎，[MC.name]。我希望在经历了过去几周的事情之后，我们能有机会聊聊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19329
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_fac882ec:

    # you "Of course. I guess I have both good and bad news."
    you "当然。我想我既有好消息也有坏消息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19331
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_e637cc41:

    # kuro "Good news first, I beg you."
    kuro "先说好消息，求你了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19333
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_e5861950:

    # you "Well, all three of the Kunoichi that were roaming the city have been caught or neutralized."
    you "嗯，之前在城里游荡的三名女忍者都已经被抓获或消灭了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19335
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_2759c119:

    # kuro "That's a relief. What about the bad news?"
    kuro "真是松了一口气。那坏消息呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19337
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_cb478f62:

    # you "I couldn't trace their actions to our killer. I'm afraid the rumors may have been wrong; maybe he has no connection to the Kunoichi after all."
    you "我无法将他们的行为与凶手联系起来。恐怕那些传言都是错的；也许他根本就和女忍者没有任何关系。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19339
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_b7c00d5e:

    # kuro "At least, let us review what we've learnt..."
    kuro "至少，让我们回顾一下我们所学到的东西……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19347
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_58647cbe:

    # kuro "So you say a magical artifact was stolen from the Magic University, a mask that could make the blind see?"
    kuro "你说魔法大学里一件魔法神器被盗了，那是一个能让盲人重见光明的面具？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19349
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_15d6b866:

    # you "Yes."
    you "是的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19352
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_ffea43f9:

    # kuro "And this note you found? What did it say?"
    kuro "你找到的这张纸条上写了什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19354
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_46065d41:

    # you "'Now Haku will have his revenge.' Corny, I know."
    you "“现在白龙要报仇了。”我知道这很老套。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19356
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b353a8e6:

    # "Ignoring your attempt to make a joke, the princess's face is locked in a frown. She looks dead serious."
    "公主对你的玩笑置之不理，眉头紧锁，神情严肃。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19358
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_e6104600:

    # you "Does this name ring a bell? Haku?"
    you "这个名字你觉得耳熟吗？白龙？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19360
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_377da2e7:

    # kuro "I'm afraid so."
    kuro "恐怕是这样。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19362
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_7d8e245d:

    # you "Who is it, then?"
    you "那么，他究竟是谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19364
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_947da4db:

    # "Kurohime hesitates for a second, about to tell you, but she shakes her head."
    "黑姬犹豫了一下，正要告诉你，但她摇了摇头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19366
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_2a399958:

    # kuro "I'm afraid I can't let you know this information just yet. Not before I have a talk with my father."
    kuro "恐怕我现在还不能告诉你这件事。我得先跟父亲谈谈。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19368
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_bddf0877:

    # kuro "Anyway, the strange contraption the assassin was wearing must be this mask. It would be too strange of a coincidence otherwise."
    kuro "总之，刺客佩戴的那个奇怪装置肯定就是这个面具。否则，这巧合未免太过蹊跷。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19370
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_31bc6110:

    # you "I agree."
    you "我同意。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19372
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_3de44f9b:

    # kuro "So this man must be originally blind... Thats is an important clue."
    kuro "所以这个人原本一定是盲人……这是一个重要的线索。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19381
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_9782ba71:

    # kuro "Ah, yes, I was as stunned as you were to learn about Uesugi's family history..."
    kuro "啊，是的，得知上杉家的历史后，我也和你一样震惊……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19384
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b6adef15:

    # you "Why isn't she here, by the way?"
    you "对了，她为什么没来？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19388
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_7b4372b5:

    # kuro "I've been keeping her at arm's length, to be honest. She's obviously distraught, but I have also begun to worry that she may be a liability."
    kuro "说实话，我一直和她保持距离。她显然很沮丧，但我也开始担心她可能会成为一个隐患。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19390
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_4c5f4953:

    # you "That boy Mizuki mentioned..."
    you "水木提到的那个男孩……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19392
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_6dfbf1c8:

    # kuro "I am looking into it. Lord Mitsuhide disappeared around the time of my birth, almost twenty-five years ago to the day."
    kuro "我正在调查此事。光秀大人大约在我出生前后失踪，距今差不多二十五年了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19394
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_0ec2d18a:

    # kuro "It seems he was maybe not running away as much as protecting that boy..."
    kuro "看来他与其说是逃跑，不如说是保护那个男孩……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19396
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_a0cdd2d4:

    # you "And that boy was attacked by demons, and ended up blind."
    you "那个男孩遭到恶魔袭击，结果失明了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19398
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_4e1af203:

    # kuro "Indeed."
    kuro "的确。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19400
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b501ef27:

    # you "You think this boy may have a link to our killer?"
    you "你认为这个男孩可能与凶手有关吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19404
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_9421cc7b:

    # kuro "He'd be about my age now... So maybe he {i}is{/i} the killer."
    kuro "他现在应该和我年纪差不多了……所以他或许就是凶手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19406
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_e668fec3:

    # you "He was blind... That would be why he stole that mask..."
    you "他是个盲人……这或许就是他偷面具的原因……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19408
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_20721a4d:

    # you "But he had to get help."
    you "但他必须寻求帮助。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19413
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b79d3d9f:

    # you "I'm sorry for your loss."
    you "对于您的损失，我深表哀悼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19415
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_3b038d6f:

    # kuro "Yes, her death has weakened my hand significantly."
    kuro "是的，她的去世大大削弱了我的实力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19417
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_d8bd0ebe:

    # kuro "Nevertheless, I think her father's fate may yet shed some light on the motives behind these killings..."
    kuro "然而，我认为她父亲的遭遇或许能揭示这些谋杀案背后的动机……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19419
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_8b90d45f:

    # you "How so?"
    you "怎么说?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19421
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_1bc4e281:

    # kuro "I need to check up on some old rumors... But I will let you know as soon as I find something solid."
    kuro "我需要核实一些旧传闻……一旦找到确凿的消息，我会立即通知你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19429
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_67a65504:

    # kuro "Demons among the Knights, you say? I trust you, but this is stretching the limits of my gullibility..."
    kuro "你说骑士团里有恶魔？我相信你，但这未免也太离谱了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19431
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_20e42c56:

    # you "I know it's hard to believe, but I have seen them with my own eyes!"
    you "我知道这很难让人相信，但我确实亲眼见过！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19433
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_2131a950:

    # kuro "Curses. Why didn't Kenshin tell me anything about this?"
    kuro "该死。剑心为什么什么都没告诉我？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19435
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_4f4f0f89:

    # kuro "The Kingdom relies on knight for so many things. Probably too much."
    kuro "王国在很多方面都依赖骑士。或许依赖得太多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19437
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_e599ec7b:

    # kuro "It's high time we dealt with this weak spot..."
    kuro "我们早就应该解决这个薄弱环节了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19439
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_5a8b502c:

    # you "What are your intentions?"
    you "你的目的是什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19441
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_15008012:

    # kuro "I cannot divulge them for the moment. But if demons are indeed corrupting the knight orders, swift action will be needed to nip this conspiracy in the bud"
    kuro "我目前还不能透露详情。但如果恶魔真的在腐蚀骑士团，就必须迅速采取行动，将这场阴谋扼杀在萌芽状态。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19452
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_bc7f54d9:

    # kuro "This paints a clearer picture, doesn't it?"
    kuro "这样就更清楚了，不是吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19454
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_6b78c833:

    # you "A mysterious boy living in the wood..."
    you "一个住在森林里的神秘男孩……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19456
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_cf4e94ec:

    # kuro "He got blinded in an attack..."
    kuro "他在一次袭击中失明了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19458
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_864caab1:

    # you "Grew up into a man, then stole a mask to recover his eyesight..."
    you "长大成人后，他偷了一个面具来恢复视力……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19460
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_f9e633e7:

    # kuro "To enact his revenge against demons from the Knight orders."
    kuro "为了向骑士团中的恶魔复仇。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19462
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_0878be6f:

    # you "He must believe the entire Royal family is in cahoots with demons."
    you "他一定认为整个皇室家族都与恶魔勾结。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19464
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_80897cbd:

    # kuro "Preposterous! But I could see how he would believe that..."
    kuro "荒谬至极！但我能理解他为什么会这么想……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19468
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_6010c6d1:

    # kuro "There is a high chance that the masked killer and that blind boy are the same person."
    kuro "蒙面杀手和那个盲童很可能是同一个人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19470
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_151d5a17:

    # you "But why would he be after the Royals?"
    you "但他为什么要针对皇家队呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19472
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_af5588f9:

    # kuro "We have yet to discover why. Perhaps if we knew why Lord Mistuhide ran away from Zan one night to live in the forest..."
    kuro "我们至今仍未找到答案。或许，如果我们知道为什么御秀大人会在某个夜晚逃离赞恩，隐居于森林之中……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19476
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_bdbae21f:

    # you "These demons, are they the same that attacked the boy in the forest?"
    you "这些恶魔，是不是就是袭击森林里那个男孩的那些恶魔？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19478
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_67ee24cc:

    # kuro "Your guess is as good as mine."
    kuro "你的猜测和我的一样好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19480
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_bc17c006:

    # you "Could this boy be related to the murders?"
    you "这个男孩是否与谋杀案有关？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19482
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_feae94db:

    # kuro "But he was blinded in the attack. Our killer can see..."
    kuro "但他在袭击中失明了。我们的凶手却能看见……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19486
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b0a362ef:

    # you "A magical artifact getting stolen, demons among the knights... What is the link between these facts?"
    you "一件魔法神器被盗，骑士团中潜伏着恶魔……这些事件之间有什么联系？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19488
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_959cb0bb:

    # kuro "I have no idea."
    kuro "我不知道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19490
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_9e8de29c:

    # you "We still need to investigate further..."
    you "我们还需要进一步调查……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19494
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_16cc53ad:

    # you "I think I have exhausted all avenues of investigation for now."
    you "我觉得目前我已经用尽了所有调查途径。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19496
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_00159633:

    # kuro "We have no more lead, then."
    kuro "我们已经没有铅弹了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19498
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_8ba99029:

    # you "I'm afraid so."
    you "恐怕是这样。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19500
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_a36a6fa4:

    # kuro "I find a small measure of relief in that there hasn't been any high-profile murder in a while."
    kuro "让我稍感欣慰的是，最近一段时间没有发生什么引人注目的谋杀案。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19502
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_deb767b2:

    # kuro "But we would be fools to believe the masked killer is done here. He must be biding his time..."
    kuro "但如果我们以为蒙面杀手就此罢休，那就太愚蠢了。他肯定还在等待时机……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19504
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_68e663f2:

    # you "What can we do about it?"
    you "我们能做些什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19506
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_08710e0f:

    # kuro "I have a mind to lay down a trap for him."
    kuro "我打算设个陷阱捉住他。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19508
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_b453fb5b:

    # you "How?"
    you "怎么关?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19510
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_a3fedb86:

    # kuro "It is still early, but I have concepts of a plan."
    kuro "现在还为时尚早，但我已经有了计划的雏形。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19512
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_75f5ce9d:

    # kuro "I will send for you once the pieces are in place. In the meantime, we must be discreet."
    kuro "等一切就绪，我会派人来接你。在此期间，我们必须保持低调。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19514
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_c73ca0ae:

    # you "Of course, Your Majesty."
    you "当然，陛下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19516
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_76a9c6bb:

    # kuro "It is almost noon. Please attend the luncheon with me."
    kuro "快到中午了，请和我一起参加午餐会。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19522
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_ac89493c:

    # you "Well..." nointeract
    you "出色地..." nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19526
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_eab502ab:

    # "Your stomach thinks this is a good idea."
    "你的胃觉得这是个好主意。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19528
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_0a361bcb:

    # you "It would be my honor."
    you "将是我的荣幸。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19530
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_75aa4e43:

    # kuro "Don't be silly. These events are dreadful. But your presence will help."
    kuro "别傻了。这些事情确实很糟糕。但你的到来会有所帮助。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19534
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_511261e8:

    # "While the offer of free food is tempting, you find the atmosphere at court to be suffocating."
    "虽然免费食物很诱人，但你却发现法庭里的气氛令人窒息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19536
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_5725b24b:

    # you "Thank you for your offer, Your Majesty. But I have other business to tend to."
    you "谢谢您的好意，陛下。但我还有其他事情要处理。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19539
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_97144926:

    # kuro "I suppose you need to take care of your... business. I understand."
    kuro "我想你需要处理你的……事情。我明白。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19541
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_334f1b88:

    # kuro "Ah, yes, your little operation won't take care of itself. Of course."
    kuro "啊，是的，你的小手术可不会自己完成。当然了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19543
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_a92e132c:

    # "You see a glint of amusement in her eyes, but nervously dismiss it."
    "你看到她眼中闪过一丝玩味的笑意，但你紧张地把它忽略了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19545
translate chinese_simplified c3_palace_visit_menu_783ff731:

    # you "Goodbye, Princess."
    you "再见,公主殿下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19556
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_95d63155:

    # "The luncheon is in full swing when you enter the room. Who do you wish to join?"
    "你进门时，午餐会正进行得如火如荼。你想和谁一起用餐？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19564
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5360003c:

    # "The luncheon is near its, but you still have a little time to mingle. Who do you want to see now?" with fade
    "午餐会快开始了，但你还有一些时间可以和大家交流。你现在想见谁？" with fade

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19567
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_11fdb519:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19575
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_7d703644:

    # "Foreign courtier" "With all due rezpect, Your Grace, my fazer may be old, but he iz still spry. And you're a lady about to turn twenty-five, it iz not like you are, how you say... The spring chicken, yourself."
    "外国廷臣" "With all due rezpect, Your Grace, my fazer may be old, but he iz still spry. And you're a lady about to turn twenty-five, it iz not like you are, how you say... The spring chicken, yourself."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19577
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_967a16da:

    # "In spite of her usual coolness, you can see the princess going red in the face up, almost about to burst at the man's impertinence, until she spots you."
    "尽管公主平时一向冷静，但你可以看到她脸涨得通红，几乎要被这个男人的无礼激怒，直到她看到你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19579
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b817b241:

    # kuro "Oh! Sir [MC.name]! Excuse me, My Lord. Send your father my regards, but my answer is 'no'."
    kuro "哦！[MC.name]先生！打扰一下，大人。请代我向您父亲问好，但我的回答是“不”。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19581
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_271596eb:

    # "Ignoring the man's protests, the princess steps aside with you. You feel the sting of a dozen jealous stares."
    "公主不顾男人的反对，和你一起走到一边。你感到周围十几道嫉妒的目光刺痛着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19583
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d3e8ff05:

    # kuro "Back so soon? I'm beginning to think you enjoy my company..."
    kuro "这么快就回来了？我开始觉得你挺喜欢和我待在一起的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19589
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4aa7e20d:

    # you "Of course, Your Highness. Who wouldn't?"
    you "当然，殿下。谁不想呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19591
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_22a1d85e:

    # kuro "Oh, you charmer. But you should be careful what you say in here. Half these men are would-be suitors, and some are getting so impatient that I wouldn't put it past them to use violence against another pretender."
    kuro "哦，你真是个迷人的小妖精。不过你在这里说话要小心点。这里一半的男人都是想追求你的，有些人已经非常不耐烦了，说不定会对其他追求者动粗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19593
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f1003cbd:

    # you "I have faced worse dangers for lesser prizes."
    you "我曾冒过更大的危险，却只得到了更小的回报。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19596
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0fdd01fb:

    # kuro "Teeheehee, you amuse me [MC.name]."
    kuro "嘻嘻嘻，你真逗[MC.name]。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19601
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_73b265dd:

    # you "I'm only looking to discuss our mutual interests."
    you "我只是想探讨一下我们共同感兴趣的话题。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19603
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e9e92bcc:

    # kuro "Of course you are. As is everyone around me. Alas, this is the cruel fate of all rulers: we only exist in the eyes of others to advance their goals..."
    kuro "当然，你当然是。我周围的每个人也都是。唉，这就是所有统治者的残酷命运：我们存在的意义仅仅在于服务于他人，帮助他们实现目标……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19605
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_a304d8b2:

    # you "I didn't mean that..."
    you "我不是那个意思……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19607
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4fa59513:

    # kuro "I know, I jest. This whole mess has me on edge..."
    kuro "我知道，我是开玩笑。但这整件事让我很焦虑……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19609
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e0b2a16c:

    # you "By the way, how is this marriage intrigue shaping up?"
    you "对了，这场婚姻阴谋进展如何？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19611
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_240b908c:

    # kuro "Don't remind me. I have just about exhausted all my options to delay this woeful affair."
    kuro "别再提醒我了。我已经用尽了所有办法来拖延这件令人沮丧的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19613
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2834dddf:

    # kuro "It's just as well that my father is feeling ill, again. But once he gets back to his throne and remembers his duties, he will have to make a choice."
    kuro "我父亲再次生病，这倒也是一件好事。但等他重返王位，记起自己的职责后，他就必须做出选择。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19615
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_37b585cb:

    # you "Don't you get a say in it?"
    you "你难道没有发言权吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19617
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_9ca9389e:

    # kuro "Inasmuch as I can influence him, I will try to sway his opinion, but... He listens to his council of advisors more than he does me."
    kuro "只要我能影响他，我就会努力改变他的想法，但是……他更听取顾问们的意见，而不是我的意见。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19619
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4208a1b2:

    # kuro "They wouldn't stoop so low as to take a woman's opinion... Curse them and their stupid 'tradition'!"
    kuro "他们竟然不屑于听取女人的意见……真该诅咒他们和他们那愚蠢的“传统”！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19621
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_1a3e487e:

    # "Her anger piercing through her usually calm demeanor strikes you as out of character."
    "她平日里冷静沉着，此刻却怒火中烧，这让你觉得她一反常态。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19623
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2a6b762b:

    # you "My Lady?"
    you "夫人？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19625
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_51a03b61:

    # kuro "I'm sorry, it's just... This is a stressful time."
    kuro "对不起，只是……这段时间压力很大。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19627
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_c48fc977:

    # kuro "What do I need a husband for? It's just dead weight. The Kingdom doesn't need that. Not now."
    kuro "我需要丈夫干什么？他只会拖后腿。王国不需要他。现在不需要。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19629
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d471ec73:

    # kuro "Things would be so much simpler if women were allowed to rule."
    kuro "如果允许女性统治，事情会简单得多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19634
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d98dc30f:

    # you "You're right. You're a more capable ruler than anyone in this crowd."
    you "你说得对。你比在场的任何人都更有能力统治。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19636
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0f35a31a:

    # kuro "I am glad you see that."
    kuro "很高兴你也这么认为。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19638
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_73d8345a:

    # kuro "Whoever I marry will have to come around to the fact that {i}I{/i} will still be the one calling the shots."
    kuro "无论我嫁给谁，他都必须接受{i}I{/i}仍然是做决定的人这一事实。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19642
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_fc172b99:

    # you "Women, lead??? Preposterous!"
    you "女性领导？？？荒谬至极！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19644
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f935894a:

    # you "Your Highness, surely you can't mean that. You need a husband's steady hand to guide you, especially in these troubled times... There is only so much a woman can do."
    you "殿下，您肯定不是这个意思。您需要一位丈夫的稳健指引，尤其是在这动荡的时期……女人能做的毕竟有限。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19646
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_cbf84417:

    # "Her eyes dart daggers at you."
    "她目光如炬地盯着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19648
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2fb4bbb9:

    # kuro "Your opinion is noted. Not that I haven't heard it voiced a hundred times before."
    kuro "你的意见我已记录在案。不过，这种说法我以前已经听过无数遍了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19650
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3058eab6:

    # kuro "Look, I need to get back to my guests. I'll be in touch, for the next phase of our plan."
    kuro "好了，我得回去招待客人了。下一步计划我会再联系你们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19658
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_ef8b7f63:

    # "A group of knights and men-at-arms are brooding in a corner, closed faced with their arms folded. You hover just near enough to overhear their conversation."
    "一群骑士和卫兵蜷缩在角落里，双臂交叉抱在胸前，面无表情地沉思着。你悄悄地靠近，正好能听到他们的谈话。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19675
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6d25bd23:

    # initiate "...with Lady Kenshin gone, who's even going to be in charge?"
    initiate "……剑心夫人去世后，谁来掌权呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19677
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_cff7a68b:

    # knight "Lord Kayen stepped up, but most orders have yet to recognize his authority."
    knight "凯恩大人挺身而出，但大多数部下尚未承认他的权威。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19679
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5f509935:

    # initiate "The old man is out of his depth. He doesn't have what it takes to lead."
    initiate "这位老人能力不足，他没有领导才能。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19681
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b34fcad5:

    # knight "Then who? Every over half-capable officer is off to the warfront anyway."
    knight "那谁来？反正所有能力超过一半的军官都被派往前线了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19683
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_392f8664:

    # hound_knight "Why would we even need someone in charge?"
    hound_knight "我们为什么需要负责人呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19685
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_55128ebb:

    # initiate "What do you mean?"
    initiate "你是什么意思?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19687
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_a25abfca:

    # hound_knight "This idea of grouping the Knight orders under a single banner was always at odds with what our vows. An attempt by the Crown to control us."
    hound_knight "将各个骑士团统一在同一面旗帜下的想法，始终与我们的誓言相悖。这是王室企图控制我们的伎俩。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19689
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_1cb860f8:

    # hound_knight "The truth is that we all have our own beliefs and purpose, and it shouldn't be shameful to admit it would be best to preserve our independence from political intervention."
    hound_knight "事实上，我们每个人都有自己的信仰和目标，承认最好保持独立性，免受政治干预，这不应该是一件丢脸的事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19691
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_17d854e3:

    # guard "'Tis dangerous talk, Sir Knight..."
    guard "骑士爵士，这话说得危险……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19693
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4ea4694e:

    # hound_knight "Is that so? *eyes narrow*"
    hound_knight "真是这样吗？（眯起眼睛）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19695
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e8a0e544:

    # guard "No offense, but I heard the higher-ups are discussing ditching the knights as their main forces, in favor of a citizens' army..."
    guard "无意冒犯，但我听说高层正在讨论放弃骑士团作为主力部队，转而组建公民军队……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19697
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2e78b610:

    # hound_knight "An' I heard your mother laid with boars, yet I wouldn't believe it until I saw your face!"
    hound_knight "我听说你母亲与野猪同寝，但我直到亲眼见到你才相信！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19699
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_12db8f8a:

    # "The knights burst in laughter."
    "骑士们哄堂大笑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19701
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_145261d5:

    # initiate "A 'citizens' army'? It's ridiculous. No army could fare well on the battlefield without officers of noble blood to command it."
    initiate "“公民军队”？简直荒谬。没有贵族出身的军官指挥，任何军队都无法在战场上取得胜利。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19703
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f16e2634:

    # knight "Of course. And what noble would want to lead an army of commoners? Men-at-arms like you may be good against weak savages like the Elves, but against a real army? Maybe as a first wave to soften 'em up, but then you'd need real knights!"
    knight "当然。哪个贵族会想率领一支平民军队？像你这样的步兵或许能对付精灵这种弱小的野蛮人，但对付真正的军队？或许可以作为第一波攻击，削弱他们的实力，但之后你就需要真正的骑士了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19705
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_aca08468:

    # guard "And what good is besting an army on the battlefield when the real enemy is within? The King has enough viper nests to snuff out in this very city."
    guard "即便在战场上击败了敌军，真正的敌人却在内部，这又有什么用呢？国王在这座城市里就藏着足够多的毒蛇窝，必须统统铲除。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19707
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_289db889:

    # guard "Maybe cunning is called for now more than brute force..."
    guard "或许现在更需要的是计谋，而不是蛮力……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19709
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_ae8e5e33:

    # knight "And you think the likes of you are more cunning than us knights?"
    knight "你以为你们这种人比我们骑士更狡猾吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19711
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_edb2d3ba:

    # guard "Well, I'm not the one who's blind to the obvious signs that the Crown is turning sour on you knights... It would help if your Commander had not gotten herself assassinated while abandoning her post."
    guard "嗯，我并非对王室对你们骑士们日益冷落的明显迹象视而不见……如果你们的指挥官没有在擅离职守时被刺杀，情况或许会好一些。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19713
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_8caa9949:

    # knight "Who said that? Lies!"
    knight "谁说的？胡说八道！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19715
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_c5eb6e48:

    # hound_knight "More idle gossip. Just ignore it."
    hound_knight "又是些无聊的闲言碎语，别理它。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19717
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e8c14a76:

    # knight "But it is what people are saying, isn't it? It makes us look incompetent..."
    knight "但人们就是这么说的，不是吗？这让我们看起来很无能……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19719
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6e26c479:

    # initiate "Could they truly be aiming to replace knights?"
    initiate "他们真的打算取代骑士吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19721
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d13f2ff5:

    # hound_knight "Fear not, my friend. We are not so easily replaceable. I'd wager we'll outlive the King, yet."
    hound_knight "别担心，我的朋友。我们没那么容易被取代。我敢打赌，我们会比国王活得更久。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19723
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_9b60ce33:

    # knight "Hush brother, do not voice such thoughts out loud, are you mad?"
    knight "嘘，兄弟，别把这种想法说出口，你疯了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19725
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_1e3c7057:

    # "The soldiers start talking in hushed tones, looking around suspiciously. You rush back to the buffet before they find your behavior suspicious."
    "士兵们开始低声交谈，警惕地四处张望。你赶紧跑回自助餐区，免得他们发现你的举动可疑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19731
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_bce82325:

    # "You find Kenshin brooding in a corner, watching the assembly with distrust."
    "你发现剑心独自一人待在角落里，若有所思地看着众人，眼中充满了不信任。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19735
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f53da18d:

    # "She lightens up slightly as she sees you, though."
    "不过，她看到你之后，心情稍微好了一些。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19737
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b5c09557:

    # kenshin "[MC.name]? I didn't know you'd be here."
    kenshin "[MC.name]？我不知道你会在这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19739
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6a3c8343:

    # you "Yes, Princess Kurohime asked me to be here."
    you "是的，黑姬公主让我来这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19741
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2c5c8ff0:

    # "She grasps the situation quickly."
    "她很快就掌握了情况。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19743
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2ae84082:

    # kenshin "So the Princess had a security meeting with you then... And she didn't send for me."
    kenshin "所以公主当时和你开了一次安全会议……但她没有叫我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19745
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_21d9e99e:

    # "Shes doesn't make it sound like a reproach, but her disappointment is visible."
    "她的语气听起来不像是在责备，但她的失望之情溢于言表。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19747
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0defddfb:

    # kenshin "Well, I believe thanks are in order. You finally rid the city of these assassins..."
    kenshin "嗯，我觉得应该道谢。你终于把这些刺客从这座城市里清除出去了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19750
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6fed3b78:

    # kenshin "...and for saving me, as well."
    kenshin "……也感谢你救了我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19754
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_65109870:

    # you "How are you holding up?"
    you "你还好吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19756
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3c7e9ca9:

    # kenshin "I have a lot on my mind, but... I'd be lying if I said my family's history didn't weigh heavily on me."
    kenshin "我有很多心事，但是……如果我说家族史没有给我带来沉重的压力，那我就在撒谎了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19758
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f1632394:

    # you "Is there anything I can do?"
    you "我能做些什么吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19760
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_cc630233:

    # kenshin "No, [MC.name], thank you. You have done plenty already. This I need to come to terms with by myself."
    kenshin "不，[MC.name]，谢谢你。你已经做了很多了。这件事我需要自己慢慢接受。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19762
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_97b4f562:

    # kenshin "And the Royal family is still in danger. This is what we need to focus on."
    kenshin "王室成员仍然身处险境。这才是我们应该关注的重点。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19764
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_44803783:

    # you "What else can we do to keep the Princess safe?"
    you "为了保护公主的安全，我们还能做些什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19766
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b0629ae8:

    # kenshin "The masked murderer is still loose, so we need to catch him."
    kenshin "蒙面凶手仍然逍遥法外，我们必须抓住他。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19768
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4dbc2627:

    # you "The Princess says she has a plan. Know anything about it?"
    you "公主说她有个计划。你知道是什么计划吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19770
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b9ef037c:

    # kenshin "A plan? I-I'm not sure..."
    kenshin "计划？我不太确定……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19772
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_56c3f9b6:

    # you "I thought you'd know. It's strange that she didn't confide in you."
    you "我以为你会知道。真奇怪，她竟然没跟你说。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19774
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_13c86f29:

    # kenshin "S-Strange, indeed..."
    kenshin "真是奇怪……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19776
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_4ee4e720:

    # "Kenshin seems preoccupied by your words, and promptly excuses herself."
    "剑心似乎被你的话所吸引，随即找了个借口离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19782
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d3a60041:

    # "There are somewhat less courtiers around than last time, and you wonder if it is a sign that the Crown's influence is waning. Still, enough conversations are going on by the drinks' table that you manage to inconspicuously blend in."
    "与上次相比，周围的朝臣少了一些，你不禁怀疑这是否意味着王室的影响力正在减弱。不过，酒桌旁的谈话声此起彼伏，你得以低调地融入其中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19784
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_2ffae796:

    # "Baron" "If my ears serve me right, then she will marry her first cousin from Zerga."
    "男爵" "如果我没听错的话，她将嫁给她在泽尔加的表兄。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19786
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_aa074d3c:

    # "Countess" "Abomination! From Zerga? That foreign cesspit?"
    "伯爵夫人" "怪物！来自泽尔加？那个外国粪坑？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19788
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_8b45f7f1:

    # "Count" "I'm afraid you are misled. She will marry a widower from an old Zanite house."
    "数数" "恐怕你被误导了。她会嫁给一个来自古老赞尼特家族的鳏夫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19790
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3b5b829d:

    # "Baron" "And who told you that?"
    "男爵" "谁告诉你的？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19792
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e44cfe71:

    # "Count" "A source of impeccable reliability."
    "数数" "绝对可靠的来源。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19794
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_806ea27d:

    # "Baron" "And which is that?"
    "男爵" "那是什么呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19796
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0db1164a:

    # "Count" "*sigh* Fine, if you must know: the maid of the stepbrother of the King's stable groom's own roommate told me."
    "数数" "*叹气* 好吧，既然你非要知道：国王马厩侍卫的继兄的室友的女仆告诉我的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19798
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_8788f603:

    # "Baron" "Ha! Drivel."
    "男爵" "哈！胡说八道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19800
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_e19a19cb:

    # "Countess" "A maid? What were you doing with a maid? *raised eyebrow*"
    "伯爵夫人" "女仆？你和女仆在一起干什么？（挑眉）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19802
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_421932f6:

    # "Viscount" "Gentlemen, if you please, I believe both your tales have it wrong."
    "子爵" "先生们，恕我直言，我认为你们俩的说法都有误。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19804
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_7ece9abd:

    # "Baron" "Oh? Have you the truth wrapped in ribbons, Viscount?"
    "男爵" "哦？子爵，你把真相用丝带包起来了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19806
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_cc130161:

    # "Viscount" "The news I have will shock you, and make your wigs curl. Do you want to know more?"
    "子爵" "我带来的消息会让你大吃一惊，吓得你假发都卷了。你想知道更多吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19808
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_47d0c917:

    # "Count" "We sure do, Lord Cliquebate."
    "数数" "当然，克利克巴特大人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19810
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_122b1299:

    # "Viscount" "The Princess will marry not for blood, but for treasure. The King's coffers are bare from the War."
    "子爵" "公主并非因血缘关系而嫁，而是为了财富。国王的国库因战争而空虚。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19812
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_f909c631:

    # "Baron" "Naturally. No one thought she'd marry a pauper of an aristocrat. You think Lord Kosmo..."
    "男爵" "当然了。谁也没想到她会嫁给一个贵族的穷光蛋。你觉得科斯莫勋爵……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19814
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_9dde2067:

    # "Viscount" "No, here's the thing: she is not to wed an aristocrat. She's going to marry the richest guild master, the Head of the slave traders!"
    "子爵" "不，事情是这样的：她不会嫁给贵族。她要嫁给最富有的行会会长，奴隶贩子的头目！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19816
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_8d46334f:

    # "Countess" "A commoner {i}and{/i} a foreigner? Blessed Arios, take pity on us!"
    "伯爵夫人" "一个平民和一个外国人？蒙福的阿里奥斯，可怜我们吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19818
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_07e29e21:

    # "Count" "A commoner? Madness!"
    "数数" "一个平民？疯了吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19820
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3af834c0:

    # "Baron" "*scoff* No amount of coin is worth soiling your bloodline for all eternity..."
    "男爵" "嗤之以鼻……再多的金钱也比不上永远玷污你的血脉……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19822
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_a4b97c02:

    # "Viscount" "Don't pretend you haven't noticed: as Zan grows, the bourgeoisie is wielding more and more power by the day... Gold trumps blood at every turn. And the wealth of the richest commoner families in Zan has overpassed our own, while we fritter away fortunes on frivolities."
    "子爵" "别装作没注意到：随着赞恩的扩张，资产阶级的权力与日俱增……金钱凌驾于鲜血之上。赞恩最富有的平民家庭的财富已经超过了我们，而我们却把巨额财富挥霍在无谓的享乐上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19824
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0da8bb8d:

    # "Viscount" "Take all this talk about the League..."
    "子爵" "把所有关于联盟的讨论都说一遍……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19826
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_05555a6f:

    # "Countess" "The league? Which league?"
    "伯爵夫人" "哪个联赛？哪个联赛？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19828
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_c70fcdc2:

    # "Count" "Ha, the so-called 'League of Freethinkers'! Ignore it, my dear, it's a fable for the weak-willed..."
    "数数" "哈，所谓的“自由思想家联盟”！别理它，亲爱的，那不过是给意志薄弱的人编造的寓言故事罢了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19830
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_87799392:

    # "Countess" "Freethinkers? Are they a cult?"
    "伯爵夫人" "自由思想者？他们是邪教吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19832
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0e25cd65:

    # "Viscount" "No, my Lady. They're philosophers, inventors and entrepreneurs, noble-born and commoners alike, pooling their resources to advance human knowledge. They are behind some of the most groundbreaking discoveries in the past decade..."
    "子爵" "不，夫人。他们是哲学家、发明家和企业家，既有贵族出身，也有平民百姓，他们汇聚资源，共同推进人类知识的进步。过去十年中一些最具突破性的发现都出自他们之手……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19834
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_eb4ec767:

    # "Baron" "Rubbish. Should we be shaking in our boots because of a bunch of scholars? Children who believe in 'Science'?"
    "男爵" "胡说八道。难道我们要因为一群学者、一群相信“科学”的孩子就吓得魂飞魄散吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19836
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_bfecbe32:

    # "Countess" "What's this 'science' you speak of? Is it like... magic?"
    "伯爵夫人" "你说的这个“科学”是什么？它像……魔法吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19838
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_bae9396c:

    # "Count" "No, my dear, it's nothing as grounded as magic. Science is the belief that nature follows certain immutable laws that can be discovered and used by anyone - without any special talent whatsoever! *laugh*"
    "数数" "不，亲爱的，它跟魔法完全不一样。科学是一种信念，它相信自然遵循某些不变的规律，任何人都可以发现并运用这些规律——根本不需要任何特殊才能！*笑*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19840
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_0e7d5539:

    # "Countess" "Heavens! These vulgar superstitions get worse by the day. Next, they'll claim the sun rises in the East not because Arios wills it!"
    "伯爵夫人" "天哪！这些庸俗的迷信真是越来越离谱了。下一步，他们是不是要说太阳从东方升起不是因为阿里奥斯的意愿？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19842
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_cfd14671:

    # "Viscount" "Call them what you will, but they're rolling in gold. Most influential commoners in the city are members, or so I'm told. And not an insignificant number of young nobles, too."
    "子爵" "随你怎么称呼他们，反正他们富得流油。据说，城里大多数有影响力的平民都是他们的成员。而且，不少年轻贵族也是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19844
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6fd5d54f:

    # "Baron" "And this slavemaster of yours is among them?"
    "男爵" "而你的这位奴隶主也在其中？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19846
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_b5574bf9:

    # "Viscount" "Hard to say. I heard they have taken a dim view of slavery, among other institutions they call 'outmoded'."
    "子爵" "很难说。我听说他们对奴隶制以及其他一些他们认为“过时”的制度持否定态度。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19848
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_883cfb74:

    # "Countess" "They even oppose slavery? Good Arios! What is the world coming to!"
    "伯爵夫人" "他们甚至反对奴隶制？好样的，阿里奥斯！这世界到底是怎么了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19850
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_55eb5658:

    # "Count" "It's as puzzling to you as it is to me, dear."
    "数数" "亲爱的，这件事对你我来说也同样令人费解。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19852
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5bde2e31:

    # "Viscount" "They believe that 'all men and women ought to be free'. Their words, not mine."
    "子爵" "他们认为“所有男女都应该享有自由”。这是他们的说法，不是我的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19854
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_105d1592:

    # "Baron" "Women too? May the Sun God scorch my arse if..."
    "男爵" "女人也一样？如果真是这样，愿太阳神灼伤我的屁股……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19856
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_75f68503:

    # "Countess" "Language, Baron!"
    "伯爵夫人" "注意措辞，男爵！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19858
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_475b66a7:

    # "Count" "Viscount, you spin a good tale, but I don't believe for a moment King Pharo will choose a commoner, and turn all the nobility against him."
    "数数" "子爵，你讲的故事很精彩，但我一点也不相信法老王会选择一个平民，并让所有贵族都与他为敌。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19860
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_90f77186:

    # "Baron" "He'd best not, if He knows what's good for Him..."
    "男爵" "如果祂知道什么对祂好，祂最好还是不要这样做……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19862
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_aed38770:

    # "Count" "You know where I stand on that..."
    "数数" "你知道我对这件事的立场……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19864
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_d42efab6:

    # "Countess" "Enough! I have heard enough nonsense for the day. I'm going home. *indignant*"
    "伯爵夫人" "够了！今天我已经听够了胡说八道。我要回家了。*愤愤不平*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19866
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3df8f26e:

    # "Countess" "And {b}you{/b} had best explain why you consort with a groom's roommate's stepbrother's maid!"
    "伯爵夫人" "你最好解释一下，你为什么会和新郎室友的继兄的女仆来往！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19868
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_bb84e872:

    # "Moving away from the table, you leave the noble couple to their bickering."
    "你离开餐桌，留下这对贵族夫妇继续争吵。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19875
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_efd04f65:

    # "Most of the gentry is busy stuffing their faces, so some of the staffers are taking a break, loitering by the kitchen stairs and chewing something that smells suspiciously like spice."
    "大部分绅士淑女都在狼吞虎咽地吃着东西，所以一些工作人员趁机休息一下，在厨房楼梯旁闲逛，嚼着闻起来很像香料的东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19877
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_05fa140d:

    # "Housemaid" "I tells ya, He's not well."
    "保姆" "我跟你说，他身体不太好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19879
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_96e4eda8:

    # "Squire" "Bah, woman! It's probably just another bout of gout. He's had more comebacks than a minstrel."
    "乡绅" "呸，女人！估计又是痛风发作了。他复出的次数比吟游诗人还多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19881
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5bef0cbb:

    # "Manservant" "But it's true, innit? No one but the Princess is allowed to talk to Him. I can't even go in there to change the chamberpot without a guard, and he's always in bed, just out of sight."
    "男仆" "但这是真的，不是吗？除了公主，谁都不能跟他说话。我连进去换个便壶都得有卫兵陪同，而且他总是躺在床上，就在视线之外。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19883
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5f5cc134:

    # "Manservant" "If I didn't hear his wheezy breathing, I'd think the bugger was already dead!"
    "男仆" "如果我没听到他喘息的声音，我真会以为这家伙已经死了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19885
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_03079434:

    # "Housemaid" "Arios *sun sign*! Ye can't speak ill of His Majesty..."
    "保姆" "白羊座！你们不能说陛下的坏话……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19887
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_41d36c33:

    # "Manservant" "Oh, come off it. I don't think he'll make it even to the Princess's birthday. He's going to croak, and ye know it."
    "男仆" "别开玩笑了。我觉得他连公主的生日都活不到。他肯定活不到那时候，你心里也清楚。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19889
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_be83c1f7:

    # "Squire" "Aren't we all? He survived the long march across the Arik mountains as he was wounded and hunted in his rebel days. Even as King, he's been ailing for years. And the old boy's still kicking."
    "乡绅" "我们不都是如此吗？他当年叛乱时身负重伤，遭到追捕，却依然活着穿越了阿里克山脉的漫长征程。即使当了国王，他也已经病了好几年。可这老家伙现在依然精神矍铄。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19891
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_6ff1909c:

    # "Housemaid" "Aye, but He looks like a ghost of His former self. What's happened to Him?"
    "保姆" "是啊，但他看起来就像昔日荣光的幻影。他到底怎么了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19893
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_01f11940:

    # "Squire" "Too many excesses I hear. Food, wine, spices... And far too many women."
    "乡绅" "我听说这里有很多过度消费。食物、酒、香料……还有太多女人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19895
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_ec1bc508:

    # "Manservant" "Womin, eh? Does the old prick score a lot?"
    "男仆" "女人啊？那老家伙很会泡妞吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19897
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_3d45705a:

    # "Housemaid" "Hush, Arios, you're going to have us flogged!"
    "保姆" "嘘，艾瑞斯，你要下令鞭打我们！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19899
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_47f49207:

    # "Manservant" "Maybe he got syphilis. A mate of mine got it after shagging some whore in Borgo. Ain't pretty."
    "男仆" "他可能得了梅毒。我有个哥们儿在博尔戈嫖了个妓女之后就得了梅毒。那可真够惨的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19901
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_5d12d257:

    # "Squire" "I hear He's still got a lover or three tucked away. The Princess doesn't like it, but she turns a blind eye."
    "乡绅" "我听说他还有一两个情人瞒着我。公主对此很不高兴，但她睁一只眼闭一只眼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19903
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_12780160:

    # "Squire" "Though if I were his age, I'd take it slow... He did look exhausted recently."
    "乡绅" "不过如果我是他那个年纪，我会慢慢来……他最近看起来确实很疲惫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19905
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_8da5af03:

    # "Housemaid" "He did, and now, no one has seen Him in like... Two weeks?"
    "保姆" "他确实这么做了，现在，大概两周以来都没人见过他了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19907
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_da397c94:

    # "Squire" "He'll get through. Mark my words, the old warhorse isn't missing his daughter's birthday, or wedding."
    "乡绅" "他会挺过去的。我敢肯定，这匹老战马绝不会错过女儿的生日或婚礼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19909
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_c7d9e7d9:

    # "Manservant" "We'll see. By the way, d'ye still know that hedge witch what brews a cure for syphilis? Asking for a friend..."
    "男仆" "走着瞧。对了，你还认识那个会熬制梅毒药的乡野女巫吗？替朋友问的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19911
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_892ae63a:

    # "As whatever it is they're perusing takes hold, their voices blur into incoherence. You lose interest, and head to the kitchen for more stew."
    "他们看得入了迷，说话的声音也变得含糊不清。你失去了兴趣，转身去厨房再炖点东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19917
translate chinese_simplified c3_luncheon_10bf29c3:

    # "The luncheon is finally winding down, and the princess has already left. You find your way back to the carriage with minimal help from the staff. You are becoming a regular."
    "午宴终于接近尾声，公主已经离开。你几乎没怎么费力就找到了回马车的路。你渐渐成了这里的常客。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19933
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_85a6ae86:

    # "Homura came to visit you today."
    "焰今天来看你了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19937
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_32fa243a:

    # "She gives you a long, shameless kiss as soon as she sees you, hugging you tighter than usual."
    "她一见到你就毫不掩饰地给你一个长长的吻，并且比平时更紧紧地拥抱你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19939
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_20b364c3:

    # homura blush "It hasn't been that long, but... I've missed you, [MC.name]."
    homura blush "虽然时间不长，但是……我很想念你，[MC.name]。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19943
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_75e6f6f7:

    # "She hugs you shyly, giving you a smile."
    "她害羞地拥抱你，并对你微笑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19945
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_c411e3ed:

    # homura "Hi, [MC.name]. It's good to see you."
    homura "你好，[MC.name]。很高兴见到你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19949
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_02d78eb7:

    # "She stands there awkwardly, not sure if she should be seen with you in public."
    "她尴尬地站在那里，不确定是否应该和你一起出现在公共场合。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19951
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_856d1057:

    # homura "Hello, [MC.name]. Can I, uh, some in?"
    homura "你好，[MC.name]。我可以……呃……加入吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19953
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_697f5d9b:

    # "You invite Homura to step in, ordering Sill to fetch her a nice cup of tea."
    "你邀请焰进来帮忙，命令希尔给她泡杯好茶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19955
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_e4929c0c:

    # homura "Thank you, your... slave makes a nice cup of tea."
    homura "谢谢，你的……奴隶泡了一杯好茶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19957
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_b58cadaf:

    # homura "Where did you find that girl? I must say, she seems like a proper lady."
    homura "你在哪儿找到那个女孩的？我得说，她看起来像个端庄的淑女。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19959
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_5ede9da7:

    # "In the corner of your eye, you catch Sill lingering on the treshhold, but answer nonetheless."
    "你眼角瞥见希尔在门槛上徘徊，但还是回答了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19963
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_062205f4:

    # you "Yes, Sill is from a family of means. I bought her when her parents were hit by misfortune."
    you "是的，希尔家境富裕。她的父母遭遇不幸后，我买下了她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19965
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_fd20b9fe:

    # you "It's a shame it had to come to that, but I try to give her a good home."
    you "很遗憾事情发展到这一步，但我会尽力给她一个好归宿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19970
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_b82ee005:

    # "Sill finally leaves the room, but you detect a spring in her step."
    "希尔最终离开了房间，但你却能感觉到她步伐轻快。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19972
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_df46cc3e:

    # homura "It's nice of you. I don't think all slave owners are this generous."
    homura "你真好。我觉得并非所有奴隶主都这么慷慨。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19976
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_5e2c0f1a:

    # you "No, she's just your regular whore. She looks proper, but believe me, under the sheets..."
    you "不，她不过是个普通的妓女。她外表端庄，但相信我，脱下床……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19980
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_c7f6bfd3:

    # homura blush "I-I didn't ask for that! Please, don't say anymore!"
    homura blush "我没要求那样！请不要再说了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19982
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_f762d27d:

    # "Sill finally leaves the room, her face livid."
    "希尔最终离开了房间，脸色铁青。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19986
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_7e4449d7:

    # you "Oh, she may have been, I don't know. It's not good to dwell on the past in this life."
    you "哦，她也许是吧，我不知道。人生在世，沉湎过去并不好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19988
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_d14d644a:

    # "Sill leaves the room, sighing faintly."
    "希尔轻轻叹了口气，离开了房间。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19992
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_bf5e5e13:

    # homura sad "Wait, don't you care about the women you brought in? They're people too, you know."
    homura sad "等等，你难道不在乎你带来的那些女人吗？她们也是人啊，你知道吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19994
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_956caa07:

    # you "I do, I try, but they are many, you know... It's hard to keep track."
    you "我确实想，也尽量想，但是数量太多了，你知道……很难记住。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:19997
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_a4c88bb3:

    # homura normal "Anyway, are you and her... You know..."
    homura normal "总之，你和她……你知道的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20001
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_717dac00:

    # you "Are we having sex, you mean?"
    you "你是说我们是在做爱吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20005
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_58017dd7:

    # you "'Special friends', like you and me?"
    you "像你我这样的“特别的朋友”？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20008
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_4fd4ff22:

    # you "Are you asking if we're dating?"
    you "你是问我们是不是在约会吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20010
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_87d7c891:

    # homura blush "Y-Yes..."
    homura blush "是的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20014
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_143825f5:

    # you "We are."
    you "我们是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20016
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_bd8cacd4:

    # homura "Oh... I should have expected it, of course."
    homura "哦……我当然应该预料到的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20018
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_f56d5a0c:

    # you "But it doesn't change how I feel about you."
    you "但这并不会改变我对你的感觉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20024
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_57817d45:

    # homura "I guess..."
    homura "我想……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20026
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_d29580c1:

    # "Even though she puts on a straight face, she still sounds disappointed by your answer."
    "尽管她面无表情，但听起来还是对你的回答感到失望。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20028
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_d58d56b2:

    # homura "I see."
    homura "我明白了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20031
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_21cd237e:

    # you "Oh no, we're not."
    you "哦不，我们不是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20033
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_1315e819:

    # "You hear Sill audibly clear her throat from way back inside the kitchen."
    "你听到希尔从厨房深处传来清晰的清嗓声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20035
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_c0c587b6:

    # homura "Really?"
    homura "真的吗?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20037
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_451e1fc6:

    # "She gives you a skeptical look."
    "她用怀疑的眼神看着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20041
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_f877acab:

    # homura "Okay... I guess I'm relieved to hear that. *blush*"
    homura "好吧……听到这个消息我松了口气。*脸红*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20044
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_3f8484b3:

    # homura sad "Oh, come on... Don't take me for a fool."
    homura sad "哦，拜托……别把我当傻子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20046
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_20f64f0e:

    # "She doesn't believe you."
    "她不相信你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20050
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_91886191:

    # homura normal "Anyway, will you come next Saturday?"
    homura normal "总之，你下周六会来吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20052
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_f76b2dc9:

    # you "Next Saturday? What? Where?"
    you "下周六？什么？在哪儿？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20054
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_3aecd8e1:

    # homura "You know, of course. To Kurohime's birthday party."
    homura "当然了。去参加黑姬的生日派对。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20056
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_0c7d0306:

    # you "What, it's her birthday already? I didn't know."
    you "什么？今天是她的生日？我不知道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20058
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_ac7ead86:

    # homura "We're throwing her a surprise party, all of her close friends will be there!"
    homura "我们将为她举办一个惊喜派对，她所有的好朋友都会到场！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20060
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_44387bd6:

    # homura "Most people don't know you, so maybe that's why you weren't invited. But you can come anyway, just say you're with me."
    homura "大多数人都不认识你，所以也许这就是你没被邀请的原因。不过你还是可以来，就说你是跟我一起来的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20062
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_ea07f9ef:

    # you "I don't know... Would it be proper for someone like me to attend her party?"
    you "我不知道……像我这样的人去参加她的派对合适吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20066
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_f44eab5e:

    # homura "Of course it would. You're nobility too, after all. And you'll be with me, Her Majesty's best friend!"
    homura "当然会。毕竟你也是贵族。而且你还会和我在一起，成为女王陛下最好的朋友！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20070
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_ea742307:

    # homura "Normally not, commoners are not typically invited to such events, but I'll be vouching for you. And I'm sure Kurohime would love to have you."
    homura "通常情况下，平民百姓一般不会被邀请参加这类活动，但我可以为你担保。而且我相信黑姬一定会非常欢迎你的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20072
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_3918500b:

    # homura "Oh, come on, it will be fun!"
    homura "哦，拜托，这会很有趣的！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20074
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_b05eaf40:

    # you "Well, okay... Do we meet at the Palace?"
    you "好吧……我们在宫殿见面吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20076
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_4c699f55:

    # homura "No, it's a surprise party, I told you. We're invited to a grand mansion in the upper city. Don't worry, it will be truly fit for a Queen."
    homura "不，我说过了，是个惊喜派对。我们受邀去上城区的一座豪宅。别担心，那绝对会是女王般的享受。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20078
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_37fa9195:

    # homura "And who knows, maybe we'll finally learn who the princess is going to marry! You have to come!"
    homura "说不定我们最终会知道公主要嫁给谁呢！你一定要来！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20080
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_d8d8a9ca:

    # you "Who she's going to marry? Is it already decided?"
    you "她要嫁给谁？已经决定了吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20082
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_9dc58c0c:

    # homura "Hahaha, you're curious aren't you? Meet me at the mansion on Saturday. I'll send a carriage for you."
    homura "哈哈，你很好奇吧？星期六来庄园找我，我会派马车来接你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20084
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_invitation_e6fa0cdd:

    # you "Okay..."
    you "好吧..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20106
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_c475c89f:

    # "It's time for the princess's birthday party. As promised, Homura has sent for you."
    "公主的生日宴会到了。正如之前承诺的，焰已经派人来找你了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20108
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_1f74d22b:

    # you "Strange... I feel like I have seen this carriage before."
    you "奇怪……我感觉以前见过这辆马车。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20110
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_5643b7dd:

    # you "Oh, that's right! It's the carriage that picked me up on the first day I was summoned to the Palace."
    you "哦，对！这就是我被召入宫廷第一天来接我的那辆马车。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20112
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_674e234b:

    # you "The day this strange investigation began..."
    you "这场离奇调查开始的那一天……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20119
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_d8b4b2de:

    # "As the carriage drives uphill towards the noble quarters, you reflect on all that has happened since."
    "马车缓缓驶向贵族府邸，你回想起这段时间以来发生的一切。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20121
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_c4dddc57:

    # you "I had to hunt not one, but three dangerous Kunoichi... It's a miracle I made it out alive."
    you "我必须追捕的不是一个，而是三个危险的女忍者……我能活着回来简直是个奇迹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20123
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_7c96a730:

    # you "In spite of all of this, I still feel like I'm no closer to catching the real killer. It's infuriating."
    you "尽管如此，我感觉离抓到真凶仍然遥遥无期。这真令人恼火。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20125
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_55d37f23:

    # you "It's as if the masked murderer is leading me on a wild goose chase..."
    you "感觉就像那个蒙面杀手在耍我，让我白跑一趟……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20129
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_2cd00656:

    # "The carriage turns into Pilgrim's Road."
    "马车驶入朝圣者之路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20131
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_7686d40b:

    # you "And then, there's Homura..."
    you "然后，还有焰……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20133
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_8e80e355:

    # "You think about the noble girl and the role she's played in your life recently."
    "你想起了那位高贵的姑娘，以及她最近在你生活中扮演的角色。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20139
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_c65e84ad:

    # you "I think I'm quite smitten with the girl."
    you "我觉得我有点迷上这个女孩了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20141
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_d0648165:

    # "You are surprised to hear yourself say this out loud."
    "你惊讶地发现自己竟然把这些话说了出来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20143
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_53c2066c:

    # you "She's a strong woman, but she has a vulnerable side. She really opened herself to me."
    you "她是个坚强的女人，但她也有脆弱的一面。她对我敞开了心扉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20145
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_664e3a21:

    # you "I should tread around her feelings carefully. She deserves to be treated well."
    you "我应该小心翼翼地顾及她的感受。她值得被好好对待。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20151
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_e50fdd9e:

    # you "It's nice to fuck her and everything, but I can't really get bogged down with a relationship at the moment."
    you "和她上床当然很爽，但我现在真的不想陷入一段感情关系。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20153
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_5d13be43:

    # you "I simply have too much on my plate. But I guess we can remain 'friends'. I can use the relief."
    you "我实在是太忙了。不过我想我们还是可以继续做“朋友”的。我正需要这种解脱。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20159
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_e4be02bf:

    # you "There's something off about her, I'm sure."
    you "我确信她有些不对劲。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20161
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_b12c9900:

    # you "I'm not letting my guard down until I know what her deal is."
    you "在弄清楚她的真实意图之前，我不会放松警惕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20167
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_bed515ae:

    # you "I need her to get close to the Royal family, but I don't care for her at all."
    you "我需要她接近皇室成员，但我对她一点也不喜欢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20169
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_a1b13607:

    # you "I'll fuck her for as long as I need her, and then I'll just ditch the bitch."
    you "我会一直操她，直到我不再需要她，然后我就甩了这个贱人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20173
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_d8c37b5e:

    # "The sun is fading behind the hills. You recognize this area. Homura told you the mansion where guests are waiting for the princess's birthday party isn't far."
    "夕阳西下，落日余晖洒在山峦之上。你认得这片区域。焰曾告诉你，宾客们等候参加公主生日宴会的宅邸就在不远处。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20179
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_2138786e:

    # "Your reverie stops when the carriage enters the courtyard of a large mansion, as night engulfs the Inner City."
    "当夜幕笼罩内城，马车驶入一座大宅的庭院时，你的遐想戛然而止。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20181
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_39cd01a0:

    # you "Wow. This place sure is gigantic. Whoever lives here must be disgustingly wealthy."
    you "哇，这地方真大！住在这里的人肯定富得流油。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20183
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_3c324da5:

    # "The dark and empty courtyard seems somewhat unwelcoming. As you get off, you fail to notice any sign of life coming from inside the large and overbearing building."
    "昏暗空旷的庭院显得有些冷清。下车时，你丝毫没注意到那栋庞大而压抑的建筑里有任何生命迹象。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20185
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_116edaf1:

    # you "(It sure looks quiet for a birthday party...)"
    you "（生日派对现场看起来真安静……）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20187
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_9a860401:

    # "Homura's Voice" "Come in, [MC.name]! You're just in time."
    "焰的声音" "Come in, [MC.name]! You're just in time."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20190
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_e833bb95:

    # "Homura's voice beckons. You climb the stairs to the mansion, suddenly aware that the coach driver is close behind you."
    "焰的声音传来。你拾级而上，来到宅邸，突然意识到马车夫就在身后不远处。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20195
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_8641cd6a:

    # "You feel a strange chill down your spine as you push the door to the mansion open."
    "当你推开豪宅大门时，一股莫名的寒意涌上脊背。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20204
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_9f42d8fe:

    # homura ninja "Welcome, [MC.name]. We've been waiting for you for the final act."
    homura ninja "欢迎你，[MC.name]。我们一直在等你来演最后一幕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20206
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_b48879b7:

    # "Homura stands in the entrance, but her clothing is completely different from what she usually wears."
    "焰站在入口处，但她的穿着与她平时穿的衣服完全不同。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20208
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_35a7f3da:

    # "And the blade at her side is definitely new..."
    "她腰间的刀肯定是新的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20210
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_3ce816b1:

    # you "Homura... What's with the disguise? Is this a costume party, and you somehow forgot to tell me? *nervous*"
    you "焰……你这是在干嘛？这是化装舞会吗？你居然忘了告诉我？*紧张*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20212
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_f4cdd943:

    # "The driver is standing right behind you. You realize that you haven't seen his face, covered as it was by a long scarf."
    "司机就站在你身后。你这才意识到，你没看到他的脸，因为他的脸被一条长长的围巾遮住了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20216
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_f0a637f9:

    # "He drops it, and you take your first good look at him."
    "他把东西扔了，你这才第一次好好看了他一眼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20221
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_f117f7de:

    # "Coach driver" "..."
    "长途客车司机" "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20234
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_69869d3b:

    # you "(Oh shit...)"
    you "（妈的...）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20242
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_81251f19:

    # homura ninja "As I was saying... We've been waiting for you."
    homura ninja "正如我刚才所说……我们一直在等你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20248
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_28196de5:

    # homura "[MC.name], I'm sorry, I truly am. I wish I did not have to trick you. I didn't think it would go this far..."
    homura "[MC.name]，对不起，真的对不起。我真希望不必欺骗你。我没想到事情会发展到这种地步……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20250
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_8adbae8e:

    # "She loses her composure for a moment, looking down."
    "她一时失态，低下了头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20253
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_670b1921:

    # homura "I know you're surprised to see me like this. But I had little choice. This is all for the greater good."
    homura "我知道你看到我这样很惊讶。但我别无选择。这一切都是为了大局着想。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20256
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_860b0f95:

    # homura "Oh, dear, the costume party {i}is{/i} over. The disguise was the {i}other{/i} one... It's lucky you fell for it."
    homura "哦，天哪，化装舞会结束了。伪装是另一个……你居然上当了，真是幸运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20259
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_d4268b5f:

    # homura "Ha! You fell for my 'frail noble girl' persona hook, line and sinker, didn't you? How dumb."
    homura "哈哈！你完全被我“柔弱贵族小姐”的形象蒙蔽了，对吧？真是个傻瓜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20261
