translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_20f08f88:

    # "The man looms larger than life now, his anger flaring. You could almost believe he possesses the wrath of a King."
    "如今，这男人身形魁梧，怒火中烧，仿佛拥有君王般的威严。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20554
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_aedf7ec2:

    # mask "I was but an infant when the first attack came... The old Knight Commander saved me."
    mask "第一次袭击发生时，我还是个婴儿……老骑士指挥官救了我。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20556
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_426a697c:

    # mask "He was sent to hide me into the forest for my safety, on my mother's orders."
    mask "奉我母亲之命，他被派到森林里藏匿我，以确保我的安全。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20561
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_79fecff9:

    # mask "There were many attacks since, and we had to move time and time again. I have know the fear of demons and assassins since before I could talk."
    mask "此后袭击不断，我们不得不一次又一次地迁徙。我甚至在会说话之前就体会到了对恶魔和刺客的恐惧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20563
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_161951c1:

    # mask "Eventually, they took my eyes... Worse, they took him, my guardian, the one who taught me everything I know... The father I wished I had..."
    mask "最终，他们夺走了我的双眼……更糟的是，他们带走了他，我的监护人，教会我一切的人……我一直渴望拥有的父亲……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20565
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_2e3c9b13:

    # mask "Master Mitsuhide."
    mask "光秀大师。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20568
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_234e1cb4:

    # kenshin "WHAT???" with vpunch
    kenshin "什么？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20570
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_6862bda7:

    # you "Kenshin's father? Kenshin's father protected you?" with vpunch
    you "剑心的父亲？剑心的父亲保护过你？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20573
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_9c9ab098:

    # you "The boy in the forest that Mizuki told us about! It was you!"
    you "瑞希跟我们讲过的森林里的那个男孩！原来是你！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20575
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_901ef143:

    # mask "I assume you refer to the warrior lady who helped me defeat the attackers. I was fortunate to survive that day, even at the cost of my eyes."
    mask "我想你指的是那位帮我击退袭击者的女战士吧。那天我能活下来真是幸运，即使为此付出了失去双眼的代价。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20577
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_338bf1a3:

    # you "And Kenshin's father protected you to the end..."
    you "剑心的父亲一直保护着你，直到最后一刻……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20581
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_0eb1183e:

    # kenshin "Do you speak the truth? You knew my father?"
    kenshin "你说的是真话吗？你认识我父亲吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20583
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_bfc9f068:

    # mask "Knew him? He raised me by himself, surviving in the deep forest."
    mask "认识他吗？他独自一人把我抚养长大，在茂密的森林里生存下来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20585
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_f14e45a2:

    # kenshin "He... He abandoned his family to raise you?"
    kenshin "他……他为了养育你抛弃了家人？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20587
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_84bb4c57:

    # mask "He did his duty. He had to protect the rightful heir. Such was his vow to my mother."
    mask "他尽到了自己的职责。他必须保护合法的继承人。这是他对母亲的承诺。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20589
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_c7c904f2:

    # kenshin "..."
    kenshin "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20592
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_a3d1d71d:

    # mask "He did, until the demons gutted him."
    mask "他确实这么做了，直到恶魔将他掏空。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20594
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_fc63d20c:

    # mask "But the loss of my eyes and mentor did not soothe the beasts. There were more attacks, even after I escaped."
    mask "但失去双眼和导师并没有平息野兽的怒火。即便我逃脱之后，它们依然发动了更多袭击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20607
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_20c73c94:

    # mask "When I was just a boy of eight, the attack came."
    mask "我八岁那年，袭击发生了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20609
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_979d3daf:

    # mask "Demons surrounded the hut where we slept. They would have killed me if not for Master Mitsuhide's heroic defense, and the intervention of a mysterious lady warrior."
    mask "我们睡觉的小屋被恶魔包围了。若非光秀大人英勇抵抗，以及一位神秘女战士的出手相救，我早已被他们杀死。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20611
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_074b630d:

    # mask "Thanks to your investigation and a little guess work, I now know that it was the Kunoichi you know as Mizuki Ike."
    mask "多亏了你的调查和一些猜测，我现在知道她就是你认识的女忍者池瑞希。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20613
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_20d77529:

    # mask "While the attackers stopped short of ending my life, a demon took my eyes out."
    mask "虽然袭击者没有取我性命，但一个恶魔挖走了我的眼睛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20615
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_c142c9c3:

    # mask "I remember the pain all too well. And for a long time, its fiendish claws were the last thing I saw..."
    mask "我至今仍清晰地记得那种痛苦。很长一段时间里，它那邪恶的利爪是我最后看到的景象……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20617
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_4270f34e:

    # mask "But Master Mitsuhide had taught me to fight since I was old enough to walk."
    mask "但是，光秀师傅从我蹒跚学步起就教我战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20619
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_04a34484:

    # mask "To survive in the forest, I had to learn to live without sight. I became a stronger warrior for it."
    mask "为了在森林里生存，我不得不学会如何在失明的情况下生活。正因如此，我成为了更强大的战士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20621
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_b8b02e1d:

    # mask "I could hunt with just sound and smell... And now that I can see again, I have reached the peak of my abilities."
    mask "我以前只凭声音和气味就能狩猎……现在我又能看见了，我的能力也达到了巅峰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20623
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_7a8ff4e3:

    # you "Modest, aren't you?"
    you "你很谦虚吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20625
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_5529dfa7:

    # mask "No, accurate. More demons came for me over the years. And even without the use of my eyes, none of the assassins have come close to succeeding."
    mask "不，没错。这些年来，来袭的恶魔越来越多。即便我双目失明，那些刺客也从未接近过我的下场。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20628
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_019a3f63:

    # you "And now you recovered your sight, thanks to the artifact you stole from the Magic University."
    you "现在，多亏了你从魔法大学偷来的那件神器，你恢复了视力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20630
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_4a51b4e5:

    # mask "I see you've done your homework."
    mask "看来你已经做足了功课。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20633
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_25291e6a:

    # you "But you've recovered from such an injury? What sorcery is this?"
    you "但你竟然从那样的伤病中恢复过来了？这究竟是什么魔法？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20635
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_10ceed2c:

    # mask "The regular kind of sorcery."
    mask "普通的魔法。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20637
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_e4a8b9ca:

    # mask "My darling Homura is an expert thief. She stole the Oculus mask from the Magic University, and helped me recover my eyesight, which proved invaluable to navigate the unfamiliar environment of this city."
    mask "我亲爱的焰是个盗窃高手。她从魔法大学偷走了奥库鲁斯面具，帮助我恢复了视力，这对我在这座陌生的城市里行走至关重要。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20639
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_43217ac4:

    # mask "Now I'm stronger than I've ever been... My other senses have been honed by fifteen years of survival in the wild. And the mask grants me powers beyond what simple mortal eyes can perceive."
    mask "现在我比以往任何时候都更强大……十五年的野外生存磨砺了我的其他感官。而这副面具赋予我凡人肉眼无法感知的力量。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20641
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_db2dd305:

    # "You sense that the Masked Man's boast is more than just bluster. The man and his mask are truly dangerous."
    "你感觉到，蒙面人的吹嘘并非虚张声势。这个人以及他的面具都确实危险。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20649
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_b63f5802:

    # mask "For the longest time, we were looking for an 'in' into the Palace. After all, it is the most well-guarded place in the city, and I haven't a ninja's knack for... Burglary."
    mask "很长一段时间以来，我们都在寻找进入皇宫的“突破口”。毕竟，那是城里守卫最森严的地方，而我又没有忍者那样的……盗窃天赋。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20651
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_ea2b8027:

    # homura "But one day, we got lucky: a palace carriage was sent to the lower city, undefended, and we got a hold of it."
    homura "但有一天，我们走运了：一辆宫廷马车被派往下城区，没有防守，我们把它劫持了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20653
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_576b9c5b:

    # mask "I was able to... Get the driver to talk. Imagine my surprise, when I heard that the Princess had been sending for a known whoremonger."
    mask "我终于让司机开口说话了。可想而知，当我听到公主竟然派人去叫一个臭名昭著的嫖客时，我有多么震惊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20657
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_5a0e4821:

    # kuro "Whoremonger? *raise eyebrow*"
    kuro "嫖客？*挑眉*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20659
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_1c48073b:

    # mask "It seems you little protege hasn't told you everything... *smirk*"
    mask "看来你这个小徒弟还没把所有事情都告诉你呢……*冷笑*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20663
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_cbe1d67f:

    # kuro "I didn't know of his occupation, besides... *sigh* It is not your place to judge."
    kuro "我不知道他的职业，而且……唉，你没有资格评判别人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20665
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_821324a1:

    # mask "As the rightful ruler, I can do as I damn well please!"
    mask "作为合法的统治者，我爱干嘛干嘛！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20668
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_64b6f42d:

    # kuro "So what? Do you pride yourself on hanging around with murderers? When matters of State need handling, you have to use every opportunity at your disposal."
    kuro "那又怎样？你以和杀人犯混在一起为荣吗？当国家大事需要处理时，你必须利用一切可以利用的机会。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20670
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_54ddc1bf:

    # mask "On that we can agree."
    mask "这一点我们可以达成共识。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20672
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_bf5b9200:

    # homura "We decided to seize the opportunity. I assumed the role of young Lady Henso, which I had been rehearsing for such an occasion..."
    homura "我们决定抓住这个机会。我扮演了年轻的亨索小姐，为此我特意排练过……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20674
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_61c78b87:

    # mask "... and I took on the role of the driver."
    mask "于是我便担任了司机的角色。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20676
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_3cde77b2:

    # mask "We were able to ride into the castle, using [MC.name]'s own letter of conduct."
    mask "我们凭借[MC.name]本人的行为证明信，得以骑马进入城堡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20678
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_cc93e489:

    # homura "You unwittingly brought the proverbial fox inside the chicken coop."
    homura "你无意中把狐狸引进了鸡舍。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20680
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_c146c23d:

    # mask "Thanks to you, I was able to recon the place, and bring my sister a first warning... The judge's head."
    mask "多亏了你，我才能侦察到那个地方，并给我妹妹带来了第一次警告……法官的脑袋。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20682
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_75092808:

    # you "So that's how you got in at first..."
    you "所以你最初就是这样进来的……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20684
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_514fd11e:

    # you "But what happened to the real driver?"
    you "但真正的司机怎么样了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20686
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_381168de:

    # mask "Oh, that poor sod?"
    mask "哦，那个可怜的家伙？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20688
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_fa500a91:

    # mask "What do you think happened to him? I slit his throat and threw his body in the sewers."
    mask "你觉得他后来怎么样了？我割断了他的喉咙，把他的尸体扔进了下水道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20691
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_11fdb519:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20696
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_1de293da:

    # you "You killed an unarmed man in cold blood? How could you!"
    you "你竟然冷血地杀害了一个手无寸铁的人？你怎么能这样！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20698
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_b49b19b7:

    # mask "Obviously I couldn't leave a witness behind."
    mask "我显然不能留下目击证人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20700
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_033306f1:

    # mask "It was distasteful, but no King ever fulfilled their destiny without spilling some commoner blood. Besides, no servant of this Court is innocent, anyway."
    mask "这令人不齿，但没有哪个君王能在不沾染平民鲜血的情况下完成其使命。再说，这朝廷里也没有哪个仆人是清白的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20704
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_adbd00e0:

    # you "Cold. You couldn't leave him alive if you wanted to carry on with your plan, I suppose."
    you "冷酷无情。我想，如果你想继续你的计划，就不能让他活着离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20706
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_9d98e1ad:

    # mask "Of course not. But don't worry, I made it quick."
    mask "当然不是。不过别担心，我很快就做好了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20711
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_11f60685:

    # you "Sure. I didn't picture you for someone who would tolerate loose ends. You're not foolish."
    you "当然。我没料到你会容忍事情没有结果。你并不傻。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20713
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_0e794154:

    # mask "You've noticed."
    mask "你已经注意到了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20716
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_fa96584d:

    # "Homura stays silent and looks down, obviously uneasy."
    "焰沉默不语，低着头，显然感到不安。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20719
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_523465e8:

    # "Homura heaves a heavy sigh."
    "焰重重地叹了口气。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20722
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_618ee1af:

    # homura "People die everyday. This sacrifice was but a small one to restore Shiro's glory."
    homura "每天都有人死去。为了恢复白郎的荣光，这点牺牲不过是微不足道的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20724
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_980f255f:

    # mask "That's right."
    mask "就这么多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20726
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_cf0c3478:

    # kuro "You evil, despicable man! *snort*" with vpunch
    kuro "你这个邪恶卑鄙的家伙！*嗤之以鼻*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20728
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_e3de4b03:

    # mask "Peh, women have such weak hearts. No wonder they are unfit to rule."
    mask "唉，女人的心肠真软弱。难怪她们不适合统治。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20736
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_31a493fc:

    # mask "Homura? Well, she saved me, in her own way... Perhaps my destiny is to be rescued by Kunoichi."
    mask "焰？嗯，她用她自己的方式救了我……或许我的命运就是被女忍者拯救。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20738
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_3870912b:

    # homura "It's a long story..."
    homura "说来话长……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20741
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_11fdb519_1:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20745
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_1462b8cd:

    # you "Well, I didn't have other plans for the evening."
    you "我当晚没有其他安排。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20747
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_dd0d67f1:

    # "Homura shrugs and proceeds to tell her side of the story."
    "焰耸了耸肩，开始讲述她自己的故事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20749
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_dd3cb57c:

    # homura "As you might have guessed, I am a Kunoichi. I hail from the Temple of Fire, on the brink of an active volcano near Hokoma's border."
    homura "正如你可能已经猜到的那样，我是一名女忍者。我来自火之神殿，它位于霍科玛边境附近一座活火山的边缘。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20751
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_b526025f:

    # homura "After completing my training, I worked all around Xeros, getting to know all of the big cities, including Zan."
    homura "完成培训后，我在 Xeros 各地工作，熟悉了所有的大城市，包括 Zan。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20753
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_24049f98:

    # homura "But even when business takes me to a large urban center, I'm always more at ease in the wilderness. Thus I started hiding in the forest near Zan."
    homura "但即便因公事前往大城市，我还是更喜欢待在荒野里。于是，我开始躲藏在赞恩附近的森林里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20755
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_5db64f2c:

    # homura "I thought it safer, and more peaceful than the cutthroat streets. Until one day..."
    homura "我原以为这里比鱼龙混杂的街头更安全、更宁静。直到有一天……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20770
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_dc5365c6:

    # homura sepia "W-What's this? A fight? In the middle of the forest?"
    homura sepia "这……这是什么？打架？在森林中央？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20775
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_71e26116:

    # homura ninja "That's when I saw him. He was just a boy my age, fighting with his eyes shut... But Arios, did he fight like a lion."
    homura ninja "就在那时我看到了他。他只是个和我同龄的男孩，闭着眼睛战斗……但阿里奥斯，他战斗起来就像一头雄狮。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20787
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_a46baaa0:

    # homura "He was facing four ninjas all by himself, and they couldn't lay a hand on him. But he was getting tired..."
    homura "他孤身一人面对四个忍者，他们却连他的手都碰不到。但他已经精疲力竭了……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20801
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_bf2f3b7a:

    # homura "He took out three of them, but the last one had him cornered. I knew he was defeated, but the attacker hesitated for a fleeting moment. I didn't."
    homura "他干掉了其中三人，但最后一个把他逼到了角落。我知道他败局已定，但攻击者犹豫了一瞬。我没有。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20806
translate chinese_simplified c3_mask_questions_36c5ac15:

    # homura sepia "Stop!"
    homura sepia "停止！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:20808
