    "房间突然燃起熊熊大火，你与公主和她的哥哥被隔绝在外。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21315
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c000fd1d:

    # you "Damn it, Homura! You can't just murder a sovereign, you lunatic!"
    you "该死的焰！你不能就这样谋杀君主，你这个疯子！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21317
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_0ed16060:

    # "Doubt only flickers in Homura's eyes, as she ponders what to do with you."
    "焰的眼中只有一丝疑虑闪过，她正在思考该如何处置你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21320
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1f2db55b:

    # you "What are you doing, Homura? After everything we've been through?"
    you "焰，你到底在做什么？经历了这么多之后？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21322
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6f92beeb:

    # homura "I... I must..."
    homura "我……我必须……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21324
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_fe89840d:

    # "The masked man's voice booms across the curtain of flames."
    "蒙面男子的声音在熊熊烈焰中回荡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21326
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7c52fc46:

    # mask "Homura, don't falter! Strike him down!"
    mask "焰，别动摇！把他干掉！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21329
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8b34b75f:

    # you "What the hell, Homura? Do you really want my head?"
    you "焰，你到底想干什么？你真的想要我的命吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21331
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_048be8df:

    # homura "I have no choice, [MC.name]. Please... Step aside, and you can still walk away."
    homura "我别无选择，[MC.name]。请……让开，你仍然可以离开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21334
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6835085c:

    # homura "Nothing personal, [MC.name], but you are at the wrong place at the wrong time. I'll make it quick..."
    homura "别介意，[MC.name]，但你真是来错地方了。我长话短说……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21336
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2021028e:

    # you "Back off!"
    you "退后！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21339
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_dcd2c0c8:

    # homura "Finally, you bastard! Time to pay for all you did to me!"
    homura "终于，你这个混蛋！是时候为你对我做的一切付出代价了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21341
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_173637ef:

    # you "Hey, you consented, more or less... It was just a bit of fun..."
    you "嘿，你差不多也同意了……这只是开个玩笑而已……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21343
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_03cb8b69:

    # "A curtain of fire now splits the room in two, leaving you and Homura facing off on one side."
    "一道火幕将房间一分为二，你和焰在一边对峙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21345
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c23b6e78:

    # "Heat warps the air and blurs your vision. Homura bars your way, weapon raised."
    "热浪扭曲了空气，模糊了你的视线。焰挡住了你的去路，举起了武器。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21351
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f297c026:

    # "Your blade is already drawn. You whirl it through the air, keeping distance to gauge your opponent."
    "你的剑已出鞘。你挥剑斩去，保持距离以试探对手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21353
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_d8852dc3:

    # "Her stance is flawless. She's most likely faster, and more agile. You have the strength and reach - but she commands deadly fire magic. Your odds are grim."
    "她的姿态完美无瑕。她很可能速度更快，身手更敏捷。你拥有力量和攻击范围——但她掌握着致命的火焰魔法。你的胜算渺茫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21359
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6dbec99f:

    # "Your mind sharpens, bracing your mental defenses and focussing on half-a-dozen spells that could come in handy in such a fight."
    "你的思维变得敏锐，精神防御也随之加强，你专注于六个可能在这种战斗中派上用场的法术。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21361
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_0e383c4e:

    # "However, you know full well that fire is the most destructive form of magic - and you'll need to dodge the deadly attacks of a trained assassin while you counter her spells. Your talent may not be enough to survive."
    "然而，你很清楚火焰是最具破坏性的魔法——你必须躲避训练有素的刺客的致命攻击，同时还要反制她的法术。你的天赋或许不足以让你活下来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21367
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_966abc5c:

    # you "*whistle"
    you "*哨"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21371
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_4fb7c5f6:

    # "You are relieved to hear Drogon's roar echo outside: your faithful pet has followed you all the way here. Still, the fire kunoichi has plenty of time to turn you into cinders before the wyrm makes it."
    "听到卓耿的咆哮声在外面回荡，你松了一口气：你忠实的伙伴一路跟着你来到这里。不过，在巨龙赶到之前，火系女忍者还有足够的时间把你烧成灰烬。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21377
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8b5755c8:

    # "You are about to act, but something in her attitude gives you pause."
    "你正准备采取行动，但她的态度让你犹豫了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21379
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_bc33600c:

    # homura "I've spent years following Shiro, helping him to the best of my abilities, forgetting myself in service of his destiny..."
    homura "多年来，我一直追随白郎，尽我所能地帮助他，为了他的命运而忘却自我……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21381
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_46fe8b9d:

    # homura "And now that we're here, about to see this thing through... I can't do it."
    homura "而现在我们已经走到这一步，即将完成这件事……我做不到。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21383
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_3d2f2f70:

    # "Unexpectedly, she lowers her weapon, looking down, her eyes brimming with tears."
    "她出乎意料地放下了武器，低头看着地面，眼中噙满了泪水。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21385
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_4bb50782:

    # homura "I want to help Shiro, I want to... But you've shown me kindness, [MC.name]. More than... More than he ever did."
    homura "我想帮助白郎，我真的想……但是你对我太好了，[MC.name]。比……比他曾经对我做的还要好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21387
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_97a9c21c:

    # homura "And I... I care for you."
    homura "而我……我关心你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21389
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c75e2590:

    # homura "Enough blood has been spilled. I don't want to shed yours. I don't want to be part of this any longer. "
    homura "已经流了太多血。我不想再流你的血。我不想再参与其中了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21391
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8a8c8ca5:

    # "Shirohito's furious voice rises over the fire, his silhouette thrashing behind the flames."
    "白仁愤怒的声音从火光中传来，他的身影在火焰后翻腾。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21393
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_18412633:

    # mask "YOU TOO, Homura? You would betray me, at the hour of my revenge?"
    mask "焰，你也背叛我？就在我复仇之际，你竟要背叛我？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21395
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ece542a0:

    # "Her face steels with resolve."
    "她脸上露出坚定的神情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21397
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_bb0928f7:

    # homura "Your hatred has poisoned your soul, Shiro! You are about to turn into the evil you vowed to fight!"
    homura "白郎，你的仇恨已经毒害了你的灵魂！你即将变成你曾发誓要与之对抗的邪恶！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21399
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e2f9589c:

    # mask "CURSE YOU, WOMAN!!! I don't need you! I don't need anyone! I will conquer my rightful place on the throne!"
    mask "诅咒你，女人！！！我不需要你！我不需要任何人！我要夺回我应得的王位！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21403
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1b92b2a8:

    # "A large wooden beam crashes down from the ceiling, drowning out his fury."
    "一根巨大的木梁从天花板上轰然落下，盖过了他的怒吼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21407
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_24c47515:

    # "Homura looks at you, her face sad but resolute."
    "焰看着你，脸上带着悲伤但坚定的神情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21409
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ea4cacc4:

    # homura "I thought I loved Shiro... But I was under a spell. Somewhere along the way, I lost my way."
    homura "我以为我爱上了白……但我当时只是中了邪。不知不觉中，我迷失了方向。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21411
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_18bc79ca:

    # homura "But with you, I... I felt normal. Like I was allowed to be myself, that it wouldn't make me look weak, or unworthy. Like I didn't have to put my feelings last."
    homura "但和你在一起，我……感觉自己很正常。感觉自己可以做真正的自己，不会显得软弱或不配。感觉自己不必把自己的感受放在最后。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21413
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_b9725608:

    # homura "Ironic, isn't it? I was lying to you, I was wearing a mask... And yet somehow, I could reconnect with the real me."
    homura "真是讽刺，不是吗？我一直在骗你，我一直戴着面具……然而不知怎的，我却能重新找回真正的自己。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21415
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ce476ceb:

    # "She lets her weapon drop with a clang."
    "她松开了手，武器哐当一声掉在了地上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21417
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7aeb6aab:

    # homura "I won't raise a hand against you, [MC.name]. Do what you must. I'm your prisoner."
    homura "我不会对你动手动脚，[MC.name]。你想做什么就做什么吧。我是你的囚犯。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21419
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_75889974:

    # "She moves out of you way, and you walk past her."
    "她向你让开，你从她身边走过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21421
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e585d3ff:

    # you "Thank you, Homura. And... I'm Sorry."
    you "谢谢你，焰。还有……对不起。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21423
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_cc429bf3:

    # homura "Sorry? For what?"
    homura "对不起？为什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21425
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_fd6e3da6:

    # you "This."
    you "这。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21432
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a0aa6c99:

    # "Using an old trick you learnt from your warmaster, you strike a precise blow to the backof her neck. She collapses, unconscious."
    "你用从你的战帅那里学来的古老技巧，精准地击中了她的后颈。她倒地昏迷。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21438
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_07a52f91:

    # "Waving your hand in front of her, you cast a sleeping spell, and she is too surprised to resist. Her eyes flutt shut, and she falls unconscious."
    "你朝她挥了挥手，施了个睡眠咒，她猝不及防，无力抵抗。她的眼皮缓缓合上，昏了过去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21444
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6be00bdb:

    # "You uncork a small vial of chloroform under her nose, and old Borgo trick. She slips into unconsciousness."
    "你把一小瓶氯仿放在她鼻子底下，使出了博尔戈的老伎俩。她随即昏了过去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21448
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_fac3462f:

    # "You catch her as she falls, and lay her on the floor gently, some way away from the flames."
    "你接住了倒下的她，轻轻地把她放在地板上，远离火焰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21450
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_87af0a17:

    # you "Stay here, while I end this."
    you "你待在这里，等我把事情解决。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21456
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_4b9c8b16:

    # "Despite the fiery situation, Homura remains calm. She nods towards something, and you cautiously follow her gaze, careful to keep your guard up."
    "尽管局势剑拔弩张，焰却依然保持冷静。她朝某个方向点了点头，你小心翼翼地顺着她的目光望去，时刻保持警惕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21458
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9d3b185e:

    # "There is a gap in the firewall by the stairs, just large enough for a person to go through unscathed."
    "楼梯旁的防火墙上有一个缺口，刚好够一个人毫发无损地通过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21460
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5dfc5f0a:

    # "She left it open on purpose!"
    "她故意没关门！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21462
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_41017da8:

    # homura "We don't have to fight, [MC.name]. I have nothing against you."
    homura "我们没必要争吵，[MC.name]。我跟你没有任何过节。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21464
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_004775cb:

    # homura "Just take the way out. Shiro will be satisfied with the Princess, and you can disappear and lay low for a while."
    homura "你就走这条路吧。白郎会对公主很满意，而你可以消失一段时间，低调行事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21466
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_96a330e5:

    # you "But Princess Kurohime..."
    you "但是黑姬公主……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21468
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_3bbca04b:

    # "She shrugs."
    "她耸了耸肩。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21470
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6a070fe3:

    # homura "Kurohime will die tonight, [MC.name]. There's nothing you can do. Think about saving your own skin."
    homura "黑姬今晚必死无疑，[MC.name]。你无能为力。想想如何保全自己吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21472
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_690e807e:

    # "You are torn. You don't want to fight a trained killer, but can you really leave the princess behind?"
    "你左右为难。你不想与训练有素的杀手搏斗，但你真的能抛下公主吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21475
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_11fdb519_1:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21479
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c72aeb0d:

    # you "I can't abandon the Princess. Prepare to fight."
    you "我不能抛弃公主。准备战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21481
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f86156eb:

    # homura "I wanted to help you... *sigh*"
    homura "我想帮你……唉"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21483
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_4c11cee1:

    # "Her face hardens."
    "她的脸色开始变得阴郁。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21485
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1c609d58:

    # homura "You foolish dreamer. Very well, we shall fight."
    homura "你这个愚蠢的梦想家。很好，我们就战斗吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21494
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a9568b42:

    # you "I've had enough with cloak and dagger politics. I'm getting the hell out of here!"
    you "我受够了这种尔虞我诈的政治斗争。我要赶紧离开这里！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21499
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7f45aae3:

    # "Leaping through the gap in the flames, you search for a way out. A large window stands open on the top floor. Running up the stairs, you take one last look back before leaving."
    "你跃过火焰间的缺口，寻找出路。顶楼有一扇大窗户敞开着。你跑上楼梯，离开前最后回头看了一眼。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21505
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5d62136c:

    # "Homura looks at you with cold, dispassionate eyes. Eyes you now know belong to a killer."
    "焰用冰冷、漠不关心的眼神看着你。你现在知道，这双眼睛属于一个杀手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21507
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_fa02643a:

    # homura "This is the end of the road. You know we can't let you go."
    homura "这是终点了。你知道我们不能让你走。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21509
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a364e554:

    # you "No witnesses, eh? Well, I'm not going down without a fight."
    you "没有目击证人？哼，我可不会束手就擒。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21511
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6cabe666:

    # homura "Suit yourself..."
    homura "随你便吧……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21517
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6fc4b4f6:

    # "Homura looks at you with fury and determination. She's spoiling for a fight."
    "焰怒目而视，眼神坚定。她一心想要战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21519
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_666ec351:

    # you "Holding a grudge isn't good for you. It makes your face all puffy and fat."
    you "记仇对你没好处，会让你的脸变得浮肿肥胖。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21521
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7f8cc686:

    # homura "..."
    homura "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21523
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_579b50d4:

    # "She doesn't rise to the insult. Instead, she moves with blinding speed."
    "她没有理会这种侮辱，而是以迅雷不及掩耳之势离开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21533
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2a78a750:

    # "You barely dodge out in time to avoid an expertly throw shuriken."
    "你险险躲过一枚精准投掷的手里剑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21549
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_d9ed066d:

    # you "(It's time... Let's use that fire rune I bought from Willow...)"
    you "（是时候了……让我们用上我从柳树那里买来的火焰符文吧……）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21551
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_240a2f01:

    # "You don't have your trusty hammer, though. You will have to get creative if you want to beat Homura."
    "不过，你没有你那把可靠的锤子。想要打败焰，你就得发挥创意了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21553
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8cc4f9a0:

    # "She is already coming at you, moving with the speed you've come to expect from a Kunoichi."
    "她已经朝你冲过来了，速度之快，正是你所期待的女忍者应有的速度。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21561
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5e874574:

    # "If not for the reflexes you honed over weeks of fighting the Kunoichi, her first strike would have pierced your heart."
    "如果不是因为你与女忍者战斗数周磨练出的反应速度，她的第一击就会刺穿你的心脏。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21563
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8c4e31d5:

    # "Instead, you dodge just in time, out of sheer habit."
    "相反，你出于习惯及时躲开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21567
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_3f4daaed:

    # "You grab her belt, trying to pull her off balance."
    "你抓住她的腰带，试图让她失去平衡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21569
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9e9840f6:

    # "She answers with a visious elbow strike, splitting your lip. Her blade whizzes between you, inches from where your hand just was."
    "她以一记凶狠的肘击还击，打裂了你的嘴唇。她的刀刃嗖地一声从你身边掠过，距离你刚才的手所在的位置只有几英寸。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21571
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1f18607d:

    # "You retreat hastily. The metallic taste of blood in your mouth feels like victory, though."
    "你仓皇撤退。然而，口中血腥味的金属质感却让你感到胜利的喜悦。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21575
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9be906b4:

    # "You smile through the pain, because the fire rune is now securely tucked inside her belt."
    "你强忍着疼痛微笑，因为火符文现在已经牢牢地藏在她的腰带里了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21577
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7f8cc686_1:

    # homura "..."
    homura "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21579
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_0fdf67d1:

    # "Homura's expression tells you you did something right. She struggles to concentrate, as if something were tugging at at her mind."
    "焰的表情告诉你，你做对了。她努力集中注意力，仿佛有什么东西在牵扯着她的思绪。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21581
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_25c61fca:

    # you "What's the matter, Homura? Are you scared?"
    you "焰，你怎么了？害怕吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21583
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_76bce2c4:

    # "She growls and comes at you again."
    "她低吼一声，再次向你扑来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21593
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_0bbeb992:

    # ninja.char "Leave him alone!"
    ninja.char "别管他！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21595
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5e480f04:

    # "[ninja.name] leaps to your aid, stopping Homura in her tracks."
    "[ninja.name] 挺身而出帮助你，阻止了焰的行动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21598
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e553ad14:

    # ninja.char "Don't touch him, bitch! [MC.name] is mine - Err, I mean, he's my ally... *blush*"
    ninja.char "别碰他，贱人！[MC.name]是我的——呃，我是说，他是我的盟友……*脸红*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21600
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2336ea08:

    # ninja.char "I'm afraid I can't let you do that. [MC.name] is my new boss. I can't let you harm him."
    ninja.char "恐怕我不能让你这么做。[MC.name]是我的新老板。我不能让你伤害他。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21602
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ae7ea5cc:

    # ninja.char "[MC.name] saved my mentor. It is my turn to repay this debt."
    ninja.char "[MC.name]救了我的导师。现在轮到我报答这份恩情了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21604
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ebb36b67:

    # "Homura steps back, and the three of you walk in a circle, weapons drawn. Her eyes narrow, darting between you and [ninja.name]."
    "焰后退一步，你们三人围成一圈，拔出武器。她的目光锐利，在你和[ninja.name]之间来回扫视。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21606
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_26aebf39:

    # "Are the odds turning in your favor?"
    "形势对你有利吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21631
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_42f49ca7:

    # "With [ninja.name] at your side, Homura is now on the back foot."
    "有了[ninja.name]的帮助，焰现在处于劣势。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21643
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_82e6cb89:

    # "Every time she attempts a cautiously attack, [ninja.name] counters viciously. Eventually, Homura redirects more of her attention to the larger threat."
    "每当她试图谨慎地发起攻击时，[ninja.name]都会凶狠地反击。最终，焰将更多注意力转移到了更大的威胁上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21662
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_06654911:

    # "As you trade blows with Homura, you gradually find your rhythm, taking advantage of the experience accumulated since arriving in Zan."
    "在与焰的交锋中，你逐渐找到了自己的节奏，充分利用了自来到赞城以来积累的经验。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21664
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2ce07308:

    # "While Homura is agile, she lacks Narika's speed, Mizuki's cunning, and Haruka's sheer strength."
    "虽然焰身手敏捷，但她缺乏奈莉卡的速度、瑞希的狡猾和遥的强大力量。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21666
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_851fc268:

    # homura "You're... you're good..."
    homura "你……你很棒……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21676
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_112a15c8:

    # "Suddenly unleashing a flurry of attacks, you force Homura's back to the fire."
    "你突然发动一连串攻击，迫使焰背对火焰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21682
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8a612718:

    # "She begins weaving a spell with one hand, aiming a fireball at you. You shove her wrist upward just in time to avoid the blazing projectile."
    "她单手开始施法，瞄准你发射火球。你及时向上推了推她的手腕，躲过了那团炽热的火球。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21688
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7c1e6ab5:

    # "The fireball hits the ceiling, and another beam comes crashing down. You both dive down out of the way, but you are slightly quicker to get back on your feet."
    "火球击中天花板，另一根横梁轰然落下。你们俩都俯身躲开，但你起身的速度略胜一筹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21690
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_46ad56f5:

    # you "(This is my chance...)"
    you "（这是我的机会……）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21698
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1c99d5dc:

    # "While she is still disoriented, you lunge forward with a vicious blow, aimed at her head."
    "趁她还处于迷茫状态，你猛地向前一击，直奔她的头部而去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21703
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8727b9cc:

    # "She manages to dodge, but your strike catches her with the flat of the blade. The blow is enough to knock her unconscious."
    "她躲开了，但你的攻击还是用刀背击中了她。这一击足以让她昏迷过去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21707
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1d3642bd:

    # "You make sure that she is out cold. Satisfied, you shift your focus to the other side of the fire."
    "你确认她已经昏迷不醒。满意之后，你把注意力转移到火堆的另一边。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21711
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6b01cee1:

    # "Desperate fights call for desperate measures: gripping your wizard's staff in both hands, you whirl it around, a trick you picked up while sparring with your security guys."
    "绝望的战斗需要非常手段：你双手紧握巫师杖，挥舞着它，这是你在与保安人员切磋时学到的一招。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21716
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2b0ef789:

    # "Homura doesn't see it coming. The staff strikes her squarely on the head with a sickening *thud*. You hope you didn't break her skull."
    "焰毫无防备，棍子重重地击中了她的头部，发出令人作呕的“砰”的一声。你祈祷没把她的头骨打碎。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21720
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_02273017:

    # "The Kunoichi is tough, but not that tough. She crumples unconscious."
    "女忍者虽然很强悍，但也没那么强悍。她昏倒在地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21722
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a56b2141:

    # "You turn your attention to the other side of the room."
    "你将注意力转向房间的另一边。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21726
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_b6ae2e2f:

    # "Instinctively, you sense a reassuring presence in your periphery."
    "你本能地感觉到周围有一股令人安心的力量。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21728
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a02eabd5:

    # "Just as Homura turns har attention back to you, determined to give you the final blow, you summon some backup."
    "就在焰将注意力重新转向你，决心给你最后一击的时候，你召唤了一些援军。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21732
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_77d0502e:

    # you "DIVE BOMB!"
    you "俯冲轰炸！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21740
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_07ac85fa:

    # "The glass ceiling shatters, and a red projectile rockets into the room, hitting Homura square in the chest."
    "玻璃天花板破碎，一道红色弹丸射入房间，正中焰的胸口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21742
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_846bf2fd:

    # you "Yay, Drogon! Good boy!"
    you "耶，卓耿！好孩子！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21744
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_04c841f7:

    # "Your pet dragon flaps excitedly, then perches on Homura's body as she stirs feebly beneath him."
    "你的宠物龙兴奋地拍打着翅膀，然后栖息在焰的身上，焰在他身下无力地动了动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21746
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ba1f0352:

    # "Unaffected by the flames around him, he turns to you, awaiting the command to finish her off."
    "他丝毫不受周围火焰的影响，转身看向你，等待着你下令了结她。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21748
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_41f10cdb:

    # you "Leave her. She's down. We've got more pressing matters."
    you "别管她了，她情绪低落。我们还有更紧迫的事情要处理。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21752
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7e0c1627:

    # "You turn your attention to the dark silhouettes on the far side of the fire."
    "你将注意力转向火堆另一侧的黑色人影。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21759
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_58f1eabd:

    # "Taking advantage of the situation, you unleash the spell you'd been preparing: the perfect counter to fire."
    "你利用这个机会，释放了你一直准备的法术：完美的火系克星。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21765
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f9139719:

    # you "GELATUM INCARCERUM! Ice coffin!" with vpunch
    you "凝胶凝胶！冰棺！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21770
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6a173c82:

    # "Homura watches in horror as solid ice forms at her feet and quickly crawls up her legs to encase her body."
    "焰惊恐地看着坚硬的冰块在她脚下形成，并迅速向上蔓延，将她的身体包裹起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21774
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9fff1514:

    # "She tries to ignite her hands, but it's too late. The ice reaches her waist, then her arms, then her neck."
    "她试图点燃双手，但为时已晚。冰层蔓延至她的腰部，然后是手臂，最后是脖颈。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21778
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e6a37e50:

    # "She locks eyes with you, white with panic, just before the ice reaches her face."
    "就在冰块即将触及她脸庞的那一刻，她惊恐地与你四目相对，脸色惨白。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21783
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a5e7bb9f:

    # you "Don't worry, it's harmless... I think."
    you "别担心，它无害……我想。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21785
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_102a1ac9:

    # "She's frozen solid, but the fire still rages around. You must deal with the rest of the fight before she starts to thaw."
    "她已被彻底冻住，但周围的火焰仍在熊熊燃烧。你必须在她开始解冻之前解决掉剩下的战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21789
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_78e0b88f:

    # "Since your introduction to the dark belly of the city, you are no longer a stranger to magic. You picked up some useful tricks along the way."
    "自从你踏入这座城市的黑暗腹地，你就不再对魔法一无所知了。一路走来，你也学到了一些实用的技巧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21795
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_da48e968:

    # "You parry Homura's blade, knocking it aside. Then, with your free hand, you snap your fingers at her face."
    "你挡开了焰的刀，把它拨到一边。然后，你用空着的那只手朝她脸上打了个响指。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21801
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_d0063c97:

    # "*FLASH*"
    "*闪光*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21803
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5af4d2df:

    # "You close your eyes just in time as a blinding burst of light explodes."
    "一道耀眼的强光瞬间爆发，你及时闭上了眼睛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21807
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e3b9bf8a:

    # homura "Aaaaah!!!" with vpunch
    homura "啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21809
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a374b436:

    # "The light overload scrambles her senses. She drops like a puppet with its strings cut."
    "强光让她感官混乱，她像断了线的木偶一样倒了下去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21813
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8c77947a:

    # "You rub your own eyes, fighting off a headache. After making sure that she is out of it, you refocus on the chaos beyond the flames."
    "你揉了揉眼睛，努力抑制头痛。确认她已经清醒后，你才将注意力重新集中到火焰之外的混乱景象上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21818
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_174a1800:

    # "Fighting two-on-one, Homura realizes she's at a disadvantage."
    "面对二对一的战斗，焰意识到自己处于劣势。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21822
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_930fd3e4:

    # "She shakes her fist, and a pillar of flame erupts under [ninja.name]'s feet, forcing her to leap back."
    "她挥动拳头，一道火焰柱在[ninja.name]脚下爆发，迫使她向后跳开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21824
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_dfdef80a:

    # "With [ninja.name] temporarily cut off, Homura turns her attention back to you."
    "由于 [ninja.name] 暂时无法联系上，焰将注意力重新转向了你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21826
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2a5e9581:

    # homura "The weakest link in the chainmail..."
    homura "锁子甲中最薄弱的环节……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21837
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7526f135:

    # "As you trade blows, you realize you are outmatched. Homura is faster, stronger, and every strike of hers is deadly accurate."
    "交手之后，你意识到自己根本不是对手。焰的速度更快，力量更强，而且她的每一次攻击都精准无比，致命无比。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21839
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5300d56e:

    # "You start feeling overwhelmed."
    "你开始感到不知所措。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21843
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_32f0ba72:

    # you "I must use my secret technique! WHAAAA!!!"
    you "我必须使用我的秘密绝招！哇啊啊啊！！！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21848
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_042964be:

    # "With a chuckle, Homura vanishes in a puff of smoke. Your mighty strike hits only a wooden log."
    "焰轻笑一声，化作一缕青烟消失不见。你那威力无比的攻击，却只击中了一根木头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21850
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_99e3e4b1:

    # "Before you can dislodge your weapon, Homura is on you again."
    "在你还没来得及卸下武器之前，焰又扑了过来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21854
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_8fd2d94c:

    # "The spells you practiced sounded easier in theory. Now, dodging lethal strikes while trying to remember arcane syllables, your mind goes blank."
    "你练习过的那些法术听起来似乎很简单。现在，一边躲避致命攻击，一边努力记住那些晦涩难懂的咒语，你的大脑一片空白。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21856
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ce7949f5:

    # "Taking advantage of a lull in her attacks, you try to form the words of a shield spell."
    "趁着她攻击的空隙，你试着念出护盾咒语。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21858
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c24bdcf4:

    # you "M-Minoris di..."
    you "M-小号迪..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21863
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_141779e3:

    # "It was a feint. Homura doubles down on her last attack with a spinning kick, connecting squarely with your jaw."
    "那只是个佯攻。焰使出最后一击，一记旋风踢正中你的下巴。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21865
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_490aeb7f:

    # "The whole world goes white. When you come back to, you are laying on your back."
    "整个世界一片空白。当你恢复意识时，发现自己仰面躺着。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21869
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f87c5165:

    # homura "It's over, [MC.name]..."
    homura "结束了，[MC.name]……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21877
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c6e80b0f:

    # ninja.char "No!!!" with vpunch
    ninja.char "不！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21882
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_b868e286:

    # "[ninja.name] dives in, blocking the fatal blow."
    "[ninja.name] 奋不顾身地扑了上去，挡住了致命一击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21888
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_12dd990d:

    # "Homura's blade slips through, though. [ninja.name] drops to her knees, and she coughes blood."
    "然而，焰的刀刃却穿透了她的身体。[ninja.name]跪倒在地，咳出一口血。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21892
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_97cf9ffb:

    # you "[ninja.name]!!!"
    you "[ninja.name]!!!"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21894
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_263ff169:

    # ninja.char "[MC.name]... Run!"
    ninja.char "[MC.name]...快跑！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21896
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_5d95feab:

    # "With the last of her strength, [ninja.name] casts one final spell."
    "用尽最后的力气，[ninja.name] 施放了最后一个魔法。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21899
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_d4d6d46a:

    # narika "HAA!!!" with vpunch
    narika "哈哈！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21901
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_171d5862:

    # "Narika howls in pain. A whirlwind bursts out around you, flattening the flames."
    "娜丽卡痛苦地嚎叫起来。一阵旋风在你周围爆发，将火焰夷为平地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21904
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_b937dee7:

    # mizuki "Ouch... That one hurt... *panting* After this scrap... We're all going to need a shower."
    mizuki "哎哟……这一下真疼……*喘气* 打完这场架……我们都得去洗个澡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21908
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9d197025:

    # "Suddenly, bucketloads of water pour over and around you, dousing the nearest fire."
    "突然间，大量的水倾泻而下，浇灭了附近的火焰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21910
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_4af3871e:

    # "Through the hissing steam, you see the masked man, closing in on the princess with his swords drawn."
    "透过嘶嘶作响的蒸汽，可以看到蒙面男子拔出双剑，正逼近公主。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21913
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_6f2eeaec:

    # haruka "Stone... Crush... *groan*"
    haruka "石头……碾碎……*呻吟*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21918
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a2df7d85:

    # "With a last ditch effort, Haruka conjures a stone bridge over the fire behind you."
    "遥用尽最后一丝力气，在你身后的火焰上变出一座石桥。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21920
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ea65b0d7:

    # "She gives you a nod, the light in her eyes fading. You understand."
    "她朝你点点头，眼中的光芒渐渐消失。你明白了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21925
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_c7c13cfe:

    # "You leap across the fire to the other side, leaving [ninja.name] behind."
    "你跃过火焰到达另一边，把[ninja.name]留在了身后。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21932
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_483ce310:

    # you "Arrh!" with hpunch
    you "啊！" with hpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21937
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2c532475:

    # "This time, you miss your dodge. You feel cold steel bite your side. The world starts spinning."
    "这一次，你躲闪失误了。你感到冰冷的钢铁刺入你的肋部。世界开始旋转。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21939
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_7931776c:

    # "As you fall to the floor, you begin to see the scene as if through the eyes of someone else."
    "当你倒在地上时，你开始像透过别人的眼睛一样看待眼前的景象。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21941
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_dc490cf3:

    # "Homura towers above you, ready to finish you off. Her mind is already elsewhere, eager to join her master's fight."
    "焰高高地俯视着你，随时准备将你终结。但她的心思早已飞向别处，渴望加入主人的战斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21943
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e078d78c:

    # suzume shrewd "Hold on, boss!" with vpunch
    suzume shrewd "等等，老板！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21948
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1e6d2331:

    # "A leather pouch lands beside you, bursting open. Thick, white smoke fills your view."
    "一个皮袋落在你身边，瞬间爆开。浓浓的白烟瞬间弥漫开来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21950
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_fb65179d:

    # "Small yet strong hands grab you by the shoulders and drag you away."
    "小巧却有力的手抓住你的肩膀，把你拖走。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21952
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_69a073f9:

    # you "What the... Suzume?"
    you "什么……铃芽？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21954
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_a77e2edc:

    # suzume "It's me, boss! I'm pulling you out of here."
    suzume "是我，老板！我这就把你拉出去。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21956
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_feed7b88:

    # "You hear Homura curse and cough as the smoke swirls."
    "烟雾缭绕中，你听到焰咒骂和咳嗽声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21958
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_cb13fc67:

    # "Your vision is fading, but your focus lingers on the flickering shadows beyond the large fire - the dance of death has begun."
    "你的视线开始模糊，但你的注意力仍然停留在大火远处摇曳的影子上——死亡之舞已经开始了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21967
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_1215e806:

    # "Disoriented by the smoke and flames, you struggle to find your way to the other side of the room."
    "浓烟烈火让你迷失了方向，你努力寻找通往房间另一侧的路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21971
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_0a715b7c:

    # "Panicked screams echo from the corners of the room, and you think about Kosmo and his servants, trapped amidst the fire."
    "房间的角落里回荡着惊恐的尖叫声，你不禁想到了被困在火海中的科斯莫和他的仆人们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21973
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_b8886e46:

    # "Hopefully some of them will manage to break their bonds in time and help the others."
    "希望他们中的一些人能够及时挣脱束缚，帮助其他人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21976
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_e5df157c:

    # "Your heart bleeds for the poor wretches, but you must focus on saving the princess for now."
    "你为这些可怜的人感到心痛，但你现在必须集中精力拯救公主。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21979
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_32417163:

    # you "Well, I've got my own problems to take care of right now. Where is the Princess?"
    you "嗯，我现在还有自己的事要处理。公主在哪里？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21982
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_ea414d3d:

    # you "Good riddance! Now, I'd better get to that asshole Shiro before the stench of roasted Kosmo reaches my delicate nostrils..."
    you "真是摆脱了祸害！现在，我最好赶紧去找那个混蛋白郎算账，免得烤科斯莫的臭味熏到我娇嫩的鼻子……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21984
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f8f75ca4:

    # "A curtain of flames block your vision. You begin to panic, unsure if you can even find your way out of the blazing fire, when something catches your eye."
    "一道火幕遮蔽了你的视线。你开始惊慌失措，甚至不确定自己能否找到逃离这熊熊烈火的出路，这时，有什么东西吸引了你的目光。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21991
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_2f5eaf33:

    # "You have no time to ponder these mysteries longer. As if driven away by the divinity, the flames part, clearing your way towards the unfolding duel."
    "你没有时间再去琢磨这些谜团了。仿佛受到神明的驱赶，火焰分开，为你扫清了通往即将展开的决斗的道路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21993
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_68826b06:

    # "Just past some burning furniture, you get a glimpse of Shirohito and his victim."
    "穿过一些燃烧的家具，就能看到白仁和他的受害者。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:21998
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_663c6f28:

    # "The flames that Homura sparked now raise all the way to the upper floor, their roar makes you shiver."
    "焰点燃的火焰如今已冲天而起，直冲楼上，其轰鸣声令人不寒而栗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22005
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_f38e5601:

    # "You have no time to ponder these mysteries longer. As if driven away by the divinity, the flames part, clearing your view of the unfolding duel."
    "你没有时间再去琢磨这些谜团了。仿佛受到神明的驱赶，火焰分开，让你能清楚地看到正在上演的决斗。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22007
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_fight_9c598a6e:

    # "Just before you pass out, your every sense is on alert in a bizarre out-of-body experience."
    "在你昏厥之前，你的所有感官都会处于高度警觉状态，这是一种奇异的灵魂出窍体验。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22020
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5dfecd2b:

    # "The princess is huddled back into a corner. Kenshin is stubbornly blocking all avenues of attack with her sword."
    "公主蜷缩在角落里。剑心顽强地用剑挡住了所有攻击路线。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22022
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_46078242:

    # "She has several bleeding wounds to show for her devotion. As far as you can tell, Shirohito is unhurt."
    "她身上有好几处流血的伤口，足以证明她的忠诚。就你所看到的，白仁似乎毫发无损。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22025
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f0efc61f:

    # "The cursed prince and the frail princess are walking in a circle, keeping away from each other."
    "被诅咒的王子和体弱多病的公主围着彼此转圈，保持着距离。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22027
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_3deed4cc:

    # "Even though, or perhaps because, Kurohime is defenseless, Shirohito is taking his time to attack."
    "即使黑姬毫无防备，或者正因为如此，白仁才不慌不忙地发动攻击。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22029
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8daebcba:

    # "You can hear bits of their conversation. It seems like Shirohito is trying to work up the courage to carry out this final and most important murder."
    "你可以听到他们对话的片段。看来白仁正在鼓起勇气，准备执行这最后也是最重要的一次谋杀。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22031
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7b24a2f7:

    # mask "Sister. I understand, you're just a pawn in this. But sometimes, pawns need to fall, to spare the King."
    mask "姐姐，我明白，你只是这其中的一枚棋子。但有时候，为了保全国王，棋子必须牺牲。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22033
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_76217e9b:

    # "Though pale with fear, the Princess doesn't avert her gaze."
    "尽管脸色因恐惧而苍白，公主却没有移开目光。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22035
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5b2511cd:

    # kuro "I am no pawn. You forget that the queen {i}is{/i} the most powerful piece on the board."
    kuro "我不是一枚棋子。你忘了皇后才是棋盘上最强大的棋子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22037
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9cabbf4e:

    # mask "You are no queen. Only a princess. So insignificant, no one ever bothered to write rules for you."
    mask "你不是女王，只是个公主。你如此微不足道，以至于没有人费心为你制定规则。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22041
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_75e32d7a:

    # kuro "I write my own rules!" with vpunch
    kuro "我制定自己的规则！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22045
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e316d6ce:

    # mask "Insignificant, and delusional... You won't be missed. A mere footnote of history."
    mask "微不足道，而且妄想连篇……没人会想念你。你不过是历史的脚注罢了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22047
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ab6e06ef:

    # kuro "So this is it, then? You'd murder your own kin? And compound regicide with fratricide?"
    kuro "原来如此？你会谋杀自己的亲人？而且还要犯下弑君和弑兄双重罪行？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22049
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_489c0b2f:

    # "The masked man's voice rises in contempt, almost manic."
    "蒙面男子的声音越来越高，带着轻蔑，近乎疯狂。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22051
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f9bdfa48:

    # mask "Don't you see? It is a matter of survival for our dynasty! Survival of the fittest!" with vpunch
    mask "难道你看不出来吗？这关乎我们王朝的存亡！适者生存！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22053
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_624cd679:

    # mask "My father is unfit to rule! And so are you, about to be sold to a power-hungry husband, who'll carve up the Realm for himself."
    mask "我的父亲不适合统治！你也一样，你即将被卖给一个权力欲极强的丈夫，他会瓜分整个王国。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22055
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_67d4cdd0:

    # mask "I {i}am{/i} fit to rule. I have the will, I have the skills, I have the courage, and I have..."
    mask "我具备统治的资格。我有意志，我有能力，我有勇气，而且我……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22057
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e7e1cba3:

    # mask "The RIGHT!" with vpunch
    mask "正确！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22059
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_85f4dc9a:

    # "Kurohime remains silent, her eyes hurling daggers at her treacherous brother."
    "黑姬沉默不语，目光如炬地盯着她背叛的哥哥。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22072
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d46065eb:

    # you "*cough*" with vpunch
    you "*咳嗽*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22074
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e5276bb1:

    # "Shirohito's shoulders tense slightly as he hears you clear your throat. Yet he turns slowly to face you, downplaying the threat you represent."
    "听到你清嗓子，白仁的肩膀微微绷紧。但他还是缓缓转过身来面对你，似乎在刻意淡化你所构成的威胁。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22079
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e6bbe5f0:

    # mask "So, Homura couldn't stop you... Interesting."
    mask "所以，焰没能阻止你……有意思。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22081
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_16c9076e:

    # "He doesn't seem particularly concerned about the fate of his lover."
    "他似乎并不特别关心爱人的命运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22083
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7c7cd736:

    # mask "So you would defy me, [MC.name]?"
    mask "所以你要违抗我的命令，[MC.name]？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22097
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5c9d8331:

    # ninja.char "He's not alone!"
    ninja.char "他并不孤单！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22099
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_724bc1e8:

    # "[ninja.name] appears at your side. Shirohito frowns."
    "[ninja.name]出现在你身边。白仁皱起了眉头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22102
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9dab4a8c:

    # ninja2.char "I'm here too."
    ninja2.char "我也在这里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22104
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_588ed389:

    # "Shirohito feels the tide turn. His eyes flick nervously from side to side, considering his chances."
    "白仁感到局势正在发生变化。他紧张地左右张望，权衡着自己的胜算。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22107
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0563a7cc:

    # ninja3.char "And so am I."
    ninja3.char "我也是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22109
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_82c7589d:

    # "Zealous as he is, the prince can see this is a battle he cannot win. He grits his teeth in anger."
    "尽管王子满怀热情，但他明白这是一场他无法取胜的战斗。他愤怒地咬紧牙关。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22111
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_78e3bf70:

    # you "I have backup. You don't."
    you "我有备份，你没有。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22115
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b948d63e:

    # "He scans the room, betraying a flicker of anxiety - expecting more enemies to emerge. But he relaxes once he realizes you're alone."
    "他环顾四周，眼中闪过一丝焦虑——他预感到会有更多敌人出现。但当他意识到只有你一个人时，便放松了下来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22117
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5affd8e4:

    # mask "Then bear witness, [MC.name]. There is nothing you, a mere shopkeeper, can do to hinder Royal destiny."
    mask "那么，[MC.name]，请你作证。你不过是个店主，根本无法阻挡皇室的命运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22119
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_945a276d:

    # you "I don't need help to kick your royal butt into the dirt. Your Highness."
    you "我不需要任何人帮忙就能把你这尊贵的屁股踢到地上，殿下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22127
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4a50d968:

    # mask "Surely, you must see..."
    mask "你一定要看看……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22129
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_68bfe760:

    # suzume "Hi there! Speaking of seeing..."
    suzume "你好！说到见面……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22138
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_206385bf:

    # "A lone kunai whistles through the air, barely missing Shirohito's face."
    "一枚孤零零的苦无划破空气，险些击中白仁的脸。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22144
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b053294b:

    # "He barely flinches in front of the surprise attack."
    "面对突袭，他几乎纹丝不动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22152
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a8af352a:

    # mask "And here is [MC.name]'s pet... You make a poor assassin. You missed."
    mask "这是[MC.name]的宠物……你真是个糟糕的刺客。你没打中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22154
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_279b681b:

    # suzume bend "Did I? Kukukukuku..."
    suzume bend "是吗？库库库库库……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22159
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7f4273be:

    # "Hissing like a cat, Suzume leaps at him, and deftly swipes his mask away."
    "铃芽像猫一样发出嘶嘶声，扑向他，灵巧地扯掉了他的面具。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22163
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_41686c16:

    # mask "What?"
    mask "什么?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22165
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d7cc07b0:

    # "The prince realizes too late: the kunai had severed the leather strap of his mask."
    "王子醒悟得太晚了：苦无割断了他面具的皮带。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22167
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e08b9245:

    # mask "My mask! My eyes! Nooo!!!" with vpunch
    mask "我的面具！我的眼睛！不要啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22187
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_54daadd6:

    # "Shirohito unleashes a flurry of blows that would have shred anyone else to pieces. But Suzume dodges away with feline grace."
    "白仁使出一连串足以将任何人撕成碎片的猛攻，但铃芽却像猫一样优雅地躲开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22191
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fba4ca7a:

    # suzume "Thanks! I'll leave you guys to it!"
    suzume "谢谢！我就不打扰你们了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22196
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_97a212d9:

    # "After a few swift steps, she somersaults onto the window ledge."
    "她轻快地迈了几步，然后翻身跳上了窗台。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22198
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_67af1072:

    # you "Wait, Suzume! Come back and help us!" with vpunch
    you "等等，铃芽！回来帮我们吧！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22200
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_06827a71:

    # suzume "Sorry boss, I can't right now. I have a delivery to make!"
    suzume "抱歉老板，我现在不行。我得去送货！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22202
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_166e2d6f:

    # "She disappears back into the night."
    "她消失在夜色中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22204
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_719e9c0f:

    # you "Suzume! Curses..."
    you "雀！可恶……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22211
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_02c62f1e:

    # mask "YOU! This is all your fault!"
    mask "都是你的错！这都是你的错！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22215
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_32297b6f:

    # "The blind prince now turns his fury to you."
    "这位盲眼王子现在将怒火转向了你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22218
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_85eda481:

    # "His unblinking red gaze fixes on you."
    "他那双一动不动的红色眼睛紧紧盯着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22236
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_63f3a14d:

    # "With the princess standing defenseless, Shirohito's deadly focus is on you."
    "公主毫无防备，白仁的致命目光便落在了你身上。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22238
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_072d7e5c:

    # "He looks as if he was about to swat a fly."
    "他看起来像是要拍死一只苍蝇。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22243
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5687ebf7:

    # "[text1]Shirohito now faces two opponents."
    "[text1]白仁现在面临两个对手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22245
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ece8c402:

    # "He still doesn't see you as a serious threat, though, so it doesn't deter him in the least."
    "不过，他仍然不认为你构成严重威胁，所以丝毫没有因此而却步。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22250
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_64864df4:

    # "[text1]Shirohito is now facing [allies] skillfull warriors."
    "[text1]白仁现在面对的是[text1]技艺高超的战士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22253
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_51288f81:

    # "And without his mask, he will have to fight blind."
    "没了面具，他就只能盲目战斗了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22255
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c1ceefe2:

    # "He may not think much of you, but your quick defeat of Homura gives him pause."
    "他或许并不怎么看得起你，但你迅速击败焰让他有所警觉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22261
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_077afdef:

    # "He glances at the princess, his fury hardening into cold contempt."
    "他瞥了公主一眼，怒火瞬间凝固成冰冷的轻蔑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22266
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6a3c187d:

    # "Still, he thinks too much of himself to retreat now."
    "但他太看重自己了，现在不会退缩。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22284
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4109e838:

    # kuro "[MC.name]!"
    kuro "[MC.name]！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22286
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b1015be7:

    # you "I'm here, Princess!"
    you "公主殿下，我来了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22288
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d9e32318:

    # kuro "Be careful... There's something about him... None of my wards work on him!"
    kuro "小心……他有点不对劲……我的所有魔法对他都无效！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22290
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_24a036e2:

    # "Princess Kurohime, like many highborn ladies, has powerful magic protections on her and even a cursory knowledge of magic. And yet..."
    "黑姬公主和许多出身高贵的女子一样，拥有强大的魔法防护，甚至对魔法也略知一二。然而……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22292
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b01af009:

    # kuro "Spells don't affect him as they should."
    kuro "法术对他没有起到应有的作用。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22297
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_dcef0403:

    # mask blind "Indeed, Sister. I am full of surprises. What better assassin than one magic cannot detect or harm?"
    mask blind "的确如此，姐姐。我处处充满惊喜。还有什么比一个魔法无法察觉或伤害的刺客更厉害的呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22299
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_83cf3715:

    # mask "Indeed, Sister. I am full of surprises. What better assassin than one magic cannot detect or harm?"
    mask "的确如此，姐姐。我处处充满惊喜。还有什么比一个魔法无法察觉或伤害的刺客更厉害的呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22302
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_03e1b7ed:

    # "He flashes a wicked grin at your allies."
    "他朝你的盟友露出了邪恶的笑容。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22304
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ebf0ed30:

    # mask "And here goes half your strength, ninjas."
    mask "忍者们，你们一半的力量都白费了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22306
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e2b6a676:

    # "You find it hard to believe. Immunity to magic is nearly unheard of - something only ancient masters have achieved over lifetimes of study."
    "你难以置信。对魔法免疫几乎闻所未闻——只有古代大师们经过毕生钻研才能达到这种境界。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22308
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_022525ff:

    # you "There must be a trick to it!"
    you "这其中肯定有诀窍！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22310
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_dc8bc398:

    # mask "Indeed, but I am not about to share it with you. Let's just say that my new friends have been helpful..."
    mask "确实如此，但我并不打算告诉你。总之，我的新朋友们帮了我很多忙……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22312
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0765d0f6:

    # "Whatever the source of his resistance, the result is the same: you must face his blades without your magic."
    "无论他的抵抗来自何处，结果都是一样的：你必须在不使用魔法的情况下面对他的利刃。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22314
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_373b042e:

    # "You don't have time to ponder this new mystery."
    "你没时间去思考这个新谜团。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22316
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_206e83d5:

    # kuro "Please, [MC.name]! Stop him!" with vpunch
    kuro "[MC.name]，求求你！阻止他！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22321
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a178f17d:

    # kenshin "You shall not pass!"
    kenshin "你不可以过去！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22323
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9324fbe7:

    # "Resolute, Kenshin stands by your side, shoulder to shoulder."
    "坚定不移的剑心与你并肩作战。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22326
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b5b9d3a6:

    # narika "Leave me and [MC.name] alone, you... You dark and handsome stranger!"
    narika "你这个……你这个英俊神秘的陌生人，别来打扰我和[MC.name]！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22328
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fad000c6:

    # narika "(Wait... Is he trying to start a love triangle with me? Like that novel with the vampire, the werewolf, and the tentacle monster and the...)"
    narika "（等等……他这是想跟我搞三角恋吗？就像那本小说里吸血鬼、狼人、触手怪还有……）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22330
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_196764c4:

    # "Even as she daydreams, Narika reflexively falls in battle formation."
    "即使在做白日梦的时候，娜丽卡也会下意识地摆出战斗阵型。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22333
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d21c15d2:

    # mizuki "I never could stand this macho posturing from young men."
    mizuki "我一直都无法忍受年轻男性这种逞强好胜的态度。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22335
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1ca86ccf:

    # mizuki "I'm old enough to be everyone's grand-mother here. If I catch a naughty boy, I'll spank him myself!"
    mizuki "我年纪都够当这里所有人的奶奶了。要是抓到哪个淘气的小男孩，我非得亲自打他屁股不可！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22337
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c72ed7b3:

    # "Mizuki fans herself defiantly as she takes her position."
    "瑞希摆好姿势，一边骄傲地扇着扇子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22340
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_2e1389d0:

    # haruka "I heard your words before, and I see what we have in common. We both suffered at the claws of demons."
    haruka "我以前就听过你的话，也明白了我们的共同之处。我们都曾遭受过恶魔的折磨。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22342
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fa59a036:

    # haruka "Yet I am honor-bound to defend [MC.name] and his Liege. Defend yourself!"
    haruka "但我有义务捍卫[MC.name]和他的君主。你也应该自卫！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22344
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6172e208:

    # "With practiced ease, Haruka steps into the battle line."
    "遥轻松地踏入了战场。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22346
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_3592fe00:

    # "Shirohito scoffs."
    "白仁嗤之以鼻。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22348
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_39695951:

    # mask "United you stand. United you'll fall."
    mask "团结则存，团结则亡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22351
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_da81d465:

    # "Nothing stands between his steel and the princess - Except you."
    "没有什么能阻挡他的钢铁之躯和公主——除了你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22353
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b40569a0:

    # mask "I figured you were many things, [MC.name], but not suicidal. *smirk*"
    mask "我猜你有很多缺点，[MC.name]，但绝对没想到你会自杀。*得意地笑*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22355
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_601e2008:

    # mask "Seems you don't have a friend left in the world."
    mask "看来你在这个世界上已经没有朋友了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22357
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_06aeacc4:

    # mask "Perhaps you'll meet one in the next..."
    mask "或许你会在下个月遇到一个……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22373
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fb9d5dfe:

    # "Drawing your weapon, you hold your ground."
    "拔出武器，坚守阵地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22375
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8f4b7c70:

    # "You both stare at each other for a long time. Flames keep rising, licking the ceiling. The heat becomes almost unbearable."
    "你们俩对视了很久。火焰不断升腾，舔舐着天花板。热浪几乎令人难以忍受。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22377
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d2bc309b:

    # "No one moves. Until suddenly-"
    "无人动弹。直到突然——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22379
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_3715709a:

    # mask "KIAI!!!" with vpunch
    mask "凯艾！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22381
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6f0ba0f2:

    # you "HA!!!" with vpunch
    you "哈！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22384
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b1d87a90:

    # kenshin "DAAAA!!!" with vpunch
    kenshin "啊啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22387
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7b8e1049:

    # haruka "RAAAAH!!!" with vpunch
    haruka "啊啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22390
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_2e9d5e5b:

    # narika "HYAAAA!!!" with vpunch
    narika "啊啊啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22393
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ab6920a7:

    # mizuki "..."
    mizuki "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22416
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_623961cd:

    # "[text1] and Shirohito fly past each other in a flash of steel. For a heartbeat, you don't even know who was hit."
    "[text1] 和白仁像一道钢铁闪电般擦肩而过。一瞬间，你甚至都不知道谁被击中了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22421
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_da355cbd:

    # "Behind you, you hear Shirohito cough. Blood runs from his mouth, and he stumbles."
    "你身后传来白仁咳嗽声。鲜血从他口中涌出，他踉跄了一下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22423
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b3a9df56:

    # mask "Un-Unbelievable... I was... So close..."
    mask "难以置信……我……就差一点点……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22425
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_703720d2:

    # "A crimson flower slowly blooms under his shirt. He is wounded, yet not down."
    "一朵鲜红的花朵在他衬衫下缓缓绽放。他身负重伤，却并未倒下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22427
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_56eb1de8:

    # "Bleeding but still standing, he turns to face you, staggering toward the exit."
    "他浑身是血，但仍然站着，转身面对着你，踉跄着走向出口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22431
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_385a5f4a:

    # "Then the pain hits you."
    "然后，疼痛袭来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22433
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_212c90c4:

    # you "AWGH!!!" with vpunch
    you "啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22435
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_862087aa:

    # "You glance down. A clean cut on your leg is pouring blood. It's a miracle it missed the artery."
    "你低头一看，腿上有一道很干净利落的伤口，鲜血正汩汩流出。幸好没伤到动脉，真是个奇迹。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22437
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d15482d3:

    # "You're not dead yet, but you're out of combat. Dizzy, you can barely stand."
    "你还没死，但已经失去战斗力。你头晕目眩，几乎站不稳。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22445
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b5cf8726:

    # "You are horrified to find [text1] in similar shape, if not worse off."
    "你惊恐地发现 [text1] 的情况也差不多，甚至更糟。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22448
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_71a5bcd6:

    # "Kenshin lies in a spreading pool of red, barely moving."
    "剑心躺在一片蔓延开来的血泊中，几乎一动不动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22450
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_eb7a2798:

    # "Shirohito doesn't even bother to finish you. Instead, he turns toward the princess, raising his blade to her neck."
    "白仁甚至懒得了了你的命。相反，他转向公主，举起刀抵住了她的脖子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22458
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_47736446:

    # "You size him up. He's a trained fighter, it's all he's known since he was little. Fighting him head on is too risky."
    "你打量了他一番。他是个训练有素的战士，从小就耳濡目染。跟他正面交锋风险太大了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22460
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ce874afa:

    # "You need to have your wits about you if you want to survive."
    "想要活下去，你必须保持头脑清醒。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22462
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_bda55356:

    # you "I don't think you've properly assessed the situation, murderer."
    you "凶手，我认为你没有正确评估形势。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22464
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_bb649acb:

    # mask "Oh really? Enlighten me then, whoremonger."
    mask "哦，真的吗？那你这娼妓者，给我讲讲你的故事吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22466
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_91322bc3:

    # you "I beat three trained assassins just getting to you. And that's not even counting Suzume."
    you "我为了找到你，打败了三个训练有素的刺客。这还不包括铃芽。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22468
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f57052ef:

    # mask "Good for you. But I'm made of harder stuff."
    mask "恭喜你。但我比你坚强得多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22470
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_89862fa5:

    # you "You think? I also dispatched your attack dog, Homura, without breaking a sweat. Doesn't that strike you as... suspicious?"
    you "你觉得呢？我轻轻松松就干掉了你的攻击犬焰。你不觉得这……很可疑吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22472
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c2f065f8:

    # "A flicker of doubt crosses his face."
    "他脸上闪过一丝疑虑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22474
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_bd545ccc:

    # mask "That is no small feat, true... Maybe you got lucky."
    mask "这的确不是一件容易的事……也许你运气好。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22476
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_99172796:

    # you "Not only am I kicking butts left and right, I'm also the Princess's confidant. A simple brothel-owner? Doesn't that seem odd to you?"
    you "我不仅所向披靡，还是公主的知己。一个普通的妓院老板？你不觉得奇怪吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22478
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c47f8994:

    # "His eyes narrow."
    "他眯起了眼睛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22480
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c8d78683:

    # mask "Your point...?"
    mask "你想表达什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22482
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7f3f1ee5:

    # "Time to play your cards right."
    "是时候好好把握机会了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22484
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d4fd141f:

    # you "Think about it. Could a mere pimp take down an army of ninjas? Command such allies and resources? Come and go to the palace at leisure?"
    you "想想看，一个区区皮条客能打败一支忍者大军吗？能指挥如此强大的盟友和资源吗？能随意出入皇宫吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22486
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_069470b8:

    # mask "..."
    mask "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22488
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6507fe75:

    # you "The truth was right under your nose all along. You've been played for a fool. I'm no brothel-owner..."
    you "真相一直就在你眼皮底下。你被耍了。我可不是妓院老板……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22490
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1eb28283:

    # you "I'm the Royal Master of Assassins!"
    you "我是刺客之王！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22492
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e99c33e3:

    # "You strike your most menacing pose, hoping it sells."
    "你摆出最凶狠的姿势，希望这能吸引顾客。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22495
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5bb118df:

    # you "And my allies are here to end your bloody rampage... This whole time, you thought you were the hunter..."
    you "我的盟友们前来终结你的血腥暴行……一直以来，你都以为自己是猎人……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22497
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_53f0210d:

    # you "But you're the prey."
    you "但你才是猎物。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22507
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_20a9fe84:

    # kuro "Well done, my dear [MC.name], I don't know what I would do without your loyal service."
    kuro "干得好，我亲爱的[MC.name]，没有你忠诚的服务，我真不知道该怎么办。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22509
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8dfe930c:

    # "The princess effortlessly leans into your lie. You could swear she was a born actor."
    "公主毫不费力地就相信了你的谎言。你简直会觉得她天生就是个演员。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22511
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_aed983f9:

    # kuro "Now, collect this dog's head." with vpunch
    kuro "现在，把这只狗的头取下来。" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22515
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5246b30f:

    # you "Your wish is my command, Your Highness."
    you "遵命，殿下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22517
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_589a4cad:

    # "Shirohito's composure cracks. For the first time, real doubt creeps in."
    "白仁的镇定开始瓦解。他第一次产生了真正的怀疑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22519
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_22943640:

    # mask "Y-You! Of course... I should've known it couldn't be that easy..."
    mask "你！当然……我早该知道事情不会那么简单……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22521
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a8f4d3aa:

    # "He looks like a caged animal, ready to bolt. And then-"
    "他看起来像一只被困住的野兽，随时准备挣脱。然后——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22523
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1a0aa152:

    # mask "If you think you have me cornered, think again!"
    mask "如果你以为你已经把我逼到绝境，那就大错特错了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22528
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_29898e32:

    # "*CRASH*"
    "*碰撞*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22530
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0751bc05:

    # "Shirohito kicks a burning table your way with savage force."
    "白仁用蛮力一脚踹向你，一张燃烧的桌子正朝你飞来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22532
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_07c08755:

    # "He jumps through the flames, howling in pain as the fire burns him, but he pushes until he reaches the exit."
    "他纵身跃过火焰，被火焰灼烧得痛苦地嚎叫，但他坚持不懈，直到到达出口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22534
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e6894aad:

    # "Flaming debris explode in your way. You are too stunned - and too relieved your bluff worked - to give chase."
    "燃烧的碎片在你面前爆炸。你惊愕不已——也庆幸自己的虚张声势奏效了——以至于无法追赶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22539
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_cfa2e5c5:

    # mask "You... The Royal Master of Assassins?"
    mask "你……刺客之王？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22543
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b974bdc8:

    # mask "BWAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!" with vpunch
    mask "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22545
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4b13a74a:

    # you "Uh oh.."
    you "糟糕……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22547
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b19b6152:

    # mask "The local pimp, a 'Master of Assassins'... Ah... You're really killing me..."
    mask "当地的皮条客，一个“刺客大师”……啊……你真是要了我的命……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22549
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_05cee0da:

    # "He laughs cruelly, twisting the knife in your humiliation."
    "他冷笑着，在你羞辱的伤口上又添了一把火。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22551
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_947097b8:

    # mask "Do you take me for a fool? After months of spying on my sister, do you think I don't know exactly who works for the Palace, and in what capacity? You think I wouldn't notice a 'Master of Assassins' among them?"
    mask "你把我当傻子吗？我监视我妹妹几个月了，你以为我不知道宫里到底有哪些人，担任什么职务？你以为我连一个“刺客大师”都没注意到吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22553
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fc26bc2d:

    # "Things then happen all too quickly."
    "事情发生得太快了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22561
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_75ff50d7:

    # "Before you can move, the prince is upon you."
    "还没等你反应过来，王子已经扑了上来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22576
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_504264cc:

    # "[text1] to save you, but he is faster. His blades dance, too quick for the eye to follow."
    "[text1] 来救你，但他速度更快。他的刀刃飞舞，快到肉眼无法捕捉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22581
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a757071e:

    # kenshin "AAAARGH!!!" with vpunch
    kenshin "啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22583
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c81b8c23:

    # "Kenshin is gravely wounded."
    "剑心身负重伤。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22586
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7782f57b:

    # ninja.char "Aaaaah!!!" with vpunch
    ninja.char "啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22588
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_815de693:

    # "You alone are left standing, but not for long."
    "只剩下你一个人站着，但你也坚持不了多久了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22593
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0c141249:

    # "He slams the hilt of his sword into your solar plexus, knocking the air out of you."
    "他将剑柄猛击你的太阳穴，让你喘不过气来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22598
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f0362499:

    # "You collapse on the ground, writhing in pain. He kicks your head hard as you try to get up."
    "你瘫倒在地，痛苦地扭动着身体。你试图起身时，他狠狠地踢了你的头。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22600
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_abf12841:

    # mask "Thanks for the laugh, pimp... I'm not even going to waste time finishing you off."
    mask "谢谢你逗我笑，皮条客……我甚至懒得浪费时间解决你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22602
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5c3a107b:

    # mask "Let the fire take you. Or not. I don't care."
    mask "让火焰吞噬你吧。或者不吞噬也行。我不在乎。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22604
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9f399e93:

    # mask "As for you, sister..."
    mask "至于你，姐姐……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22606
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_94ddcd84:

    # "He raises one of his blades, pointing it at her chest."
    "他举起一把刀，指着她的胸口。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22612
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ec442bf8:

    # "The man gives you a long look of defiance."
    "那人带着挑衅的眼神，长时间地盯着你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22615
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_815da7c5:

    # mask blind "It seems your underling's foolish heroics have earned you a momentary reprieve, sister."
    mask blind "看来你手下愚蠢的英勇行为为你赢得了一线生机，姐姐。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22617
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_bf45650c:

    # mask "It seems your underling's foolish heroics have earned you a momentary reprieve, sister."
    mask "看来你手下愚蠢的英勇行为为你赢得了一线生机，姐姐。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22625
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ce4bd611:

    # "He sheathes his swords."
    "他将剑收回剑鞘。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22627
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_243ba636:

    # mask "But don't delude yourself, thinking you are beyond my reach."
    mask "但不要自欺欺人，以为你逃不出我的掌控。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22629
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_98b1e59b:

    # kuro "..."
    kuro "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22631
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b16739cc:

    # mask "Before you are wed, you will die. This I swear on the Gods - Old, Holy, and Dark."
    mask "你结婚之前就会死。我以诸神——古老、神圣、黑暗之神——的名义发誓。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22634
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b861fb81:

    # kenshin "I'll take your head, blasphemer!"
    kenshin "我要砍下你的脑袋，亵渎神明者！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22637
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_99ec2d47:

    # ninja.char "Let's end this now!"
    ninja.char "就此结束吧！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22639
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_968de649:

    # "You brace for another clash, but the fire growing around your group is becoming too close to ignore."
    "你做好了迎接另一场冲突的准备，但你们周围燃起的战火已经迫在眉睫，不容忽视。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22644
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_76484049:

    # "Suddenly, the fallen prince steps outside and vanishes into the night."
    "突然，落魄的王子走到外面，消失在夜色中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22648
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ce9dd143:

    # you "You! Get back here and fight!" with vpunch
    you "你！给我回来战斗！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22650
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_757e8706:

    # "The flames and smoke thicken, blurring your vision, and you can't see anything beyond the threshold."
    "火焰和浓烟越来越浓，视线变得模糊，你什么也看不见了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22652
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_773b6052:

    # "You move to pursue, when flaming debris crumbles from the ceiling, blocking your path."
    "你正要追赶，突然燃烧的碎片从天花板上掉落，挡住了你的去路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22654
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4669a36c:

    # "A hand weighs on your arm. It's the Princess, coughing and barely able to stand."
    "一只手压在你的胳膊上。是公主，她咳嗽着，几乎站都站不稳了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22659
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_118b0c99:

    # kuro "C-Come, [MC.name]. We need to get out of here!"
    kuro "C-来吧，[MC.name]。我们得离开这里！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22664
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c6307a8c:

    # "She waves her arm, casting an air spell that parts the flames. It reveals a path to the stairs."
    "她挥了挥手臂，施放了一个风系魔法，火焰瞬间分开，露出一条通往楼梯的小路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22666
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8065c72e:

    # you "So you are a trained caster."
    you "所以你是一位训练有素的施法者。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22668
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_952bedc9:

    # kuro "Hurry! This way!"
    kuro "快！这边走！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22681
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c58cfd34:

    # "You let [text1] cover your rear as you rush behind Kurohime."
    "你让[text1]掩护你的后背，然后冲到黑姬身后。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22684
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_2a993087:

    # "You spot Homura's unconscious body on the ground. Scooping her up, you run up the stairs."
    "你发现焰昏迷在地上。你抱起她，跑上楼梯。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22691
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1ddcc0ea:

    # "Smoke stings your eyes as you reach the top floor - when you hear a panicked scream."
    "当你到达顶层时，浓烟刺痛了你的眼睛——这时你听到一声惊恐的尖叫。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22695
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_3e4765e7:

    # kosmo "Heeeeeelp!!!" with vpunch
    kosmo "救命啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22699
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_78c05db3:

    # you "Kosmo?"
    you "科斯莫？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22701
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8bcca8b0:

    # "You are surprised to see Kosmo clinging to the balcony for dear life, a burning pit yawning beneath him."
    "你惊讶地发现科斯莫正死死地抓住阳台，脚下是一个燃烧的深渊。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22708
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0088dbbb:

    # "You let [text1] move ahead, and approach your wretched competitor."
    "你让[text1]先行一步，然后接近你那可怜的竞争对手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22710
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_55554762:

    # kosmo "[MC.name]! My good friend! S-Save me!!!" with vpunch
    kosmo "[MC.name]！我的好朋友！救救我！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22712
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5eba8477:

    # you "Well, look who it is... Last I saw, you were bound and gagged. I thought you lost."
    you "哟，瞧瞧这是谁……我上次见到你的时候，你还被绑着嘴呢。我还以为你输了呢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22714
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6b169ef4:

    # kosmo "A servant gave his life to free me, but the others just ran away! Ungrateful dogs!"
    kosmo "一个仆人为了救我献出了生命，而其他人却逃走了！这些忘恩负义的家伙！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22716
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8b300341:

    # kosmo "I was getting away, but the floor collapsed!"
    kosmo "我正要逃跑，结果地板塌了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22718
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ae0eba54:

    # kosmo "Please, [MC.name]! Help me! I swear I'll never cause you trouble again!"
    kosmo "[MC.name]，求求你！帮帮我！我发誓以后再也不会给你添麻烦了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22726
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ded551d9:

    # "With a sigh, you grab Kosmo's arm and haul him up."
    "你叹了口气，抓住科斯莫的胳膊，把他拉了起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22728
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9c934677:

    # you "I've helped you. Against my better judgement."
    you "我帮了你。虽然我觉得这样做不妥。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22730
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_0956490e:

    # kosmo "T-Thank you... !"
    kosmo "谢、谢谢！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22732
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f94aacd8:

    # kosmo "I- I'm... S-Sorry I tried to have your... Your dick cut off."
    kosmo "我……我……对不起，我试图……把你的……你的阴茎切掉。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22734
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4177faf5:

    # you "Get lost, damn it! And don't show up at my place ever again."
    you "滚开，该死的！永远别再来我家！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22738
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_66fddf94:

    # "Leaving Kosmo to navigate the fire, you try and catch up with the princess as she escapes through a window."
    "你留下 Kosmo 独自应对火灾，然后试图追上从窗户逃走的公主。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22745
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_762996da:

    # "Grinning from ear to ear, you walk up to him."
    "你咧着嘴，笑着走到他面前。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22747
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9b2b181f:

    # you "I've been waiting for this moment..."
    you "我一直在等待这一刻……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22749
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f7b02693:

    # kosmo "W-Wait! [MC.name]! I-In the name of Arios... D-D-Don't..."
    kosmo "等等！[MC.name]！以Arios的名义……别……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22751
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_209ad9a7:

    # kosmo "I-I know we haven't always gotten along, b-but... I swear, I will never bother you again!"
    kosmo "我知道我们以前相处得不太好，但是……我发誓，我以后再也不会打扰你了！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22753
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_2c88429c:

    # you "That's right. You won't."
    you "没错，你不会的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22761
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_137d8262:

    # kosmo "AAAAAAAARH!!!" with flash
    kosmo "啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！" with flash

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22763
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_44035a87:

    # "With a kick, you break the fragile railing, sending him tumbling down to his death."
    "你一脚踢断了脆弱的栏杆，让他坠落身亡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22767
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b132635e:

    # "Followed by Kosmo's screams of agony, you catch up with the princess as she escapes through a window."
    "伴随着科斯莫痛苦的尖叫声，你追上了正从窗户逃走的公主。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22774
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8a4c7786:

    # you "You're a big boy, Kosmo. I'm sure you'll figure it out. *shrug*"
    you "科斯莫，你是个大孩子了，我相信你肯定能搞定。*耸肩*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22776
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_114bbdcc:

    # kosmo "No, [MC.name], no!!! Don't leave me!"
    kosmo "不，[MC.name]，不要！！！别离开我！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22778
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_35be8c6c:

    # you "Consider this payback for all the times you came to my house and roasted me."
    you "这是对你之前无数次来我家嘲笑我的报复。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22780
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_606bce26:

    # you "This time, it's me coming to your house. But you can still roast!"
    you "这次轮到我去你家了。不过你还是可以尽情吐槽！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22782
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6f296dc5:

    # kosmo "[MC.name]! Come back here! You can't leave me, you whelp! Mother-"
    kosmo "[MC.name]！回来！你不能离开我，你这小崽子！妈妈——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22787
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5a9a87c9:

    # "Ignoring his ranting, you rejoin the princess as she escapes through a window."
    "你不理会他的咆哮，与公主会合，她正从窗户逃走。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22793
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c25cc2cd:

    # "From there, you are able to drop down and reach the courtyard, leaving the inferno behind."
    "从那里，你可以跳下去到达庭院，把火海抛在身后。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22798
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d51df701:

    # "You are quickly surrounded by the city watch and other men-at-arms, who were looking for the princess."
    "你很快就被城卫队和其他武装人员包围了，他们正在寻找公主。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22802
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_6e6b63ba:

    # "Before you have a chance to talk to her, you get rudely separated by a group of knights."
    "在你有机会和她说话之前，一群骑士粗暴地将你们分开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22804
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d226fd3c:

    # "Exhausted, you make your way back to the brothel."
    "你筋疲力尽地回到了妓院。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22814
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_517c1b6d:

    # "Wounded, there is nothing you can do now except watch in horror."
    "身负重伤的你，现在除了眼睁睁地看着，什么也做不了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22818
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a951a6a6:

    # "You watch helplessly from afar, unable to intervene."
    "你只能无助地远远看着，无法介入。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22822
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_c4c371d7:

    # mask "Forgive me, sister. 'Tis best it be done quickly."
    mask "请原谅我，姐姐。最好尽快解决。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22827
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_2e97c9a0:

    # "He lunges, and his blade pierces Kurohime's chest."
    "他猛地扑过去，刀刃刺穿了黑姬的胸膛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22831
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b5c8333e:

    # kuro "AAAAH!!!"
    kuro "啊啊！！！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22835
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_da0c595f:

    # you "NOOO!!!" with vpunch
    you "不！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22840
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e5fc5123:

    # "Kenshin howls in rage and anguish."
    "剑心愤怒而痛苦地嚎叫起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22842
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_bd6b8564:

    # "Time stands still for a moment. Then the unexpected happens."
    "时间仿佛静止了片刻。然后，意想不到的事情发生了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22851
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_4a2c0bd4:

    # "A supernatural wind chills your soul, snuffing all the flames out as if it was a campfire."
    "一阵超自然的风吹得你灵魂冰冷，仿佛熄灭了篝火一般，所有的火焰都随之消逝。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22853
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5b283250:

    # "Around you, the darkness is thick with presence, as if malicious shadows were whispering forbidden words into your ears."
    "你周围，黑暗中弥漫着浓重的气息，仿佛有邪恶的阴影在你耳边低语着禁忌的话语。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22855
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_25fe91a6:

    # "An inhuman shriek fills you with primal dread. But it doesn't come from the princess. It comes from the prince."
    "一声非人的尖叫让你感到原始的恐惧。但这尖叫声并非来自公主，而是来自王子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22859
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_5092d7f2:

    # mask "AAAARH!!! IT BURNS!!!" with flash
    mask "啊啊啊！！！好烫！！！" with flash

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22865
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b59ebb33:

    # "You cannot see him in the dark, but you hear his blades clatter to the floor."
    "在黑暗中你看不见他，但你能听到他的刀刃掉落在地上的哐当声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22867
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_483818c2:

    # "Then, his figure stumbles into view, framed by moonlight, hands clawing at his face as he moans in agony."
    "然后，他的身影踉跄地出现在视野中，月光勾勒出他的轮廓，他双手抓挠着自己的脸，痛苦地呻吟着。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22873
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1ddd3884:

    # "He disappears into the night, and you hear the sound of a woman's heavy breathing."
    "他消失在夜色中，你听到一个女人沉重的呼吸声。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22875
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_e543add9:

    # you "What the hell! P-Princess???" with vpunch
    you "什么鬼！P公主？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22877
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_fb0cf818:

    # "You can't see her, but the wound she suffered leaves you little hope."
    "你看不见她，但她所受的伤让你几乎看不到希望。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22883
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_9f62c9e0:

    # "You collapse as the world fades around you. Somewhere, voices shout. Soldiers. Knights."
    "你瘫倒在地，周围的世界渐渐消失。某个地方，传来喊叫声。士兵。骑士。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22885
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a9ce4a1e:

    # you "Kuro... Kurohime..."
    you "黑……黑姬……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22891
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b3785f8c:

    # "Everything goes black."
    "眼前一片漆黑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22896
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_35a5b1c7:

    # "When you finally wake up, you're behind bars."
    "当你最终醒来时，你发现自己身陷囹圄。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22901
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_198f99fa:

    # "Before you can move, someone approaches."
    "还没等你反应过来，就有人走了过来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22905
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d6448845:

    # knight "Get up. You're free to go."
    knight "起来吧，你可以走了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22907
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_a577ad0e:

    # you "What?"
    you "什么?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22909
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_06b30ab2:

    # knight "The Princess vouched for you. I was just waiting for you to wake up, so that I could let you go."
    knight "公主为你担保了。我一直在等你醒来，好放你走。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22911
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_00686ac9:

    # you "The Princess? She's alive? How?" with vpunch
    you "公主？她还活着？怎么可能？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22913
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_f78bb903:

    # knight "We don't know. She was in a bad way when we found you."
    knight "我们不知道。我们找到你的时候，她情况很糟糕。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22918
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_3ef58232:

    # "Pain wracks your body as you stand. Your wound has been crudely bandaged, but your whole body hurts like hell."
    "你站着，全身剧痛难忍。伤口只是粗略地包扎了一下，但你感觉全身都痛得要命。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22925
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_7626bb38:

    # you "You found me?"
    you "你找到我了？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22927
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b6f4841b:

    # knight "Yup. Some blue-haired wench with funny ears was spotted trying to drag you through the back alley. She bolted, leaving you lying in the dust."
    knight "没错。有个蓝头发、长着滑稽耳朵的女人，被人看到想把你拖进后巷。她拔腿就跑，把你丢在尘土里。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22930
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_d831122a:

    # knight "You were wounded, but alive."
    knight "你受了伤，但还活着。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22932
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b8fc040c:

    # you "Suzume... Grrr."
    you "苏梅……咕噜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22938
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_90796e0e:

    # you "T-The Princess is fine, then?"
    you "公主殿下没事吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22940
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_cd224697:

    # knight "Fine? No. She was badly hurt. The royal surgeon said she'll live, but she lost a lot of blood."
    knight "她没事吧？不，她伤得很重。皇家外科医生说她能活下来，但她失血过多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22944
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_05427a5b:

    # knight "You're very lucky she survived, you know. We thought you were the attacker at first."
    knight "她能活下来真是太幸运了。我们一开始还以为你是袭击者呢。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22946
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_b269815e:

    # knight "The King was going to have you quartered and hung by your bowels, first thing in the morning."
    knight "国王原本打算第二天一早把你五马分尸，然后把你倒吊起来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22948
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_8040c233:

    # you "*gulp*"
    you "*咽口水*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22950
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ade911fc:

    # knight "The Princess was looking for you after she woke, but she was in no shape to talk to anyone. She must rest."
    knight "公主醒来后就一直在找你，但她现在状态很差，没法跟任何人说话。她需要休息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22952
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_44b8f4fd:

    # you "What will happen now?"
    you "接下来会发生什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22954
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_59f0a0fb:

    # knight "The princess is in no shape to tend to her duties. It will be months before she can leave her bedside."
    knight "公主身体状况不佳，无法履行公务。她至少要卧床数月才能离开病床。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22958
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_ea82308b:

    # knight "Dark days are about to come..."
    knight "黑暗的日子即将到来……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22960
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22965
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_07af00ca:

    # "Eager to escape this place, you part with the knight and head out."
    "你急于逃离此地，与骑士告别后便离开了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:22967
translate chinese_simplified c3_confrontation_shiro_1df5b616:

    # "You were hoping to catch a breather, but something foul is in the air. And it isn't just the dungeon's stench."
    "你原本希望喘口气，但空气中弥漫着一股难闻的气息。而且这不仅仅是地牢的恶臭。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23021
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_a41a4f49:

    # "Sweat blurs your vision. You jump with fear as something moves in the fire in front of you, right where the flames are the thickest."
    "汗水模糊了你的视线。你惊恐地跳了起来，因为你看到面前火焰最浓的地方，有什么东西在动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23025
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_0527f5af:

    # "Voice" "[MC.name]..."
    "嗓音" "[MC.name]..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23027
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_4e05bf1e:

    # you "W-Who?"
    you "谁？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23031
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_a8efbc3f:

    # "Booming voice" "[MC.name]!!!" with vpunch
    "洪亮的声音" "[MC.name]!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23033
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_d45b8eac:

    # "In awe, you see a shape form out of the fire itself, until it coalesces to form a towering creature."
    "你惊叹地看到一个形状从火焰中逐渐形成，直到它凝聚成一个高耸的生物。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23040
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_bd29dd25:

    # "Commanding voice" "Come, Son, I beseech you."
    "威严的声音" "Come, Son, I beseech you."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23042
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_77e8444f:

    # "A fire elemental stands before you, taller than the mightiest ogre. Liquid fire seeps through his many wounds, as if it was fiery blood."
    "一个火元素生物站在你面前，比最强大的食人魔还要高大。液态火焰从他身上的众多伤口渗出，仿佛是燃烧的血液。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23044
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_0fabb1cf:

    # "But you know that these gaping wounds do not make him weaker. Instead, they burn with the inexhaustible fire of Bravery and Truth."
    "但你知道，这些触目惊心的伤口并不会让他变得软弱。相反，它们燃烧着勇气和真理永不熄灭的火焰。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23046
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_dbe5ec4d:

    # "For even though you have never met this creature, you have seen its depiction in scripture numerous times, and its likeness in temples and churches."
    "虽然你从未见过这种生物，但你在经文中多次看到过它的描述，在寺庙和教堂中也见过它的形象。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23050
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_59fac919:

    # "Before you stands the Lightbringer, mighty Avatar of Arios."
    "站在你面前的是光明使者，强大的阿里奥斯化身。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23056
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_1b762b86:

    # "Hellfire voice" "Bow before Me, mortal..."
    "地狱之火之声" "Bow before Me, mortal..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23058
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_b6f1484b:

    # "A fiery beast stands before you, a mess of hound heads, horns and claws."
    "一头喷火的野兽站在你面前，它由无数的猎犬头颅、犄角和利爪组成。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23060
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_5474cd89:

    # "Its cruel, supernatural gaze pierces your soul. You fall on your knees."
    "它那残酷而超自然的目光刺穿了你的灵魂。你跪倒在地。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23062
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_73f97ce4:

    # "For while its sudden appearance had shaken you to the core, the beast is in no way unknown to you."
    "虽然它的突然出现让你感到无比震惊，但你对这头野兽并非一无所知。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23066
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_9affa52d:

    # "You have seen numerous popular depictions of the beast. Before you stands Cerberus, mighty Avatar of Arios."
    "你已经见过许多关于这头怪兽的流行描绘。在你面前的是刻耳柏洛斯，阿里俄斯的强大化身。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23068
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_56ca1585:

    # "Sheltering your eyes with your hand, you answer its call with a broken voice."
    "你用手遮住双眼，用破碎的声音回应它的呼唤。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23070
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_7626f778:

    # you "Lord Arios?"
    you "阿瑞奥斯大人？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23072
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_e24a3082:

    # "Arios" "Listen, my follower, for we have little time."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "听着，我的追随者，我们时间不多了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23074
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_3ea0b6a9:

    # "Arios" "My Shield has broken. Impious beasts covet the Jewel of My Crown."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "我的盾牌已破碎。邪恶的野兽觊觎我王冠上的宝石。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23076
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_b82aa18b:

    # you "Your shield? Your crown?"
    you "你的盾牌？你的王冠？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23078
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_08d5df1d:

    # "The words sound familar, but your soul is too overwhelmed by the crushing power of the apparition to make sense of them."
    "这些话听起来很熟悉，但你的灵魂被幻象的强大力量压倒，无法理解它们的含义。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23080
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_59afdbf4:

    # "Arios" "A Champion will rise tonight, another will fall. It does not matter which: the Balance is already broken."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "今晚将诞生一位冠军，也将有一位冠军陨落。但结果如何并不重要：平衡已被打破。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23082
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_aea02cab:

    # "Arios" "Before the Light Festival, it befalls to you to right the Balance of fire and steel."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "在光明节之前，你肩负着平衡火与钢之力的重任。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23084
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_4e9d48de:

    # you "M-Me? H-How?"
    you "我？怎？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23086
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_b45ed014:

    # "Arios" "When the time comes, you will know. Remember My words: fire brings purity. Scorched earth will yet bear the best fruit."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "时机一到，你们自然会明白。记住我的话：烈火带来纯洁，焦土终将结出最美的果实。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23088
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_6fe59f9c:

    # you "Fire brings purity... Scorched earth..."
    you "火带来纯洁……焦土……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23090
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_629d3497:

    # "Arios" "Heed my words. Your choice will seal the fate of Zan forever."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "听从我的话。你的选择将永远决定赞恩的命运。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23094
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_2606fb68:

    # "Arios" "If your heart is true, you may yet protect this city and the faithful in it. *rumble*"
    "阿瑞奥斯" "如果你心怀真诚，或许还能保卫这座城市和其中的信徒。*隆隆声*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23098
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_e7c49f57:

    # "Arios" "Righteous fire may yet claim this city. And you can be the one fanning the flames of a glorious sacrifice... *hiss*"
    "阿瑞奥斯" "正义之火终将吞噬这座城市。而你，或许就是那煽动光荣牺牲之火的人……*嘶嘶*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23100
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_0cf87d85:

    # you "Lord Arios."
    you "阿瑞俄斯大人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23102
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_b7c4b73a:

    # "Arios" "But the choice will be yours only. Answer me, child."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "但最终的选择权只在你手中。回答我，孩子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23104
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_38e55369:

    # "Arios" "Do you intend to save Zan, or let it be consumed fow a new dawn?"
    "阿瑞奥斯" "你打算拯救赞恩，还是任其毁灭，迎接新的黎明？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23107
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_11fdb519:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23113
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_b19fb4e5:

    # you "Even though I am a foreigner, this city and its people gave me a new start."
    you "虽然我是个外国人，但这座城市和这里的人们给了我新的开始。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23115
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_f2736e4b:

    # you "I will lend my strength to their aid."
    you "我将尽我所能帮助他们。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23117
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_d8914f51:

    # "Arios" "So be it. Let the Light guide your hand in this choice."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "就这么办吧。让光明指引你做出选择。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23123
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_1c49331f:

    # you "This wretched place is crumbling under the weight of its own filth and lucre. There is no saving it."
    you "这个破败的地方正在被自身的污秽和贪婪压垮，已经无可救药了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23125
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_22fdf1fd:

    # you "I shall bring my own match to the powder keg."
    you "我将自带火柴去引爆火药桶。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23127
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_6241146a:

    # "Arios" "So be it. Let the Fire purify all so you can start anew."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "就让烈火净化一切，使你们能够重新开始。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23132
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_d770c37b:

    # you "I don't understand enough about the situation to decide yet."
    you "我对情况了解不够，暂时无法做出决定。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23134
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_c25b5b76:

    # you "I'm still weighing my options."
    you "我还在权衡各种选择。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23136
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_d3f598b0:

    # "Arios" "Do not wait too long to make up your mind, lest you too become fuel for the pyre."
    "阿瑞奥斯" "不要犹豫太久才做决定，以免你也成为火刑柱上的燃料。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23143
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_a69cf014:

    # "The God vanishes in a puff of embers and smoke. As quickly as it appeared, the vision is gone. You are left utterly confused."
    "神像化作一缕余烬和烟雾消失了。幻象出现得快，消失得也快。你顿时感到无比困惑。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23145
translate chinese_simplified c3_arios_vision_3e23f0e5:

    # you "What does Arios want me to do? What was it about the Shield, the Crown Jewel, and the Champion? What must happen at the Light Festival?"
    you "阿瑞欧斯想让我做什么？盾牌、皇冠宝石和冠军之间到底有什么关系？光明节上究竟会发生什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23154
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_with_shiro_db6c2304:

    # homura sepia "Oh! Ah! Aaaaah!!!" with vpunch
    homura sepia "哦！啊！啊啊啊！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23158
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_with_shiro_f48fe0a1:

    # "Soon after the wounded warrior woke from his injuries, he threw himself at Homura, shoving her clothing aside."
    "受伤的战士醒来后不久，就扑向焰，一把扯开她的衣服。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23164
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_with_shiro_aec5b6a0:

    # homura ninja "W-What are we doing... Aaaah!"
    homura ninja "我们到底在做什么……啊！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23166
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_with_shiro_05a06b4b:

    # "Still under the adrenaline rush from the fight, they soon found themselves in the throes of passion."
    "战斗带来的肾上腺素飙升尚未消退，他们很快就陷入了激情之中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:23170
translate chinese_simplified c3_homura_with_shiro_6ae3d402:

    # homura "Oh, yes... Fuck me..." with vpunch
    homura "哦，是的……操我……" with vpunch

