translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_16f17cb0:

    # kuro "I don't know myself what happened... I felt the steel bite in my chest, but then..."
    kuro "我自己也不知道发生了什么……我感觉胸口像被钢铁狠狠地刺了一下，但随后……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24071
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_f587dd44:

    # kuro "It felt like time stopped. My body was hot from the fire, and cold where the blade had struck."
    kuro "时间仿佛静止了。我的身体被火烧得滚烫，刀刃划过的地方却冰冷刺骨。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24075
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_896fa14b:

    # kuro "But the strangest thing was, I could see myself through his eyes, too."
    kuro "但最奇怪的是，我也能透过他的眼睛看到自己。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24077
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_87839c0a:

    # kuro "It's like we were connected through his sword. His thoughts and horror mirrored mine."
    kuro "仿佛我们通过他的剑联系在了一起。他的想法和恐惧与我的如出一辙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24081
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_4c0146e7:

    # kuro "But... We were not alone."
    kuro "但是……我们并不孤单。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24083
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_59e6c5e6:

    # you "Not alone?"
    you "并非孤身一人？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24085
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_11b14f23:

    # kuro "There was a dark force lurking behind him, I could feel its hunger... Thirsting for blood, my blood... And even my soul..."
    kuro "他身后潜伏着一股黑暗力量，我能感觉到它的饥渴……渴望鲜血，我的鲜血……甚至我的灵魂……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24087
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a577ad0e:

    # you "What?"
    you "什么?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24089
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_27a4dbd8:

    # kuro "But then, something arose from deep within me. A wrathful being of fire and crimson. Through my brother's eyes, I could see it rise where I stood."
    kuro "但随后，我体内深处涌起一股力量。那是一个怒火熊熊、血红炽烈的存在。透过哥哥的眼睛，我看到它在我站立的地方升起。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24091
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_dd42ad04:

    # kuro "The spirits fought with fury, like a hot and cold wave clashing."
    kuro "两个精灵激烈地争斗着，就像冷热两股浪潮相互碰撞。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24097
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_9dfe70e0:

    # kuro "But eventually, mine won, and the dark force retreated, hissing in anger."
    kuro "但最终，我的力量取得了胜利，黑暗势力愤怒地嘶嘶作响，退却了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24099
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_ec99f4fd:

    # kuro "It was over in a fleeting moment, but for me it felt like I had been trapped in there for an eternity, suffocating, drowning in my own blood."
    kuro "一切都在转瞬即逝，但对我来说，却感觉像被困在那里一个世纪那么久，窒息而亡，溺死在自己的血泊中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24101
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2d3fc23f:

    # kuro "The blade withdrew my chest, and I could finally breathe."
    kuro "刀刃划开了我的胸膛，我终于可以呼吸了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24108
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_38c5f12d:

    # you "So... You're saying a supernatural being of pure bright energy rose to your defense, and stayed the assassin's hand?"
    you "所以……你的意思是说，一个由纯粹明亮能量构成的超自然存在挺身而出保护你，阻止了刺客的攻击？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24110
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_dd8bbf84:

    # kuro "Yes."
    kuro "是的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24113
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_5124301f:

    # you "It sounds like our Lord Arios was on your side, then, Light bless Him."
    you "听起来我们的主阿里奥斯是站在你这边的，愿光明保佑他。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24115
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_f218c255:

    # kuro "I guess so..."
    kuro "大概吧..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24118
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_4a042a47:

    # you "Sounds like Arios-worshipper mumbo-jumbo to me..."
    you "听起来像是Arios信徒的胡言乱语……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24120
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_00b167b8:

    # kuro "Well, I survived, didn't I? I have no better explanation for you."
    kuro "好吧，我活下来了，不是吗？我实在没有更好的解释了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24122
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_15271dee:

    # kuro "This all ties in with the dark story I'm about to tell you..."
    kuro "这一切都与我接下来要讲述的黑暗故事息息相关……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24125
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_b0777a8c:

    # kuro "There is more to this, though."
    kuro "但这其中还有更多隐情。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24127
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_fec1fe3c_1:

    # you "What do you mean?"
    you "你是什么意思?"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24129
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_6b85fb50:

    # kuro "Do you remember that my spells couldn't harm him?"
    kuro "你还记得我的魔法伤不了他吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24131
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_89a060e2:

    # kuro "I harbor over half a dozen wards of protection, woven by the most gifted mages in the city."
    kuro "我拥有超过六道防护结界，它们都是由城里最有天赋的法师编织的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24133
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_276e40b5:

    # kuro "It should have been enough to stop him from lifting even a finger against me."
    kuro "这本应足以阻止他连一根手指头都不敢对我动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24136
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_97cdf05e:

    # you "True. Even an archmage would have struggled."
    you "没错。即使是大法师也会感到棘手。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24138
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_fb691a80:

    # you "I don't know, magic is fickle..."
    you "我不知道，魔法这东西变幻莫测……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24140
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_e073a198:

    # kuro "When it all happened, I saw something."
    kuro "事情发生的时候，我看到了一些东西。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24142
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_ecc7e97b:

    # you "Saw something? What did you see?"
    you "你看到什么了吗？你看到了什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24144
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_ce1f1f99:

    # kuro "The wounds he suffered should have been grievous, but he tapped into another power to shun them off."
    kuro "他所受的伤本应十分严重，但他却运用了另一种力量来化解这些伤痛。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24146
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2231ce5d:

    # kuro "I only briefly saw it, but there was this dark shadow looming over him... Taller than a golem, hissing and waving like smoke wisps."
    kuro "我只瞥见了一眼，但他头顶上笼罩着一个黑影……比魔像还要高大，嘶嘶作响，像缕缕轻烟般飘动。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24148
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_be2dc33d:

    # you "What do you suggest?"
    you "你有什么建议？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24150
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_9e9f0ed3:

    # kuro "Look, [MC.name]. There' something you must know about my family."
    kuro "听着，[MC.name]。关于我的家庭，有些事你必须知道。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24152
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_147c92e2:

    # you "Must I? I feel like I already know too much, Your Highness."
    you "我必须这样做吗？我觉得我已经知道得太多了，殿下。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24154
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2869213a:

    # kuro "Correct. That makes you an asset, but also a loose end. You're involved, whether you like it or not."
    kuro "没错。这让你既是宝贵的资产，也是个隐患。不管你愿不愿意，你都身在其中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24156
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_ace1c00f:

    # kuro "Now, listen. It is a troubling story."
    kuro "听着，这是一个令人不安的故事。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24164
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_02cfa408:

    # kuro "Before my father conquered Zan and laid waste to the old regime's power structures, he was just a rebel commander leading a ragtag army."
    kuro "在我父亲征服赞恩并摧毁旧政权的权力结构之前，他只是一个领导着一支乌合之众的叛军指挥官。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24166
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7cd30e14:

    # kuro "He got caught by the loyalists at the foot of the Arik mountains, and was wounded in a terrible battle."
    kuro "他在阿里克山脚下被效忠派俘虏，并在一场惨烈的战斗中负伤。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24168
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_6a5caa31:

    # kuro "He ended up cornered in the valley below, and would have perished with his army if he didn't lead a daring escape across the mountains."
    kuro "他最终被困在山谷下方，如果不是带领军队大胆地翻越群山，他就会和他的军队一起丧命。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24170
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_3ee9dbe7:

    # kuro "This is now the stuff of legend, and everyone knows of his 'Long March'. Crossing the Arik mountains in the heart of winter was supposed to be an impossible task, and he was wounded to boot."
    kuro "这如今已成为传奇，人人都知道他的“长征”。在严冬时节穿越阿里克山脉被认为是一项不可能完成的任务，而且他还身负重伤。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24172
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_4fa91394:

    # kuro "Nevertheless, he did cross them, and was able to take Zan by storm, undefended, when spring came."
    kuro "然而，他还是越过了他们，并在春天到来时攻占了毫无防备的赞城。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24178
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_1d09602c:

    # kuro "This tale I often heard as a child. While it was a staple of official propaganda, I also heard it told by actual veterans of the long march."
    kuro "我小时候经常听到这个故事。虽然它是官方宣传的常用素材，但我也从参加过长征的老兵口中听过。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24180
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2bc1d728:

    # kuro "But there is a darker tale. Of {i}how{/i} he survived out there in the mountains."
    kuro "但还有一个更黑暗的故事，讲述了他如何在山里生存下来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24182
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_8335f643:

    # kuro "It was only spoken of in hushed tones. Getting caught telling it was liable to land one in jail, or worse."
    kuro "这件事只能低声细语地谈论。一旦被发现泄露出去，就可能面临牢狱之灾，甚至更糟。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24184
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2cae1d87:

    # kuro "Nevertheless, I heard this story, even when I wasn't meant to. It was told behind closed doors, it even became a kind of folk's tale; some of the political factions that opposed my father made sure it could spread."
    kuro "然而，即便我不该听到这个故事，我还是听到了。它是在私下里流传的，甚至变成了一种民间传说；一些反对我父亲的政治派别确保它能够传播开来。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24186
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c2b2346a:

    # kuro "I heard variations of this tale as horror stories, jokes, drunk late-night confessions or parables, but the key points remain the same."
    kuro "我听过这个故事的各种版本，有恐怖故事、笑话、深夜醉酒忏悔，也有寓言故事，但关键点始终不变。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24188
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2c915054:

    # you "Tell me then."
    you "那你告诉我吧。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24190
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_33309294:

    # kuro "When my father started his ascent of the Arik mountains' highest peak, Mount Kumo, he was famished and had lost a lot of blood."
    kuro "当我父亲开始攀登阿里克山脉最高峰云霄峰时，他饥肠辘辘，而且失血过多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24192
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7d1f5393:

    # you "Mount Kumo... I've heard tales about it. They say even mountain goats fall to their death on its treacherous paths."
    you "云雾山……我听说过很多关于它的传说。据说就连山羊都会在它险峻的山路上坠亡。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24194
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_083b053a:

    # kuro "He would never have made it, if he hadn't run into an ancient cave..."
    kuro "如果不是误入一个古老的山洞，他肯定活不下去……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24201
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_b7925805:

    # kuro "My father took his army forward into the darkness, confident that they would find a way to the other side."
    kuro "我的父亲率领他的军队进入黑暗之中，他坚信他们一定能找到通往彼岸的道路。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24203
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_8bc9f705:

    # kuro "More than one soldier in his army thought him mad. There were desertions and mutiny, he had the leaders put to the sword."
    kuro "他军队里不止一个士兵认为他疯了。出现了逃兵和叛变，他下令处死了那些首领。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24207
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_64b390ba:

    # kuro "Going down, they found the half-buried corridors of an old structure. Cimerian-made. But even that was built upon the ruins of something much older..."
    kuro "他们向下走，发现了一座古老建筑半掩埋的走廊。那是西米里安人建造的。但即便如此，它也是建在更古老建筑的废墟之上……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24209
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_d9134fd1:

    # kuro "After a week, they were utterly lost in the darkness. Running on empty bellies, my father's men didn't even have the nerves to rebel anymore."
    kuro "一周后，他们彻底迷失在黑暗中。饥肠辘辘的我父亲的手下，连反抗的勇气都没有了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24211
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_b6e08eee:

    # kuro "It is there, in the darkness, where my father saw a single flicker of light. A single candelabra was burning at the center of a gigantic stone hall, without a soul around to maintain it."
    kuro "就在那里，在黑暗中，我父亲看到了一丝微弱的光芒。一盏烛台孤零零地燃烧在一座巨大石厅的中央，周围空无一人，无人照看。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24213
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_53aff28b:

    # kuro "Something overtook my father's mind, and he kneeled by the flame to pray and made a pledge."
    kuro "我父亲突然心神不宁，跪在火堆旁祈祷并发誓。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24215
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_f11390a9:

    # kuro "A day later, he and his army came out of the cave on the other side of Mount Kumo, unharmed."
    kuro "一天后，他和他的军队毫发无损地从云山另一侧的山洞里出来了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24221
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_0ae951ec:

    # kuro "Only half his men made it out alive of the dark cave. But the survivors would remain loyal to the last."
    kuro "他的手下只有一半活着走出了黑暗的洞穴。但幸存者们会至死忠心耿耿。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24223
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_10afdb77:

    # you "What happened down there?"
    you "下面发生了什么事？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24225
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_18dfe75c:

    # kuro "They said he made a pact with a spirit from the gaping abyss below Mount Kumo. A spirit older than the mountain itself."
    kuro "他们说他与云山下方深渊中的一个精灵订立了契约。这个精灵比云山本身还要古老。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24227
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_f4a1ddeb:

    # kuro "It was there when the Goliaths were roaming Xeros and sentient species were just cattle."
    kuro "它存在于歌利亚人横行泽罗斯大陆，而智慧物种只是牲畜的时代。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24229
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_9dd19d66:

    # you "A spirit?"
    you "幽灵？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24231
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_68b608dd:

    # kuro "Not just any wild spirit. From its depiction, I gather that it might have been a creature scholars refer to as... An Archdemon."
    kuro "这并非普通的野性精灵。从它的描述来看，我推测它可能是学者们所说的……大恶魔。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24233
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_48375dab:

    # you "What? Your father made a pact with an Archdemon?"
    you "什么？你父亲竟然和恶魔领主签订了契约？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24235
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_253e0100:

    # kuro "So the story says. A blood pact."
    kuro "故事是这么说的。这是一场血盟。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24238
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_4f69fbd8:

    # you "Nothing good can come of meddling with such evil spirits!"
    you "与这些邪灵打交道绝不会有任何好处！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24240
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c440f99a:

    # kuro "And yet some good came of it, at first."
    kuro "然而，起初也确实带来了一些好处。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24243
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7f45592d:

    # you "A blood pact requires a sacrifice in blood or kin. The greater the spirit, the higher the cost."
    you "血盟需要以血或亲属作为祭品。神灵越强大，代价越高。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24245
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_6e7bd364:

    # kuro "Precisely."
    kuro "确实如此。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24248
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_e3bd101c:

    # you "Gambling with the devil... I like it! Your father is a bold man."
    you "与魔鬼赌博……我喜欢！你父亲真是个胆大的人。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24250
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7a6fa7b4:

    # kuro "Was. He's but a shade of his former self."
    kuro "曾经是。他如今只剩下昔日风采的影子了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24252
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_9d2597ae:

    # you "What were the terms of their deal?"
    you "他们的交易条款是什么？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24254
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_97b3cc18:

    # kuro "There are variations, but most forms of the tale say this: my father requested safe passage for his troops and himself, and power. The power that would make him a King."
    kuro "故事版本虽有多种，但大多数版本都讲述的是：我的父亲请求确保他和他的军队安全通行，并请求获得权力。那份能让他成为国王的权力。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24256
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_b89ad401:

    # you "Well, it seems he got his end of the bargain... What did the spirit want in exchange?"
    you "看来他如愿以偿了……那鬼魂想要什么交换呢？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24258
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_1b35f416:

    # kuro "In exchange..."
    kuro "作为交换……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24263
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_3767fc7c:

    # "It may be your imagination, but suddenly the lights dim, and all the room's candles flicker without a modicum of wind."
    "也许只是你的错觉，但突然间灯光变暗了，房间里所有的蜡烛都在微风中摇曳。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24265
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_9406c8c4:

    # kuro "He pledged to give his firstborn son over to the dark spirit."
    kuro "他发誓要将自己的长子献给邪灵。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24267
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_cdacc017:

    # you "His firstborn son???" with vpunch
    you "他的长子？？？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24269
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_1d5acff0:

    # kuro "Yes. He would give his firstborn to a soul-devouring demon, in exchange for a taste of absolute power."
    kuro "是的。他甚至愿意把自己的长子献给一个吞噬灵魂的恶魔，以换取绝对权力的滋味。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24271
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_178fc7f9:

    # "You shiver. Kurohime seems unphased, but you can feel the turmoil under the surface as she utters these words."
    "你打了个寒颤。黑姬表面上似乎毫不在意，但你能感觉到她话语间隐藏的波澜。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24273
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_712377c6:

    # you "Do... Do you believe this?"
    you "你……你相信这个吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24275
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_700cbc16:

    # kuro "'Not at all'... Would have been my answer, only a few days ago."
    kuro "“完全不是”……就在几天前，这还会是我的回答。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24277
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c71a3a9f:

    # kuro "After all, he didn't have a living son. Or so I thought."
    kuro "毕竟，他没有在世的儿子。至少我是这么认为的。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24279
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c1b1b86b:

    # kuro "But then, I met my brother. And now I have to see all of my father's actions in a new light."
    kuro "但是，后来我遇到了我的哥哥。现在，我不得不以全新的视角来看待我父亲的所有行为。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24281
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_b3e6e938:

    # you "You... You don't think your brother is harboring a demon, do you?"
    you "你……你不会认为你哥哥体内藏着恶魔吧？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24283
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7c9e695b:

    # kuro "No! I mean... I hope not."
    kuro "不！我的意思是……我希望不是。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24285
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_64de886d:

    # kuro "But if he was 'pledged' to the evil spirit of Mount Kumo, whatever that means, it might be the reason why demons are so interested in him."
    kuro "但如果他真的“效忠”了云山的邪灵（不管这意味着什么），那可能就是恶魔对他如此感兴趣的原因。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24287
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_28740be4:

    # kuro "I think his fate is linked to the Archdemon... And mine."
    kuro "我认为他的命运与大恶魔息息相关……也与我的命运息息相关。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24291
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a56197a8:

    # you "Your Majesty, uhm... Why are you telling me all of this?"
    you "陛下，呃……您为什么要告诉我这些？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24293
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7545c9b0:

    # kuro "Well, [MC.name]. You harbor knowledge about state affairs that only a handful of people in the Realm are privy to."
    kuro "[MC.name]，你掌握着只有极少数人才能了解的国事信息。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24295
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_bf847302:

    # kuro "So now, I have to make a choice: turn you into my confidant... Or have you killed."
    kuro "所以现在，我必须做出选择：把你变成我的知己……还是杀了你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24297
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_96e89d77:

    # kuro "I've decided that I prefer the first option."
    kuro "我决定选择第一个方案。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24299
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_cdd4b4e2:

    # you "As do I. *gulp*"
    you "我也是。*咕咚*"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24301
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a03cf343:

    # kuro "Good. In part, it's because I need you to help me get to the bottom of this. There are not many people I can trust with this kind of information, or that would believe it."
    kuro "很好。部分原因是，我需要你帮我弄清这件事的真相。这类信息，我能信任的人不多，或者说，会相信这些信息的人也不多。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24303
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_0af68ccf:

    # kuro "But there is something else."
    kuro "但还有别的事情发生。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24305
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_531f8486:

    # kuro "You see, [MC.name], ever since we met-"
    kuro "你看，[MC.name]，自从我们相遇以来——"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24309
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_5816ee83:

    # guard "GIVE WAY!!! GIVE WAY!!!" with vpunch
    guard "让开！！！让开！！！" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24313
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_bbf3681a:

    # "You hear a commotion outside, and the doors blast open."
    "你听到外面传来一阵骚动，大门猛地被推开。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24315
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_7276bbd8:

    # "Royal Guards pour into the room, bringing a single man forward."
    "皇家卫兵涌入房间，带出一名男子。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24320
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a7f0cb43:

    # lost_soldier "P-Princess Kurohime..."
    lost_soldier "P-公主黑姬..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24322
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_46c4432b:

    # "You wonder why the guards look so worried. The man before you is rather pitiful, a boy really, his simple clothing torn and dusty."
    "你纳闷守卫们为何如此忧心忡忡。你面前的这个人颇为可怜，其实还是个孩子，衣衫褴褛，沾满了灰尘。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24324
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_70298593:

    # "He looks like he hasn't rested in days, and is about to collapse from exhaustion."
    "他看起来好像好几天没休息了，快要累倒了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24326
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_5b62066c:

    # kuro "Wait, I know you... Aren't you a knight?"
    kuro "等等，我认识你……你不是骑士吗？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24328
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_38fd482b:

    # you "(Wait, this wretch... a Knight?)"
    you "（等等，这家伙……居然是个骑士？）"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24330
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_e2f6098e:

    # lost_soldier "N-No, you Highness, merely a squire... I was with the First Army."
    lost_soldier "不，殿下，我只是个侍从……我曾是第一军的一员。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24332
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_dbfdf018:

    # lost_soldier "I came straight from the Holy Lands. I rode for three nights and three days. It killed my horse."
    lost_soldier "我直接从圣地赶来，骑马走了三天三夜，结果马累死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24334
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_51abfc24:

    # kuro "Speak, Squire. What' wa's so important that you would come and disturb me at this hour?"
    kuro "先生，请说。究竟是什么事如此重要，以至于您在这个时间前来打扰我？"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24336
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_595cdd7b:

    # lost_soldier "Your Majesty..."
    lost_soldier "陛下..."

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24338
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_5aa47945:

    # "His voice breaks."
    "他的声音哽咽了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24340
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2d763e7a:

    # lost_soldier "All is lost. The beast people ambushed our army at dusk, the troops are dead or routed."
    lost_soldier "一切都完了。那些兽人黄昏时分伏击了我们的军队，士兵们要么全军覆没，要么溃不成军。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24342
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_275764d3:

    # kuro "Curses!!! What is the High Priest's plan after this? Why did he send you to me?" with vpunch
    kuro "该死！！！大祭司接下来还有什么计划？他为什么派你来找我？" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24344
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c14078b1:

    # lost_soldier "The High Priest and the Lord Commander... They're dead."
    lost_soldier "大祭司和领主指挥官……他们都死了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24346
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a97acac8:

    # lost_soldier "I saw the madness with my own eyes. The trees came alive and crushed the High Priest to a bloody pulp. Their roots ripped the Lord Commander apart."
    lost_soldier "我亲眼目睹了那场疯狂。树木仿佛活了过来，将大祭司碾成了血肉模糊的肉泥。它们的根须将领主指挥官撕成了碎片。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24348
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_55a19e18:

    # kuro "Seven Hells!"
    kuro "七层地狱！"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24350
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_5b2865ea:

    # lost_soldier "I had not yet donned my armor and I managed to flee, but none of the knights did. It was a massacre."
    lost_soldier "我当时还没来得及穿戴盔甲就逃走了，但那些骑士一个也没能活下来。那是一场屠杀。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24352
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_6d7605a8:

    # kuro "But the First army is... Was... The bulk of our Force. The beast people now have a clear way to the city. They could storm the walls within a fortnight."
    kuro "但第一军……曾经是……我们兵力的主力。兽人现在已经可以畅通无阻地进入城内。他们两周之内就能攻破城墙。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24354
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_58c31d62:

    # lost_soldier "Not even Arios could protect us... The beast people, they... They..."
    lost_soldier "就连阿瑞俄斯也保护不了我们……那些兽人，他们……他们……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24359
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_01f79ae4:

    # "The man faints, falling flat on his face. Kurohime doesn't notice, already lost in her thoughts."
    "男人昏了过去，脸朝下摔倒在地。黑姬没有注意到，她已经沉浸在自己的思绪中。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24361
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_c2b46ea8:

    # kuro "This is terrible news. When the citizens get word of this, as they inevitably will in the next hours, we'll have riots on our hands..."
    kuro "这是个糟糕的消息。民众肯定会在接下来的几个小时内得知此事，届时我们将面临骚乱……"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24363
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_a2f70eae:

    # "She turns to you."
    "她转向你。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24365
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_0f34ec4c:

    # kuro "Our conversation will have to wait, [MC.name]."
    kuro "我们的谈话得以后再说了，[MC.name]。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24367
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_82cf5827:

    # "She looks about to add something, but surrounded as she is by her retinue, she stops in her tracks."
    "她似乎想补充些什么，但被随从簇拥着，便停住了脚步。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24369
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_068deeed:

    # kuro "You may go."
    kuro "你可以走了。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24375
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_98fc536f:

    # "As you leave the Palace, you hear a sound that makes your heart skip a bit."
    "当你离开宫殿时，你听到一个声音，让你的心跳漏了一拍。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24379
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_ec6d56fc:

    # "It's the city bells, all ringing at once."
    "那是城市钟声，同时响起。"

# game/BKchapter3.rpy:24384
translate chinese_simplified c3_ending_2bafff68:

    # "War is coming to Zan."
    "赞恩即将迎来战争。"

